var e={selector:{label:`Dooro luuqadda`},verdict:{headline:`Alberta waxay dib u sawiraysaa khariidaddeeda doorashada.`,p_what:`Mar mar gobolku wuxuu dib u sawiraa riding-yadiisa — aagagga maxalliga ah ee mid kastaa doorto hal MLA. Halka khadadku ku dhacaan ayaa go'aamiya cidda aad la codeyso, iyo cidda kaaga matala golaha sharci dejinta.`,p_split:`Markan, guddida dib-u-sawirka samaynaysay way kala qaybsantay. Waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo iska tartamaya — hubintaniyuna labadaba way tijaabinaysaa.`,p_question:`Labada khariidadood waxaynu u tijaabinnay hal su'aal: mid kasta ma loo qaabeeyey si xisbi loo doorbido — xitaa haddii aanay qofna ula jeedin inuu sidaas sameeyo?`,p_answer:`Labada midkood waa. Kan kale wuxuu u eg yahay mid caadi ah.`,p_howfar:`Kombuyuutar ayaa si bakhtiyaanasiib ah u sawiray 1.01 milyan oo nooc oo sharci ah oo khariidadda ah. Labada khariidadood ee dhabta ah midkood ayaa hal dhinac uga janjeedha dhammaantood marka laga reebo qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000, xagga UCP. Tan kale waxay ku jirtaa xadka caadiga ah.`,aside_pre:`Waxaad odhan kartaa khariidad sidaas u eg `,aside_post:`. Ereygaasi macno sharci ma laha Kanada, sidaa darteed uma isticmaalno sidii gunaanad. Waxaynu ku tusaynaa waxa khariidaddu sameyso; adiga ayaa xukma. Lakabyada qoto dheer — waxa sharcigu dhab ahaan rabo, iyo si sax ah sida aan tijaabada u sameynay — eeg `,box_heading:`Waxa aan dhihi karno iyo waxa aan dhihi karin`,box_can_1:`Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay ka baxsan tahay waxa 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah soo saaraan, jihada UCP loo doorbidayo.`,box_can_2:`Afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda xisbiyeed oo dhammu waxay tilmaamayaan isla jihada.`,box_cant_1:`In la-taliye kasta tan ula jeeday — hubintu waxay akhrida natiijooyinka, ma aha niyada.`,box_cant_2:`In khariidaddu "tahay" qaybsi siyaasadeed — taasi maaha qayb uu sharciga Kanada aqoonsado.`,box_cant_3:`Sida maxkamadi u xukumi laheyd, ama waxa guddidu dooran doonto.`,law_link:`Sharci`,methods_link:`Hababka`},why_redrawn:{heading:`Sababta tani u dhacdo — iyo sababta ay kuu taabato`,p1:`Alberta waxa loo qaybiyey 87 riding. Mid kastaa wuxuu doortaa hal MLA oo aada golaha sharci dejinta. Riding-kaagu wuxuu go'aamiyaa cidda qofkaasi yahay, xaafadaha lagugu daro, iyo cidda welwelkooda MLA-gaagu marka hore maqlo.`,p2:`Khadadku ma joogto. Markii ay dadku guuraan oo magaalooyinku koraan, riding-yada qaarkood waxay ku dhammaadaan codbixiyayaal aad uga badan kuwa kale, sidaa darteed gobolku wuxuu khariidadda dib u sawiraa dhowr sano kasta si uu u sii haysto inay si dhow u sinnaadaan. Guddi la-taliyeyaal ah ayaa sawira, oo ka shaqeeya shuruuc sharci lagu dejiyay: degmooyinku waa inay dadnimo u dhow yihiin, mid noqdaan, oo bulshooyinka dhabta ah si wadajir ah u hayaan markii ay awoodi karaan.`,p3:`Kaasi waa habraaca caadiga ah. Markan wuu jabay. La-taliyayaashu ma heshiin karin, waxayna u kala qaybsameen laba kooxood, mid kastaa wuxuu lahaa khariidaddiisa. Markaas guddi MLA-yo ah ayaa labadaba khariidadood dib u dhigay oo bilaabay inay sawiraan mid u gaar ah, oo ka sii weyn. In guddi sharci dejineed uu sidaas guddida uga gudbo waa wax naadir ah.`,p4:`Khad ku yaal khariidad wuxuu go'aamiyaa cidda codkeedu wax u taro. Wuxuu codbixiyayaasha bulsho wadajir u hayn karaa, ama ku kala firdhin karaa dhowr degmo halka tiradoodu aanay wax badan ku darin. Wuxuu tartan qaar dhow ka dhigi karaa qaar kalena ka fogeyn karaa gacanta. Midna kuma muuqato dusha sare; waxa go'aamiya halka xudduuduhu ku dhacaan.`},two_maps:{heading:`Laba khariidadood — iyo cidda sawiratay`,p1:`Markii guddidu kala qaybsantay, ma aysan soo saarin hal khariidad oo lagu lifaaqay diidmo. Waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo dhammaystiran oo iska tartamaya. Labaduba waa sharci. Kaliya waxay khadadka si kala duwan u sawiraan.`,p2:`Guddida xudduuduhu wuxuu leeyahay shan xubnood. Garsoore Madaxa ah ee Alberta wuxuu magacaabaa guddoomiyaha — kursiga dhexdhexaadka ah, oo halkan uu hayo Dallas K. Miller, garsoore hore oo Court of King's Bench. Xisbiga xukunka hayaa wuxuu magacaabaa laba xubnood; mucaaridkuna wuxuu magacaabaa laba.`,p3:`Guddidan waxay u kala qaybsantay saddex iyo laba. Guddoomiyaha iyo labada xubnood ee mucaaridku magacaabay ayaa taageeray hal khariidad — warbixinta inta badan, maxaa yeelay inta badan guddidu way saxiixday. Labada xubnood ee dawladdu magacaabay ayaa taageeray kan kale — warbixinta laga yar yahay.`,p4:`Khariidadda hubintu calaamadeyso inay tahay tan ugu sii jihaysan waa warbixinta laga yar yahay — tan ay sawireen labada xubnood ee dawladdu magacaabay. Hubintu ma muujin karto inay sidaas ula jeedeen, mana isku daydo. Waxay muujisaa waxa khariidaddu sameyso.`,p5:`Khariidadda jaldiga ee bogga sare waxay kuu oggolaanaysaa inaad adiga is barbar dhigto. Iska beddel labada soo jeedin iyo khariidadda maanta, hel riding-kaaga, oo daawo xaafadaha la isugu daro ama la kala qaybiyo.`,p6:`Guddi MLA-yo ah ayaa tan iyo markaas labada khariidadood dib u dhigay si ay u sawiraan mid u gaar ah, oo la filayo dabayaaqada 2026 — dhaqdhaqaaq uu bogganu ka eego bogga Sharciga. Labadan waxay sii ahaanayaan kiiska tijaabada ee ugu cad ee hubinta, isla tijaabooyinkana waxay ku dabaqi doonaan wax kasta oo guddidu soo saarto.`},disclaimer:{text:`AI ayaa turjumay boggan. Qaar ka mid ah ayaa weli ku soo bixi kara Ingiriisi inta turjumaadduhu socdaan. Haddii aad aragto khalad ama aad jeclaan lahayd inaad ka caawiso turjumaadda mashruucan, fadlan %s.`,link_label:`nala soo xidhiidh`,word_count:`Si aad u qiyaasto cabbirka: qoraalka Ingiriisiga ahi waa qiyaastii {count} eray. Waad qaadan kartaa dhammaantii ama qayb keliya. Inta badan shaqadu waa saxidda khaladaad yaryar oo mashiinku sameeyay, ma aha turjumaad eber laga bilaabo.`},epigraph:{heading:`Sida loo akhriyo khariidaddan`,reader:`Dhulku ma codeeyo. Midabaynta khariidadda sidan oo kale waxay kaliya ka dhigaysaa Alberta miyiga inay u muuqato mid ka weyn inta ay dhab ahaantii tahay. Dhulka madhan ka tag isagoo madhan.`,reader_label:`akhriste`,author_p1:`Caddaalad — taasina waa waxa khariidaddu sameyso si sax ah. Waxaa laga dhisay joomatari iyo tirooyin ay Elections Alberta lahaan tahay, oo ah heerka kaliya ee ay hayaan: imisa qof ayaa ka codeeyay aag kasta oo codbixin, iyo sidee. Midabku wuxuu ku socdaa heer u dhexeeya labada xisbi, qoto-dheeradiisuna waxay raacaysaa tirada dadka — taasina waa sababta magaalooyinku u dhalaalaan, miyiga furanna u sii dhalaalo mid khafiif ah.`,author_p2:`Dhulka galbeed ka xiga Ponoka waa caddaan saafi ah: ma jiro xarun codbixin, ma jiro qof la diiwaangeliyay inuu halkaas ku noolyahay ama ka codeeyay. Wuxuu u madhan yahay si sax ah sababta oo ah dhulku ma codeeyo. Ujeeddadu ma aha in la fasiro xogta, ee kaliya in loo daayo inay ku hadasho heerka lagu duubay — iyo in lagaaga tago mid wax yar ka caqli badan intii aad u timid.`,author_label:`qoraaga`,ethic:`Taasi waa ballanqaadka ka dambeeya hubinta oo dhan: khariidee nidaamka, oo u daa xogta inay isu hadasho — wax ka badan inta ay ogolaato maaha.`},opener:{heading:`Yaa loogu talagalay?`,body:`Innaga. Innaga oo dhan. Dadka miyiga ah, dadka magaalada, kuwa xiisaha leh, khabiirada, saxafiyiinta, qareennada, cilmibaadhayaasha, siyaasiyiinta — innaga oo dhan. Maxaa yeelay way na saameysaa innaga oo dhan. Hadday tahay aad jeceshahay xisbiga xukunka haya iyo haba yaraatee, waxa ay guddida kala qaybsantay soo saartay marna hore looma samayn. Waxa nasiibsiisay fursad aan ku eegno mishiinka gudaha sida aanan hore awoodi karin. Hadda waxaynu dejin karnaa heer cabbir oo aasaasi ah — silsilad imtixaano ah, oo wax kasta oo soo socda lagu cabbiri karo. Aan ku tuso waxa aan helay.`},stakes:{q1:{heading:`Khariidadda la soo jeediyay ma waa qaybsi siyaasadeed (gerrymander)?`,body:`"Gerrymander" ma aha erey ay maxkamadaha Kanada isticmaalaan, hubintanina uma adeegsato sidii xukun. Waxa hubintu sheegi karto waa mid ka cidhiidhi badan oo xaqiiqo ah: afar ka mid ah shanta imtixaan ee qaab-dhismeedka ee ay socodsiiso ayaa calaamadeeya <em>soo jeedinta laga yar yahay</em>, midna ma calaamadayso beddelka kale (<em>soo jeedinta inta badan</em>); imtixaanka shanaad waa dhexdhexaad labadaba. In qaabkaasi gaadho heerka waxa dadku si aan rasmi ahayn ugu jeedaan "gerrymander" waa go'aan ay hubintu uga tagto akhristaha.`,footnote:`Magacyada "inta badan" iyo "laga yar yahay" waxay ka yimaadeen kala qaybsanaan 3–2 oo ka dhex dhacday Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada (oo uu guddoominayay Garsoore Miller), oo soo saartay laba soo jeedin oo iska soo horjeeda halkii ay ka soo bixi lahayd talo keliya. Golaha Sharci dejinta ayaa labadaba dib u dhigay oo dib-u-qaybinta u gudbiyay guddi ka kooban lix xubnood oo MLA ah (xubnaha golaha sharci dejinta gobolka) oo uu guddoominayo Brandon Lunty (MLA UCP ah); guddiga waxa uu kormeerayaa Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah oo ka kooban afar qof — laba uu magacaabay Ra'iisul Wasaaraha (Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie), laba uu magacaabay Hogaamiyaha Mucaaridka (Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson) — oo loo xilsaaray inay soo saaraan soo jeedin cusub oo 91 kursi ah ka hor inta aan la gaarin xilliga kama-dambaysta ah ee Noofembar 2026.`},q2:{heading:`Maxay "gerrymander" ka tartaa sharciga Kanada?`,body:`Macno gaar ah uma jiro. Imtixaanka Kanada waa kala duwan yahay: in xudduudaha siiyaan codbixiyayaasha <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em> sida ku cad qaybta 3 ee Axdiga Xuquuqda. Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waxay kor u qaaddaa su'aalo dhab ah oo ku saabsan halbeegga matalaadda waxtarka leh; kaliya garsoore ayaa si gunaanad ah uga jawaabi kara, weligiina ma jiro mid waydiiyay.`},q3:{heading:`Maxaa khatar ah ee ku saabsan dadka Alberta?`,body:`Marka codka gobolka uu yahay 50/50, cabbirrada hubintu waxay soo jeedinta laga yar yahay meeleeyaan meel qaab-dhismeed ahaan xad-dhaaf ah: in ka yar 100 khariidad oo ka mid ah 1.01 milyan khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo isbarbardhig loo isticmaalo ayaa soo saara nooca isle'egta kursiyada. Isle'egtaasi waxay muhiim u tahay maxaa yeelay aqlabiyad 60-ka-89 ah waxay ka tagtaa mucaarid astaan keliya ah waxayna xaqiiqo ahaan ka dhowrsan tahay is-khilaafka gudaha — ma aha sababtoo ah ay ka gudbayso heer gaar ah (Golaha Alberta ma laha xeer saddex-meelood-laba ah; isla awoodaha habraaca ayaa loo hayaa aqlabiyad fudud). In jiidashada soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay weyn tahay si ay xisbi gaadhsiiso heerka 60 kursi ee qaybinta codka <em>aan ahayn</em> 50/50 waa su'aal aanay hubintani imtixaamin weli. In isle'egtaasi la aqbali karo waa su'aal loogu talagalay dadka Alberta, maaha hubintan.`},cta_law:`Akhri macnaha sharciga →`,cta_methods:`Eeg sida aan u tijaabinnay →`,scorecard_h:`Kaarka buundooyinka`,scorecard_fig_alt:`Shaxda dhibcaha kala firdhisan: farqiga waxtarka wuxuu ku yaal dhidibka jiifa, tirada imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedka ee lagu dhacay waxay ku taal dhidibka taagan. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 waxay ku urursan yihiin geeska hoose-bidix ee ammaanka ah. Khariidadda inta yar ee 2026 keligeed ayay ku taal dhinaca sare-midig, iyadoo saaran khadka afar-ka-mid-ah-shan ee qaab-dhismeedka, waxyar ka hor xariiqda go'go'an ee farqiga waxtarka ee ~4.1%. Khariidadda 2019 waxa lagu calaamadeeyay 0 ka mid ah 4 la sameeyay: imtixaanka aagga Calgary marna laguma samayn.`,scorecard_fig_caption:`Labada waddo hal sawir. Jiif: inta ay tirada caddaaladda xisbiyeed u janjeedho (midig = UCP aad loo doorbiday). Taag: shanta imtixaan ee caddaaladda qaab-dhismeedka intee ayay khariidaddu ku dhacdaa. Hoose-bidix waa geeska ammaanka ah ee habraacyada dhexdhexaadka ahi si joogto ah ugu dhacaan; sare-midig waa gobolka qiimaha ka baxsan. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 iyo inta badan ee 2026 waxay ku jiraan geeska ammaanka ah (khariidadda 2019 waxa lagu qiimeeyay afar ka mid ah imtixaannada; imtixaanka aagga Calgary marna laguma samayn). Inta yar ee 2026 keligeed ayay ku jirtaa gobolka qiimaha ka baxsan.`,scorecard_intro:`Laba cabbir oo madax-bannaan ayaa lagu dabaqay labada khariidadood iyada oo la isticmaalayo isla xadadka horay loo diiwaan-geliyay. Qaab-dhismeedku wuxuu adeegsadaa kaliya shaqalka khadadka — ma jirto natiijo doorasho. Tirooyinku waxay tijaabiyaan sida xariiqdu codadka kursiyaal ugu beddesho. Labada waddo waxay gaaraan isla gunaanad.`,scorecard_close:`Laba cabbir oo madax-bannaan, hal jawaab. Isuduwistaani waa calaamadda keligeed ugu xooggan ee hubinta.`},top_callouts:{gerrymander_lead:`Khariidadda laga yar yahay ma waa qaybsi siyaasadeed?`,gerrymander_body:`Dhibcaha wadajirka ah ee eexda xisbiyeed ee hubinta, khariidadda inta yar ee guddidu waxay ku jirtaa dabada aadka u fog ee 1,010,000 khariidadood oo isbarbardhig dhexdhexaad ah oo xisaab-hab (algorithm) lagu sawiray — qiyaastii 69 ka mid ah ayaa gaadha saamigeeda kursiyada marka codku siman yahay, suurtagalnimada muuqaalkeeda guud ee sawir dhexdhexaad ahna waa ugu badnaan qiyaastii 1&nbsp;ka&nbsp;mid&nbsp;ah&nbsp;568,000. Khariidadda inta badan si fiican ayay ugu jirtaa xadka caadiga ah.`,tldr_label:`Soo koobid`,tldr_p1:`Guddida dib-u-qaybinta ee Alberta waxay u kala qaybsantay 3&ndash;2 sannadkii 2026 oo waxay soo saartay laba khariidadood oo kala duwan. Dawladda ayaa labadaba dib u dhigtay oo dib-u-qaybintii u gudbisay guddi lix xubnood oo MLA ah (guddiga Lunty), oo la filayo inay warbixintooda soo saaraan Noofembar 2026. Midkoodna khariidadaha guddida ma aha sharci.`,tldr_p2:`Hubintani labada khariidadood ee guddida si isku mid ah ayay u tijaabisay, iyadoo la barbar dhigayo 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar ku sawiray faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta. Soo jeedinta inta badan waxay u egtahay khariidadaha uu sawir dhexdhexaad ahi si joogto ah u soo saaro — waxay ku gudubtaa imtixaan kasta oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay. Soo jeedinta inta yar waxay dhaaftaa afar ka mid ah shan imtixaan oo qaab-dhismeed, marka codku siman yahay 50/50-na qiyaastii 69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa siiya kursiyo le'eg kuwa ay siiso. Suurtagalnimada in habraac dhexdhexaad ahi soo saaro muuqaalkeeda caddaaladda guud waa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000 — tiradaasina waa saqaf si ula kac ah taxaddar u leh, ma aha qiyaas sax ah. Hal cabbir, farqiga waxtarka, wuxuu ku dhacay waxyar ka hooseeya xariiqda hubintu hore u dejisay; waxa loo soo sheegay sidii mid aan gaadhin.`,tldr_p3:`Hubinta waxay cabbirtaa natiijooyinka, ma aha niyadda. Marka guddiga Lunty uu sii daayo khariidadiisa, hubintani waxay ku dabaqi doontaa isla imtixaanada.`,tldr_footer:`Shuruudaha been-abuurka ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay iyo ballamaha laga noqonayo waxay ku jiraan %s.`,tldr_footer_link:`Ka-noqoshooyinka iyo Saxitaannada`},head:{title:`Khariidadda Doorashada Alberta, oo La Hubiyay`,meta_description:`Guddida xudduudaha Alberta ee 2026 waxay gudbisay laba khariidadood. Mid waxay u egtahay caadi; tan kale waxay UCP u janjeedhaa in ka badan ku dhowaad dhammaan 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah. Khariidadda guddiga ee labadaba beddelaysa halkan ayaa lagu qiimeeyaa imtixaanno hore loo xidhay.`},nav:{skip_to_content:`U gudub waxa ku jira`,home_aria:`Ku noqo sare`,theme_aria:`Beddel qaab madow/iftiin`,theme_title:`Beddel qaabka madow`,nav_aria:`Fur tusmada`,drawer_top:`↑ Sare`,route_story:`Sheeko`,route_law:`Sharci`,route_methods:`Hababka`,stakes:`Khataraha`,findings:`Natiijooyinka`,history:`Taariikhda`,reform:`Isbeddel`,group_overview:`Guud`,group_audit:`Hubinta`,group_context:`Macnaha`,group_forward:`Hore u socoshada`,group_apparatus:`Qalabka`,why:`Muxuu muhiim u yahay?`,map:`Khariidadda hal jaleeco`,split:`Sida guddidu u kala qaybsantay`,litmus:`Imtixaanka Caddaynta ee 1,010,000-Khariidadood`,crack_pack:`Jeexitaan, urursi, miirid`,for_you:`Maxay tani kaa la macno tahay`,impact:`Saamaynta dhulka`,gerrymanders:`Qaybsiyaal siyaasadeed oo cad`,history_full:`Taariikhda qaybsiga siyaasadeed`,canada:`Kanada way kala duwan tahay`,lunty:`Lunty`,suggestions:`Soo jeedinno isbeddel`,retractions:`Ka noqosho`,references:`Tixraacyo`,technical:`Khayraad farsamo`,feedback:`Dir jawaab-celin`},hero:{h1:`Sharciyo, Caadooyin, iyo Tirakoob: Hubinta Warbixinnada Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta ee 2026`,subtitle:`Guddida Alberta waxay 2026 soo saartay laba khariidadood oo riding ah oo isku tartamaya. Isla imtixaannada ayaan labadaba ku sameeyay, waxaanan weydiiyay hal su'aal: ma u dhaqmaan codbixiyayaasha si isku mid ah?`,badge:`Khariidadaha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta — La daabacay May 2026`,cover_note:`Guji si aad u weyneyso oo aad saddexda khariidadood ee xudduudaha hal mar u wada baadho. Muuqaalka ku dheji oo khariidadaha kala beddel. Xudduuduhu way dhaqaaqaan; codbixiyayaashu meeshooda ayay joogaan. Hoos u dhaadhac si aad u aragto falanqaynta.`,cover_note_1:`Khariidaddani waa albaabka ugu fiican. Guji si aad u weyneyso oo aad u baadho. Badhamada sare waxay kala beddelaan khariidadda inta yar, khariidadda inta badan iyo xudduudaha la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019, ama waxay saddexda isku dul saaraan si aad si sax ah u aragto halka ay ku kala tagaan. <strong>Detail</strong> wuxuu aag codbixin kasta ku midabeeyaa sida dadku u codeeyeen 2023. <strong>Trend</strong> wuxuu ku daraa hadh xisbiyeed degmo kasta (buluug UCP, oranji NDP). <strong>Lines</strong> wuxuu shidaa oo damiyaa xudduudaha. <strong>Find</strong> wuxuu kuu geeyaa riding kasta adigoo magaciisa qoraya.`,cover_note_2:`Muuqaalka xidh oo khariidadaha kala beddel. Daawo xuduud dhaqaaqaysa, iyadoo codbixiyayaasha hoosteeda ku jira ay meeshooda joogaan. Su'aasha oo dhan, hal dhaqdhaqaaq.`,cover_note_3:`Markaad dhammayso baadhista, hoos u dhaadhac si aad u aragto soo koobidda. Falanqaynta farsameed ee dhammaystiran waxay ku jirtaa qaybta Lifaaqa Farsamada. Dhammaan xogtu waxay ka timid faylasha khariidadaha (shapefiles) rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta iyo diiwaanno kale oo dawladeed iyo kuwo il-furan ah.`,image_alt:`Khariidadda degmooyinka doorashada Alberta — soo jeedinta inta yar ee guddida, oo lagu midabeeyay codkii 2023`,map_hint:`Guji si aad si is dhexgal ah u baadho`,btn_title:`Guji si aad u furto khariidadda is dhexgalka ah`,btn_aria:`Guji si aad si is dhexgal ah u baadho`},boundary:{heading:`Waxa hubintani ku sheegi karto iyo waxa aysan kuu sheegi karin`,can_1:`Joomatariga khariidadda laga yar yahay waxa uu ka gudbaa 4 ka mid ah 5 xadadka qaab-dhismeedka ee horay loo diiwaan-geliyay <em>iyada oo aan la isticmaalin xog doorasho oo kasta</em>. Shanaadka (xajinta) waa dhexdhexaad. Inta badan waxay ka gudubtaa 0 ka mid ah 4-da dhacaya. Imtixaanadaasi waxay cabbiraan sifooyinka khadadka xudduudaha laftooda — qaabka degmada, xajinta dawladda hoose, faafinta dadka — oo waxay gaaraan gunaanadka ka hor inta aan cod la tirin.`,can_2:`Si gaar ah, marka xogta doorashada la keeno, khariidadda inta yar waxay ku jirtaa centile-ka 99.99 ee 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo isbarbardhig ah oo xisaab-hab lagu sawiray, kuwaas oo lagu waafajiyay dheelitirka dadka iyo isku-xidhnaanta (tijaabadu waxay qasbaysaa labadaas shuruudood, ma aha shuruud kasta oo sharci ah sida danaha bulshada). Qiyaastii 69 ka mid ah 1.01 milyan ee khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa gaadha isla saamiga kursiyada marka codku siman yahay. Marka labada kanaal ee falanqaynta la wada tiriyo, suurtagalnimada muuqaalkan ee sawir dhexdhexaad ah waa ugu badnaan qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000. Laba qalab oo falanqayn — joomatari iyo tirakoob — ayaa gaadha isla gunaanadka, oo doorbida isla xisbiga; xadka wadajirka ahi waa soo koobidda ku-tiirsanaanta tixgelisa ee isku-imaatinkaas, ma aha afar imtixaan oo madax-bannaan oo isku raacay.`,can_3:`Saddex ka mid ah qaababka ku jira soo jeedinta inta yar waxa qoraal ahaan calaamadeeyay Guddoomiyaha Guddida, Garsoore Miller, jawaabta warbixinta inta badan ay siisay inta yar (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, bogagga 62–63). Imtixaannada hubinta waxa la sameeyay iyadoo aan waxba laga ogeyn calaamadihiisa, waxayna soo saaraan isla gobollada. Maadaama Garsoore Miller uu guddoomiyay guddida oo uu saxeexay warbixinta inta badan, kuwani waa dhaleeceynta guddoomiyaha laftiisa — waxay xoojinayaan natiijada, ma aha qalab saddexaad oo si buuxda u madax-bannaan — hase yeeshee in imtixaannada indhaha la' ee hubintu ay ku dhacaan isla gobollada weli waa wax la yaab leh.`,cant_1:`Hubintu ma <strong>caddayn karto</strong> in la-taliye kasta uu ula jeeday saamaynta xisbiyeed ee ay cabbirayso. Joomatariga xudduudu ma muujin karo niyad.`,cant_2:`Hubintu <strong>ma saadaaliso</strong> waxa guddiga Lunty doorto, waxa ay noqonayso doorashada Noofembar 2026, ama sida dadka Alberta uga falcelin doonaan.`,cant_3:`Hubintu <strong>ma saadaaliso</strong> sida maxkamadi ugu xukumi laheyd haddii doodda Axdiga lagu soo qaado mid kasta oo soo jeedinta ah.`,cant_4:`Hubintu <strong>ma</strong> sheegto in xadka u adkaysta ku-tiirsanaanta ee qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000 (p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>) uu yahay suurtagalnimada in qaybsi siyaasadeed (gerrymander) dhacay. Tiradaasi waa suurtagalnimada dabada ee joomatariga inta yar marka loo eego male-awaal dhexdhexaad ah oo xisaab-hab ah. Waa caddayn muujinaysa in male-awaalka dhexdhexaadka ahi aanu macquul ahayn. Ma aha suurtagalnimo dambe (posterior) oo ku saabsan ujeeddo xisbiyeed — su'aashaasi waxay u baahan tahay caddayn uu joomatarigu bixin karin.`,cant_5:`Hubintu <strong>uma sheegto</strong> codbixiye kasta oo gaar ah qaabka uu qaadan lahaa ama waxa uu xogtan ka qaban lahaa. Doorashada waa adiga.`},editorial_intro:{heading:`Waa maxay dib-u-qaybinta, oo maxay muhiim u tahay`,p1:`Codbixiye kasta oo Alberta ku nool wuxuu ku nool yahay <em>degmo doorasho</em> — qayb ka mid ah gobolka oo dooran hal qof oo aada golaha sharci dejinta. Waxa jira 87 degmo. Degmo kasta waxay dooratta hal MLA. Marka aad doorasho gobol ku codeyso, waxaad doorato MLA-ga degmadaada. Dadka badan ee Alberta, kaasi waa xidhiidhka oo dhan ee golaha sharci dejinta: hal MLA, hal degmo, hal cod.`,p2:`Khadadka degmadaasi ma joogto. Dadku way guuraan, xaafadaha way koraan, aagagga miyiga way yaraadaan, magaalooyinku way fidaan. Sideed ilaa toban sano kasta, Alberta waa in ay dib u sawirto khadadka si degmo kasta ay u noqoto cabbir saxda ah oo ay ka tarjun karto sida dadka Alberta hadda u nool yihiin. Hay'adda samaysa dib-u-sawirka waa <em>Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> — guddi madax bannaan oo ka kooban garsoorayaal, qareeno, iyo xubno dadweyne ah, ma aha siyaasiyiin.`,p3:`Tani waa habraaca caadiga ah. Markan, habraaca caadigu wuxuu soo saaray wax aan caadi ahayn. Shanta xubnood ee guddidu waxay u kala qaybsanteen 3 ilaa 2 cidda khariidadu ay u muuqato, oo halkii ay ku heshiin lahaayeen hal talo waxay soo saareen laba: <em>soo jeedinta inta badan</em> (oo ay taageeraan saddex la-taliye) iyo <em>soo jeedinta laga yar yahay</em> (oo ay taageeraan laba). Labadaba waxay ku saaran yihiin miiska. Abriil 21, 2026 Golaha Sharci dejintu wuxuu ansixiyay Mooshinka Dawladda 37, oo labadaba dhinac dhigay oo dib-u-qaybinta u gudbiyay Guddi Gaar ah oo Doorasho oo ka kooban lix MLA oo uu guddoominayo Brandon Lunty (MLA UCP ah). Guddiga waxa uu kormeerayaa Guddi Madax-bannaan oo Talo-bixin ah oo gaar ah oo afar qof ah, oo lagu aasaasay isla mooshinkaas, oo loo xilsaaray inay soo saaraan khariidad cusub oo 91 kursi ah; guddiga waa in uu warbixintiisa u gudbiyaa golaha sharci dejinta ka hor Noofembar 2, 2026.`,p4:`Sababta ay kuugu muhiim u tahay: khadadku waxay go'aamiyaan cidda MLA-gaaga noqonayso. Waxay go'aamiyaan xaafadaha, magaalooyinka, iyo welwelka la matalo wadajir. Haddii magaaladaadu u kala qaybsanto afar MLA halkii ay ka noqon lahayd hal, hal matalaadi ma masuuli ka noqonayo magaalada oo dhan. Haddii bulshadaada — magaalo yar, gobol miyi ah, bartamaha magaalada — ay u kala qaybsanto degmooyin, codkaaga go'aannada gobolka ayaa lagu khafiifin. Khariidaddu sidoo kale waxay qaabaysaa xisbiga noqon kara dawladda, iyo cabbirka ay ku noqdaan. Natiijada gaarka ah ee hubinta (in soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay ku jirto heer qaab-dhismeed daran) waa sababta aad bogan u akhrineyso, laakiin su'aasha ballaaran way ka hor mar tahay oo waxay khusaysaa wareeg kasta oo dib-u-qaybin ah: ma khadadku waxay ka tarjumayaan sida dadka Alberta u nool yihiin, mise waxay qaabaynayaan siyaasadda dabada timaada?`,p5:`Inta bogga ka harsan waxay ku marto waxa labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay dhab ahaan sameeyaan.`,key_terms_lead:`Ereyo muhiim ah qaybtan — guji si aad u akhrido:`},editorial_reflect:{heading:`U dhexeyn: Waxa tani u tarayso adiga iyo bulshadaada`,intro_p1:`Diiwaanku halkan ayuu ku hakanayaa. Xisbiga kursiyo hela ama waaya waa dhibaatada golaha sharci-dejinta — ma aha meesha aad khariidadahan ku dareemayso. Waxaad ku dareemaysaa saddex su'aalood oo la taaban karo oo ku saabsan degmadaada:`,intro_q1:`Halkee MLA-gaagu degenyahay?`,intro_q2:`Ma maalgashan yahay bulshadaada?`,intro_q3:`Baahiyaha madaxa magaalada ee degmada ma ka adkaan doonaan dabaheeda miyiga?`,intro_p2:`Qaab kasta oo kale — faa'iido xisbiyeed, heer aqlabiyad weyn, heer tirakoob aan caadi ahayn — ugu dambeyntii waxay dib ugu tagaan saddexdaas. Shanta jaranjaroo hoose waxay ku marayaan sida khariidad kasta oo la soo jeediyay uga jawaabayso, shan heer.`,you_h:`Adiga.`,you_p:`Degmadaada doorashadu waxay go'aamisaa cidda kaa matasha golaha sharci-dejinta. Hadda waxaad ku nooshahay mid ka mid ah 87 degmo. Labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay hoostooda waxaa laga yaabaa inaad ku noolaato mid kale — laga yaabee MLA kale, laga yaabee mid ku xidhan bulshooyin deris ah oo kala duwan. Haddii aanad garanayn degmada aad hadda ku jirto, ama cidda MLA-gaagu yahay, kaligaa ma tihid: dadka Alberta intooda badani ma sheegi karaan magaca MLA-gooda. Laakiin khadadka xudduuduhu ma aha wax maskaxeed. Waxay go'aamiyaan lambarka taleefanka ee ku dheggan darbiga xafiiska wakiilkaaga maxalliga ah, codsiga xaafadeed ee magacaaga lagu daro, iyo walaaca uu MLA-gaagu marka hore maqlo. Sahamiyaha khariidadda ee boggan — bulshadaada magaceeda ku raadi — wuxuu muujinayaa degmada aad ku jirto soo jeedin kasta. Haddii degmadaadu isbeddesho, wakiilkaaguna wuu isbeddelaa — xidhiidhka wakiilkaaga iyo bulshadaaduna wuu la isbeddelaa.`,community_h:`Bulshadaada.`,community_p:`Bulshooyinkuna ma aha wax maskaxeed oo keliya. Aagga uu dugsi sare adeego, rugta ganacsiga, bulsho diimeed, urur xaafadeed — kuwani waa kooxo dad dhab ah oo wadaaga walaac maxalli ah. Marka xariiq xuduudeed dhex marto, ma jiro hal MLA oo mas'uul ka ah dhammaantood. Casing 1 waa kiiska ugu daran: Airdrie, hal magaalo oo afar qaybood loo kala gooyay, iyadoo aan jirin hal wakiil oo ka masuul ah. Isla arrintaas ayaa dhacda meel kasta oo magaalo yar, xaafad, ama bulsho dano wadaag ah oo la aqoonsan yahay la kala qaybiyo — inta kala-qaybintu weynaato, ayaa matalaaddu daciifaysaa. (Cabbirka ballaadhan ee sida aaminka ah ee khariidad kastaa guud ahaan u raacdo khadadka dawladda hoose, labada soo jeedinba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada — Casing 5 ayaa diiwaangelisa natiijadii baabba'day.)`,municipality_h:`Dawladda hoose ee magaaladaada.`,municipality_p:`Marka magaalo loo kala goyo matalaayaal badan, awoodeeda ay ku gorgortamayso go'aamada gobolku way daciifiso. Golaha magaalada oo dalbanaya maalgelin gaadiidka dadweynaha, guddida iskuulada oo gorgortamayso iskuul cusub, duqa magaaladu oo wax ku gorgortamayo balaadhin waddo — mid kasta oo kuwaas ka mid ah si fiican ayuu u socdaa marka magaalada ay tilmaami karto MLA-yo dhowr ah oo ay masuul u yihiin magaalada oo dhan. Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waxay u kala gooysaa woqooyi, bari, iyo dhexe ee Calgary degmooyin badan oo qaababka qaybinta codkooda ay tilmaamayaan <em>urursi</em> (ku urursashada codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi gudaha dhowr kursi oo cadaadis sare leh) oo lagu darayo <em>jeexitaan</em> (u qaybinta codbixiyayaasha xisbiga kale dhowr kursi oo cadaadis hooseeya). In qaabkani uu yahay mid ula kac ah waa su'aal aanay hubintu ka jawaabi karin — joomatariga xudduudu ma muujin karo niyad. Waxa ay sheegi kartaa waa in afarta cabbir ee tirakoobku ay calaamadeeyaan isla degmooyinka ay imtixaanada qaab-dhismeedku calaamadeeyaan, iyo in soo jeedinta kale aanay soo saarin isla farra-saxeexa.`,region_h:`Gobolkaaga.`,region_p1:`Haddii aad ka baxsantahay magaalooyinka Alberta waxaad sida laga yaabo iska ogtahay in wadahadalada siyaasadeed ee ku saabsan xudduudaha had iyo jeer ay magaalooyinka udub-dhexaad ka dhigaan. Cabasho macquul ah, sidaas darteed aan si toos ah u sheegno waxa hubintani sheegayso iyo waxa aanay sheegayn ee ku saabsan Alberta miyiga ah.`,region_p2:`Waxa ay <strong>aysan sheegin</strong>: in Alberta miyiga ah ay leedahay kursiyo aad u badan. EBCA-du waxay u oggolaataa tirooyinka degmada inay ku kala duwanaadaan ilaa 25% si hal MLA miyi aanu ku matalin juquraafi le'eg koonfurta Faransiiska. Maxkamadaha Kanada waxay u arkaan kala-duwanaanshahan inuu sharci yahay. Labada khariidadood ee la soo jeediyay way ilaaliyaan. Waxba hubintani kama beddelayso.`,region_p3:`Waxa ay <strong>sheegayso</strong>: meelo dhowr ah oo soo jeedinta inta yar ka mid ah, bulshooyin miyi ah ayaa loogu xidhay sidii <em>dabada</em> degmo uu xarunta dadkeedu ku yaal magaalo. Mar kale eeg kala-qaybinta Airdrie ee Casing 1, markan dhinaca miyiga ka eeg: afarteeda degmo saddex ka mid ah waxay u fidaan dhul miyi oo kala duwan, mid kastana xarunta dadku waa qaybta magaalada, ma aha dabada miyiga. MLA laga doorto degmo noocaas ah waxay u badan tahay inuu ku noolaado, ka ololeeyo, oo mudnaanta siiyo meesha codadku joogaan — taas oo macnaheedu yahay in bulshooyinka miyiga ah ee hore u lahaa MLA miyi u gaar ah ay noqdaan qaybta dambe ee kursi ay magaalo hoggaamiso. Qaabkani wuxuu ku soo noqnoqdaa soo jeedinta inta yar siyaabo aanu ugu soo noqnoqon soo jeedinta inta badan.`,region_p4:`Hubintu ma soo jeedinayso in laga qaado kursiyo Alberta miyiga ah. Waxay weydiisaa in khadaduhu ay ixtiraamaan bulshooyinka miyiga ah ee kursiyadaasi loogu talagalay inay matalaan, mise juquraafiga miyigu waxa loo isticmaalayaa culayska codadka magaalada lagu nuuji lahaa degmooyin bartamuhu meel kale joogo. Haddii aad ku nooshahay mid ka mid ah dabaha miyiga, su'aasha ah midee khariidadood ah ayaa la dhaqan-geliyay waxay go'aamisaa in MLA-gaagu uu matalo bulshada miyiga ee aad dhab ahaan ku nooshahay, ama degmo magaaleed oo khadkeedu ay ku jirto dhulkaaga.`,province_h:`Gobolkaaga.`,province_p:`Golaha sharci-dejintu waa waxa aad hesho marka aad isku darto jawaabaha degmo kasta ee saddexda su'aalood ee kor ku xusan. Haddii degmooyinka badankoodu ku xidhan yihiin bulshooyin ay MLA-yadoodu dhab ahaan ku nool yihiin, goluhu wuxuu matalaa bulshooyinkaas. Haddii degmooyinka badankoodu leeyihiin dabo miyi ah oo ku xidhan madax magaalo, goluhu wuxuu matalaa madaxyada — dabaduna waxay helaan wixii dareen ah ee ka hadha. Su'aasha xisbiyeed — xisbiga aqlabiyadda hela — waxay ka dambaysaa taas. Su'aasha aqlabiyadda weyn — in xisbi dhaafo 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi, farqi ka dhigaya dawlad mid aan dhab ahaan wax ka gelin xildhibaanno dhinac u wareega, kana tagaya mucaarad aad u yar oo aan sii wadi karin la-xisaabtanka — waxay ka dambaysaa <em>taas</em>. Marka la qiyaaso kala-qaybsanaan gobol oo 50/50 ah, cabbirrada hubintu waxay soo jeedinta inta yar dhigayaan heer qaab-dhismeed oo daran: wax ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1.01 milyan ee khariidadaha isbarbardhigga dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa soo saara nooc isku-dheelitir-la'aan kursiyo oo kan oo kale ah. In isku-dheelitir-la'aantaasi xisbi u gudbiso 60 kursi saamiyada codka ee dadka Alberta dhab ahaan bixiyaan waa su'aal aanay hubintani weli si toos ah u tijaabin — meel bannaan oo daacad ah oo diiwaanka ku jirta. In jawaabta mid ka mid ah su'aalahan ay muhiim ku filan u tahay in wax laga qabto, mar kale, waa su'aal adiga kuu taal.`},editorial_history:{heading:`Macnaha: Taariikh kooban oo ku saabsan qaybsiga siyaasadeed`,p1:`Ereygu waxa uu ka yimid 1812. Guddoomiyaha Massachusetts Elbridge Gerry waxa uu saxeexay khariidad gole-gobol oo degmooyinkeedu ay aad u qalloocayeen si u dhaxasho xisbigiisa oo ay sawir-yaqaan reer Boston mid ka mid ah u sawiray qaab balanbaaliska bahallada — baalal, qoolal, carrabkii kala godan. Sawirka jeesjeesintiisa, <em>Gerry-mander</em>, ayaa hadhay. Qaabkuna wuu hadhay: laba qarni kadib, ereygu wuxuu weli ka dhigan yahay sawiritaanka khadadka doorashada si loo abuuro natiijo xisbiyeed.`,p2:`Ereygu wuu jiraa maxaa yeelay dhibaatadu way jirtaa. Meel kasta oo codbixiyayaashu ka soo doortaan matalayaal degmooyin juquraafi ah, qof baa khadadka sawirta, khadadkana waxa lagu sawiri karaa siyaalo badan. Dalal kala duwan ayaa gaaray jawaabo kala duwan oo ku saabsan cidda sawiri lahayd iyo waxa xaddidi laha.`,p3:`<strong>Mareykanka</strong> waxay u arkaan qaybsiga siyaasadeed dhibaato aysan maxkamadaha federaalku inta badan xallin karin. <em>Rucho v. Common Cause</em> (2019), Maxkamadda Sare ee Mareykanku waxa ay xukuntay in qaybsiga siyaasadeedku yahay "su'aalo siyaasadeed" oo aan la xukumi karin oo maxkamadaha federaalku aysan xallin doonin. Gobolada qaar (California, Michigan) waxa ay ka jawaabeen iyaga oo sameeyay guddiyo madaniyad madax-bannaan si ay khadadkooda u sawiraan; kuwo kale (Texas, North Carolina) waxa ay sii wadeen sawiritaanka khariidadood si cad ugu eexday xisbi, oo ay difaaceen iyaga oo ku saleysan in <em>Rucho</em> uu oggolaado.`,p4:`<strong>Boqortooyada Midowday</strong> waxay isticmaashaa afar Guddiyo Xudduudo oo joogto ah — mid kasta England, Scotland, Wales, iyo Northern Ireland — oo ka kooban garsoorayaal iyo shaqaalaha sare ee dawladda. Waxa ay dib u sawiraan khadadka qiyaastii sideed sano kasta iyaga oo ku saleysan shuruucda go'an (sinaanta dadka, isku xidhnaanta juquraafi, ixtiraamka xudduudaha dawladda hoose). Tan iyo Sharciga Degmooyinka Baarlamaanka 2020 (Parliamentary Constituencies Act 2020), talooyinkooda kama-dambaysta ah waxay si toos ah u dhaqan-galaan iyada oo loo marayo Amar Golaha (Order in Council), iyada oo aan loo baahnayn cod baarlamaaneed — awooddii hore ee Baarlamaanku ku diidi jiray waa la qaaday.`,p5:`<strong>Australiya</strong> waxay shaqada u dirtaa Guddida Doorashada Australia, hay'ad federaal madax-bannaan oo leh awood buuxda labadaba maamulka doorashooyinka iyo xudduudaha. Dib-u-qaybin si toos ah ayuu u dhaca marka tirada kursiyada gobol uu isbeddesho ama todobo sano la soo dhaafay laga bilaabo midkii ugu dambeeyay. Go'aanada La-taliyayaasha waa dib loo eegi karaa sababo habraaceed laakiin sababo xisbiyeed maaha. Sida Boqortooyada Midowday, qaybsiga siyaasadeed sida ay Mareykankii ay yaqaaneen wax la maqlay ma aha.`,p6:`Saddexdan kiis waxay calaamadeeyaan iskala-duwanaanshaha: maxkamadaha aan dhex galin (Mareykanka), guddiyo madax-bannaan oo leh ixtiraam baarlamaanka oo xooggan (Boqortooyada Midowday), iyo hay'ad madax-bannaan oo joogto ah oo leh awood buuxda (Australiya). Kanada waxay ku taallaa meel kale oo kala duwan — taas oo qaybta xigta wax ka qabaneyso.`},glossary:{more_link:`Wax dheeraad ah baro →`,"electoral-district":{term:`Degmada doorashada (ED)`,definition:`Aagga juquraafi ee hal xubin u dooranaya golaha sharci-dejinta gobolka; marka ugu horreysa ka dib waxa badanaa loo soo gaabiyaa "ED". ED kasta waxay leedahay hal MLA. (Ereyga "riding" badanaa waxa loola jeedaa degmooyinka federaalka. Shuruucda Alberta waxay degmada gobolka ugu yeedhaan electoral division.)`},riding:{term:`Riding`,definition:`Kanada gudaheeda, ereygan badanaa waxa loola jeedaa degmo doorasho oo federaal ah. Shuruucda Alberta waxay tan gobolka u dhiganta ugu yeedhaan "electoral division". Boggani wuxuu si isku beddel ah ugu yeedhaa riding, degmo ama qayb doorasho.`},mla:{term:`MLA`,definition:`Member of the Legislative Assembly (Xubinta Golaha Sharci-dejinta): qofka ay hal degmo doorasho u doorato inuu ka matalo golaha sharci-dejinta Alberta.`},ucp:{term:`UCP`,definition:`United Conservative Party (Xisbiga Muxaafidka ee Midoobay), xisbiga gobolka ee maanta xukuma Alberta. Wuxuu dhashay 2017 markii ay midoobeen Progressive Conservatives iyo Wildrose Party, wuxuuna dawladda hayaa tan iyo 2019.`},ndp:{term:`NDP`,definition:`New Democratic Party (Alberta NDP), mucaaradka rasmiga ah ee Alberta maanta. Wuxuu dawladda hayay 2015 ilaa 2019.`},gerrymander:{term:`Gerrymander (qaybsi siyaasadeed)`,definition:`Sawirista xudduudaha doorashada si xisbi faa'iido loo siiyo. Ereygu wuxuu ka yimid khariidad 1812 laga sameeyay Massachusetts. Sharciga Kanada ma laha dembi magacaas leh. Taasi waxay xaddidaysaa waxa maxkamadi ugu yeedhi doonto, ma aha inay dhacdo iyo in kale. Imtixaanka sharci ee ugu dhow waa matalaadda waxtarka leh ee qaybta 3 ee Axdiga.`},cracking:{term:`Jeexitaan (cracking)`,definition:`Farsamo qaybsi siyaasadeed: koox codbixiyayaal ah u kala jeex degmooyin badan si aanay aqlabiyad uga helin midna. Tusaale ahaan, magaalo u qaybi afar riding, codbixiyayaasheeduna mid kasta waa laga badnaan doonaa.`},packing:{term:`Urursi (packing)`,definition:`Farsamo qaybsi siyaasadeed: codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi ku cidhiidhi tiro yar oo degmooyin ah. Xisbigu degmooyinkaas si aad ah ayuu ugu guuleystaa, laakiin wuxuu "khasaariyaa" codad badan, codbixiyayaasha u hadhay ee ku tartama degmooyinka kalena way yaraadaan.`},draining:{term:`Miirid (draining)`,definition:`Ereyga hubintan ee saamaynta ka dhalata jeexitaanka iyo urursiga. Codadka khasaaray ee farsamooyinkaas ka dhasha waxa loo riixaa meelo si istiraatiiji ah loo doortay, halkaas oo ay ku beddelaan dabeecadda siyaasadeed ee degmooyinka doorashada ee u dhow. Qaab-dhigani waa mid hubintu iska leedahay, ma aha fikrad la aqoonsan yahay oo ku jirta cilmiga dib-u-qaybinta. Hubintu way tijaabisaa saamaynta, waxayna heshaa natiijooyin la jaanqaadaya, laakiin waxay u aragtaa baadhitaan bilow ah, ma aha hab la xaqiijiyay.`},anchoring:{term:`Xajin (anchoring)`,definition:`Sida adag ee xudduudaha la soo jeediyay ay u raacaan khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira, sida xadka magaalooyinka iyo xudduudaha magaalooyinka yaryar. Khariidad si adag u xajisan badanaa way ixtiraamtaa khadadkaas. Khariidad si dabacsan u xajisan inta badan way ka leexataa, gaar ahaan meelaha siyaasad ahaan muhiimka ah, taasina waa calaamad digniin qaab-dhismeed.`},"charter-s3":{term:`Qaybta 3 ee Axdiga`,definition:`Qaybta Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha Kanada ee muwaadiniinta u dammaanad qaadda xaqa codbixinta. Maxkamadaha Kanada uma akhriyaan sidii xeer adag oo "hal qof, hal cod" ah, balse sidii xaq loo leeyahay "matalaad waxtar leh."`},"effective-representation":{term:`Matalaad waxtar leh`,definition:`Halbeegga ay maxkamadaha Kanada isticmaalaan marka ay qiimeynayaan xudduudaha doorashada. Macnihiisu waa in codbixiyayaashu yeeshaan cod macno leh. Sinnaanta tirada dadka riding-yadu waa qayb ka mid ah, laakiin sidoo kale waa aqoonsiga xidhiidhka bulshada, juquraafiga iyo matalaadda dadka laga tirada badan yahay. Qoraalka ugu muhiimsan waa Tixraaca Saskatchewan ee 1991 ee Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada.`},ebc:{term:`Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada (EBC)`,definition:`Hay'adda sawirta xudduudaha doorashada gobolka Alberta sida uu dhigayo EBCA. Garsoore Miller ayaa guddoomiyay guddidii 2026. Xubnaheedu waxay u kala qaybsameen 3–2, waxayna soo saareen laba soo jeedin oo isku tartamaya, soo jeedinta inta badan iyo tan inta yar, halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd hal talo.`},"lunty-committee":{term:`Guddiga Lunty`,definition:`Guddiga Gaarka ah ee Xulan ee Xudduudaha Doorashada: lix MLA, afar UCP iyo laba NDP, oo uu guddoomiyo MLA-ga UCP Brandon Lunty. Waxa sameeyay Mooshinka Dawladda 37 (la soo bandhigay Abriil 16, la ansixiyay Abriil 21, 2026), ka dib markii Goluhu dhinac iska dhigay labada khariidadood ee guddida. Wuxuu kormeeraa Guddida Talo-bixinta Madax-bannaan oo soo saarta soo jeedin 91 kursi ah, waana inuu warbixin u gudbiyaa Golaha Sharci-dejinta ugu dambayn Noofembar 2, 2026. Wuxuu ka baxsan yahay habraaca caadiga ah ee guddida. Ma jiro sharci ku waajibinaya inuu qabto dhageysiyo dadweyne.`},"advisory-panel":{term:`Guddida Talo-bixinta Madax-bannaan`,definition:`Guddida uu Guddiga Lunty ku hawlgeliyay Mooshinka Dawladda 37 si ay u sawirto soo jeedin 91 kursi ah. Ra'iisul Wasaaraha wuxuu magacaabay Sharafta leh Monte Solberg iyo Darwin Durnie. Hoggaamiyaha Mucaaradku wuxuu magacaabay Dr. Gerard Kennedy iyo Brent Robinson. Guddoomiyaha garsoorka ee ku-meel-gaadhka ah ee Alberta wuu diiday inuu ka caawiyo raadinta garsoore guddoomiya; markii dambe waxa guddoomiye loo magacaabay Brian O'Ferrall, garsoore hawlgab ah oo ka tirsanaa Maxkamadda Rafcaanka. Guddidu talo ayay bixisaa. MLA-yada guddiga ayaa go'aamiya.`},ebca:{term:`EBCA`,definition:`Alberta Electoral Boundaries Commission Act (Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta) — sharciga maamula sida xudduudaha doorashada loogu sawiro gobolka. Wuxuu dejiyaa guddida, habraaca dhageysiga dadweynaha, iyo shuruucda marka khariidad cusub ay shaqo galayso.`},ensemble:{term:`Tijaabada 1.01-milyan-khariidadood`,definition:`Kombuyuutar ayaa si bakhtiyaanasiib ah u sawiray 1.01 milyan oo khariidadood oo Alberta oo sharci ah. Dhammaantood waxay raacaan isla xeerarka, kombuyuutarkuna marna ma arko cod, taasina waa waxa ka dhigaya kuwo dhexdhexaad ah. Khariidad dhab ah waxa loo tiriyaa mid aan caadi ahayn marka ay ka baxsan tahay waxa ay soo saaraan ku dhowaad dhammaan khariidadahan.`},efficiency_gap:{term:`Farqiga waxtarka`,definition:`Cabbir codadka "khasaaray", oo la isbarbar dhigo labada xisbi. Cod waa khasaaraa haddii loo dhiibto mid guuldarraystay, ama haddii loo dhiibto guuleyste oo uu dhaafo intii guushu u baahnayd. Farqi weyn wuxuu tilmaamaa khariidad hal dhinac u janjeedha.`},mean_median:{term:`Farqiga dhexe-dhexdhexaadka`,definition:`Qaado saamiga codka xisbi ee degmo kasta. Farqiga dhexe-dhexdhexaadku waa masaafada u dhaxaysa celceliska saamiyadaas iyo midka dhexe (median). Farqi weyn wuxuu muujinayaa in codbixiyayaashiisa loo kala firdhiyay si codad lagu khasaariyo.`},declination:{term:`Declination`,definition:`Cabbir muujinaya sida aan dheelitirnayn ee xisbi kasta ugu guuleysto kursiyadiisa: guulo waaweyn ama kuwo cidhiidhi ah. Ka dib sixid calaamadeed oo Juun 2026 la sameeyay, khariidadda inta yar wuxuu ku tilmaamayaa isla jihada cabbirrada kale, xagga xisbiga xukunka haya.`},seats_5050:{term:`Kursiyo barbar ah`,definition:`Immisa kursi ayaa xisbi kastaa ku guulaysan lahaa haddii gobolku codkiisa si sax ah u kala qaybiyo 50-50. Waxay ka saartaa cidda dhab ahaan ku guulaysatay waxayna tijaabisaa eexda khariidadda ku dhisan.`},fsa:{term:`Aagga kala-soocida hore (FSA)`,definition:`Saddexda xaraf ee ugu horeeya koodka boostada Kanada (qaybta xaraf-lambar-xaraf). Qiyaastii 270 FSA ayaa daboolaya Alberta. Badi waxay si buuxda ugu jiraan hal degmo doorasho.`}},body:{section_link_aria:`Xiriiriye qaybta`,preliminary:{badge:`BILOW AH`,heading:`Natiijooyin bilow ah — sugaya dib-u-eegis madax-bannaan oo khabiir ah`,body:`Khubaro madax-bannaan oo maaddada yaqaan ayaa dib u eegaya imtixaannada tirakoobka ee qaybtan ka hor daabacaadda kama dambaysta ah. Natiijooyinka oo dhammaystiran waa kuwan hoose, oo u furan baadhitaankaas.`},the_map:{heading:`1: Khariidadda`,p1:`Khariidadda jaldiga waa sawirka keligiis ugu fiican ee hubintan. Halkan waxa lagu akhriyo.`,p2:`Alberta waxa loo qaybiyey 4,765 Aagag Codbixin — aago juquraafi yaryar oo Elections Alberta isticmaasho si ay u tiriyaan kaadiyada xarunta codbixinta. Mid kasta waxa lagu midaystay sida dadku dhab ahaan u codeeyeen 2023: oranje meelaha codadka NDP ay ku urursan yihiin, buluug meelaha codadka UCP ay ku urursan yihiin. Laakiin midabku oo madoow oo dhiig dhebbada noqonayaa kaliya meelaha ay dad badan ku nool yihiin. Aagga Codbixin oo daboola boqollaal kiilomitir oo isku jira oo barbarro ama beero ah wuxuu yahay dhalaalan — ku dhowaad la arki kari maayo. Khariidaddu way iftiimisaa meelaha ay dadku joogaan, wayna damisaa meelaha aanay joogin.`,p3:`Tani aad bay uga duwantahay Alberta aad aragto habeenkii doorashada. Khariidadaha doorashada inta badani waxay si buuxda u midaystaan riding-yo dhammaystiran buluug ama oranje iyada oo ku saleysan cidda guulaysatay. Riding-yada miyiga ah waxay juquraafi ahaan u weyn yihiin UCP-na waxay ku guulaysataa inta badan, sidaa darteed habeenkii doorashada Alberta waxay u eeg tahay darbi buluug ah oo leh boorso oranje yaryar oo Edmonton iyo Calgary ku yaal. Khariidadda jaldigu waxay isticmaashaa isla codadka iyo isla juquraafiga — laakiin waxay tusinaysaa kuwo lagu miisaamay halka dadku dhab ahaan ku nool yihiin. Waxa muuqda waa gobol oo dadka inta badani ay ku urursan yihiin qaanso magaalo oo cufan, magaalooyinkaasi waxay si aad u kala duwan u codeeyaan khariidadda miyiga ah ee caadi ahaan u matasha.`,p4:`Khadadka xudduudaha ee midabka kor lagu sawiray waa 89 degmo doorasho oo guddida laga yar yahay soo jeedisay — khariidadda hubintaniyu noqdaayadii dambe dhalleeceyso. Shaqada hubintu waa in la weydiiyo waxa khadadkaasi ku samaynayaan dadka hoosta ku jira.`,p5:`Sawirkani waxa uu khataraha bayaamiyaa. Gobol oo u eeg sidiisii hal jaho ugu codeyaayo khariidad caadi ah dhab ahaan waa gobol uu dadka inta badan ku noolyihiin aagag jaho kale u codeyo. Marka dadka la arki karo hoosta doorashooyinka xudduudaha, doorashooyinkaasi waxay joogsadaan inay u eegan kuwo aan kala sooc lahayn.`},structural_results:{heading:`Natiijooyinka hubinta qaab-dhismeedka — ka hor wax tirakoob ah:`,body:`Khariidadda inta badan waxay dhaaftaa <strong>eber ka mid ah shan</strong> xad qaab-dhismeed oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay. Khariidadda inta yar waxay dhaaftaa <strong>afar ka mid ah shanta</strong>; tan shanaad (xajinta) waa dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadoodba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Kuwani waa cabbirro joomatari ah — faafinta dadka, <button class="vocab-term" data-def="sida ay xudduudaha degmadu si dhow ugu raacaan xadadka magaalada iyo dawladda hoose ee hore u jiray, halkii ay dhex mari lahaayeen" aria-expanded="false">xajinta dawladda hoose</button>, tirada qaybaha Airdrie, dadka dheeraadka ah ee woqooyi-bari/bartamaha Calgary, iyo toddobada qaab xuduudeed ee Guddoomiyaha Guddida, Garsoore Miller, laftiisu qoraal ku calaamadeeyay (warbixinta inta badan, bogagga 59 iyo 62–63) — kuwaas oo aan u baahnayn xog doorasho iyo qalab muunad-qaadasho tirakoob midna. Qaybta xigta waxay labada khariidadood barbar dhigtaa 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray, waxayna gaadhaa isla gunaanadka iyadoo adeegsanaysa qalab gebi ahaanba ka duwan. Laba qalab oo madax-bannaan — joomatari iyo tirakoob — way isku yimaadaan, labaduba waxay ku dhacaan gobollada uu guddoomiyaha guddidu qoraal ku dhaleeceeyay.`},clean:{heading:`6: Marka khariidad u eg mid caddaalad ah ee aan ahayn`,legal_label:`OGEYSIIS KU SAABSAN ERAYBIXINTA SHARCIGA`,legal_body:`"Gerrymandering" ma laha qeexitaan sharci oo Kanada. Ereygu waxa loo isticmaalaa warbixintan oo dhan macnaheeda caadiga ah ee siyaasadda — wax-ka-beddelka xudduudaha doorashada faa'iido xisbiyeed. Imtixaanada sharci ee dhab ahaan ku shaqeeya Kanada waa kala duwan: in xudduuduhu bixiyaan "matalaad waxtar leh" sida ku cad qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha</em> (heerka dastuuriga ah ee Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada ay dejisay 1991-kii <em>Tixraaca Saskatchewan</em>), iyo in guddidu raacday shuruucda <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta. Natiijooyinka hubintu waa caddaymo la xidhiidha su'aalahaas sharciga. Ma aha caddaynta khaladka sharci ahaan la qeexay, warbixintaaduna kuma sharaxno erayadaas.`,intro_p1:`Su'aasha keligeed ugu cad ee la weydiin karo khariidad kasta oo doorasho waa tan: haddii codka gobolku si sax ah u kala qaybsamo labada xisbi ee waaweyn, immisa kursi ayay khariidaddu soo saari lahayd? Tani waxay codbixiyayaasha hayaa joogto waxayna khariidadda keligeed weydiisaa waxa ay sameyso.`,intro_p2:`Si looga jawaabo tan, hubintu waxay samaysay 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta ah oo kombuyuutar sawiray oo xisaab ahaan dhexdhexaad ah. Jilitaanku wuxuu adeegsaday faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta ee juquraafiga guddida, qorshe kastana wuxuu ku qabtay isla shuruudaha dheelitirka dadka (±25%) iyo isku-xidhnaanta — labada shuruudood ee algorithm-ku qasbo, ma aha qodob kasta oo sharci ah (tusaale ahaan, ma qasbo danaha bulshada), sidaa darteed kooxda isbarbardhigga waxa ugu habboon in loo akhriyo mid dhexdhexaad ah xagga dadka iyo isku-xidhnaanta, ma aha mid si buuxda sharciga u waafaqsan. Labada khariidadood ee guddida ee 2026 ayaa markaas la dhex dhigay qaybintaas si loo arko sida ay caadi u yihiin. Jilitaanku wuxuu ku socday afar silsilad oo madax-bannaan oo mid kastaa leedahay 252,500 tallaabo, iniinta saldhigga ahna waxa laga soo qaaday calaamadda Cloudflare drand, waxaana OSF lagu diiwaangeliyay ka hor inta aan la socodsiin.`,howmcmc_label:`SIDAY SOO-JEEDINTU U SHAQEYSO`,howmcmc_mcmc:`Isku dar laba degmo oo is ag yaal, kadib bolla-urursigaas si nasiib ah ugu kala qaybi laba degmo oo cusub oo sharci ah, ku celi malyuun jeer, adigoo tallaabo kasta khariidadda kaydinaya. Taasi waa mashiinka oo dhan. Sharraxaadda tallaabo-tallaabada ah — iyo imtixaan kasta oo kale oo boggan ku jira, luuqad fudud — waxay ku jirtaa <a href="__BASE__/methods">bogga Hababka</a>.`,howmcmc_recom:`Algorithm-ka waxa la yidhaahdaa ReCom — qalabka caadiga ah ee cilmigan — wuxuuna qaab-dhismeed ahaan u ilaaliyaa labada xeer sharci ee adag (dheelitirka dadka, isku-xidhnaanta).`,prereg_label:`DIIWAAN-GELINTA HORE`,prereg_body:`Diiwaangelinta hore waxa loola jeedaa in imtixaannada, xadadka iyo jihooyinka la saadaaliyay lagu qoro diiwaan dadweyne oo waqti lagu dhejiyay ka hor inta aan xogta la eegin — si xad aan si qarsoodi ah loo dhaqaajin karin marka jawaabtu timaado ka dib. Ballamaha hubintan waxa lagu kaydiyay Open Science Framework, iniinyaheeda nasiibka ah waxa lagu xidhay calaamad dadweyne ka hor inta aanay faylasha khariidadaha rasmiga ahi jirin, natiijo kastana waxa loo calaamadeeyay mid hore loo diiwaangeliyay ama mid baadhitaan bilow ah. Xisaabta oo dhan ee midkee yahay kee waxay ku jirtaa <a href='__BASE__/methods'>bogga Hababka</a>.`,neutral_p:`Alberta, jawaabta dhexdhexaadka ah ma aha 50/50. <em>1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta sharci ah oo kombuyuutar soo saaray, khariidadda dhexe waxay siisaa UCP kaliya 44.8% kursiyada codka 50/50</em> — khariidad caadi ah oo Alberta ah oo codad dhexdhexaad ah waxay siisaa NDP aqlabiyad yar oo kursiyo. Tan way liddi noqotaa laakiin waa farsamada: codbixiyayaasha UCP ee miyiga waxay ku guulaystaan riding-yadooda kala-soocyo 60-40 (waxay khasaariyaan codad badan oo UCP "dheeraad ah"), halka codbixiyayaasha NDP ee magaalada ay ku guulaystaan riding-yadooda kala-soocyo 51-49 oo ka adag (waxay khasaariyaan codad NDP yar guul kasta). Dhexdhexaad ahaan, NDP waxay ku guulaystaa waxtarka kursiyada.`,full_dist:`Qaybinta buuxda ee soo-jeedinta canonical-ka ah ee 1,010,000-khariidadood:`,t1_col_a:`Halka khariidaddu joogto`,t1_col_b:`Kursiyo UCP codka 50/50`,t1_r1_a:`Khariidadda dhexe ee Alberta`,t1_r1_b:`44.8% — aqlabiyad yar oo kursiyo NDP`,t1_r2_a:`Khariidadda 95-aad centile`,t1_r2_b:`47.1%`,t1_r3_a:`Khariidadda 99-aad centile`,t1_r3_b:`48.4%`,t1_r4_a:`<strong>Heerka ugu sarreeya ee 1,010,000 khariidadood</strong>`,t1_r4_b:`<strong>51.72% (69 ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorshe ayaa ka sarreeya 51.69%-ka inta yar)</strong>`,seat_count_note:`Ogeysiis ku saabsan tirooyinka kursiyada. Khariidadaha guddida ee 2026 mid kastaa wuxuu leeyahay <strong>89</strong> degmo; soo-jeedinta kombuyuutarka ee hubinta waxay ku shaqaynaysaa khariidadda 2019 ee <strong>87</strong>-degmo (saldhigeedii bilowga); guddiga Lunty Noofembar wuxuu soo saari doonaa <strong>91</strong>. Dhammaan boqolleyga waa <em>qaybtaarka</em> kursiyada, oo la isbarbar dhigi karo magaca kala-soocyadan. Soo-jeedintu waxay isticmaashaa khariidadda 2019 sida meesha bilowga maxaa yeelay algorithm-ka ReCom wuxuu u baahan yahay khariidad sharci ahaan la dhaqan geliyay si uu uga soo jeediyo is-beddelo — khariidadda 2019 waa khariidadii doorashada Alberta ee ugu dambeysay ee la dhaqan geliyay. Adeegsiga soo-jeedinta guddida kasta saldhig ahaan wuxuu noqon lahaa wareeg: waxaynu cabbirayn lahayn in khariidad ay aad u xad-dhaaftay marka loo eego khariidado laga soo qaatay laftigeed.`,pattern_intro:`Natiijooyinka — meelaynta saddexda khariidad ee dhabta ah qaybintan — waxay tilmaamayaan qaab gaar ah oo qalliin-leh oo sawiritaanka xudduudo.`,sub1_h:`Afarta cabbir ee tirakoobku waxay isku mar shaqeeyaan`,sub1_p:`Marka shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta la isticmaalo, khariidadda laga yar yahay waa qiime tirakoob ah oo aan caadi ahayn cabbir kasta oo caddaaladda xisbiyeed — ma aha kaliya midda heerka kala-soocida.`,t2_col_a:`Khariidad`,t2_col_b:`Farqiga waxtarka`,t2_col_c:`Dhexe-dhexdhexaad`,t2_col_d:`<a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener" title="Declination waxay cabbirtaa farqiga zaawiyad ee qalooca kursi-codka ee xisbi kasta. Qiimaha taban wuxuu ku doorbidayaa NDP; kuwa togan waxay doorbidayaan UCP.">Declination</a>`,t2_col_e:`Kursiyo 50/50`,t2_r1_a:`Inta badan 2026`,t2_r1_b:`+0.1% (p16.5)`,t2_r1_c:`−3.6% (p1)`,t2_r1_d:`−0.027 (p21.8)`,t2_r1_e:`46.1% (p78.5)`,t2_r2_a:`Inta yar 2026`,t2_r2_b:`<strong>+4.0% (p94.5)</strong>`,t2_r2_c:`<strong>+1.0% (p99.97)</strong>`,t2_r2_d:`<strong>+0.077 (p98.8)</strong>`,t2_r2_e:`<strong>51.7% (p99.99)</strong>`,sub1_close:`Khariidadda inta badan si raaxo leh ayay ugu jirtaa xadka caadiga ah saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir. Farqigeeda dhexe-dhexdhexaadku wuxuu ku jiraa p1 (= p0.99) jihada NDP u roon — natiijo aan caadi ahayn, laakiin u jeedda jihada aan UCP caawin. Sida dhow ee khariidadda inta badan u raacdo xudduudaha dawladda hoose waxay bartamaha magaalooyinka ee NDP ku badan tahay gelisaa degmooyin u gaar ah oo isku urursan, halkaas oo codadka NDP ku guuleystaan farqi waxtar leh, halka guulaha miyiga ee UCP ay u badan yihiin farqi ka weyn; faa'iidadan waxtar ee qaab-dhismeed ee yar ee NDP ayaa ka muuqata cabbirka dhexe-dhexdhexaadka. Khariidadda inta yar waxay ku jirtaa dabada afartaba, mid kastaa wuxuu u jeedaa isla jihada xisbiyeed.`,sub2_h:`Heerka kala-soocida 50/50: in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha`,sub2_p:`Cabbirka heerka kala-soocida ee kor lagu soo bandhigay — kursiyo UCP ee codka gobol ee 50/50 — waa habka ugu fudud ee loo barbar dhigi karo saddexda khariidadood.`,t3_col_a:`Khariidad`,t3_col_b:`Kursiyo UCP codka 50/50`,t3_col_c:`Halkay joogto`,t3_r1_a:`2019 la dejiyay`,t3_r1_b:`46.0%`,t3_r1_c:`78-aad centile — gudaha kala-duwanaanta caadiga ah`,t3_r2_a:`<strong>Inta badan 2026</strong>`,t3_r2_b:`<strong>46.1%</strong>`,t3_r2_c:`<strong>78-aad centile — si fiican gudaha xadadka</strong>`,t3_r3_a:`<strong>Inta yar 2026</strong>`,t3_r3_b:`<strong>51.7% (46 kursi)</strong>`,t3_r3_c:`<strong>99.99-aad centile — in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 tirinta dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa gaadha</strong>`,sub2_close:`In ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo Alberta dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar soo saaray ayaa soo saaray qiime <code>seats@50/50</code> oo sarreeya sida soo jeedinta laga yar yahay. Iyada oo ku saleysan qaababka codbixinta dhowaan ee dhabta ah, waxay UCP siisaa 60 kursi (marka loo eego 55 soo jeedinta inta badan). Soo jeedinta inta badan waa nooca khariidad ee habraac dhexdhexaad ah caadi ahaan soo saaro. Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay waa nooca khariidad ee waa inaad si gaar ah u doontaa si aad u sawirto.`,sub3_h:`Macnaheedu maxay tahay luuqad cad`,sub3_p:`Soo jeedinta inta yar waxay ku jirtaa dabada aadka u fog ee 1,010,000-ka qorshe saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda xisbiyeed, tan afraadna (farqiga waxtarka, +4.0%) waxay ku jirtaa centile-ka 94.5 — <em>u dhow, laakiin ka hooseeya</em> xadka hubintu hore u diiwaangelisay ee Alberta loo habeeyay, kaas oo ah centile-ka 95. Labada kanaal ee imtixaanka wadajirka ahi waxay wadaagaan xog farqi-waxtar oo hoose, mana aha kuwo tirakoob ahaan madax-bannaan, sidaa darteed isku-darka qiimayaashooda p ee habka Fisher wuxuu buunbuuniyaa muhiimadda. Xadka sare ee la difaaci karo, ee ka yimaada isku-dar u adkaysta ku-tiirsanaanta, waa qiyaastii <strong>hal ka mid ah 568,000</strong> (Bonferroni; p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>). Taasi weli waa natiijo aad u daran, oo si fog uga gudubta xadadka muhiimadda ee caadiga ah — laakiin waxa loo soo sheegayaa sidii xad, ma aha sidii afar qalab oo madax-bannaan oo isku raacay.`,details_summary:`Macnaha qiimahan p — iyo waxa aanay ka dhignayn`,details_p1:`Qiimaha p wuxuu ka jawaabaa hal su'aal: haddii khariidadda uu sawiray habraac dhexdhexaad ah, intee jeer ayaan arki lahayn natiijo sidan u daran ama ka sii daran? Xadka u adkaysta ku-tiirsanaanta p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>, jawaabtu waa ugu badnaan qiyaastii hal mar 568,000 tijaabo.`,details_p2:`Tani waa tijaabo mala-awaal oo frequentist ah, ma aha cabbir niyad. Ma sheegayso in guddidu ay ula jeeday qaybsi siyaasadeed, mana cabbirayso sida khariidaddu aan caddaalad u ahayn macnaha wax-ku-oolka ah. Waxay sheegtaa in qaabka xudduudu yahay tirakoob ahaan aan la jaan-qaadayn qaybinta tixraaca ee sawir-dhexdhexaadka ah ee ReCom — hubin dibadeed oo xooggan, laakiin aan kaamil ahayn (ma dhaqan-geliyo shuruud kasta oo sharci oo guddidu ku hoos shaqaynaysay, tusaale, heerarka s.15(2) iyo xaddidaadaha danta bulsho).`,details_p3:`Guutada tijaabada qaab-dhismeed (dadka, kala-qaybinta, xajinta, isku-cufnaanta, saxeexyada) ayaa lagu diiwaan-geliyay calaamado wakhti ah ka hor dib-u-xisaabinta canonical-ka ah (<a href="https://osf.io/w2s8k" rel="noopener">Diiwaangelinta OSF w2s8k</a>). Kanaalada eexda xisbiyeed (Mahalanobis isku-jirka ah, SZAT, isku-darka Fisher/Bonferroni) waxa loo calaamadeeyay "sahmin" macnaha hubinta lafteeda ee §4.3.1: oo lagu qoray kaydka, laakiin aan ahayn xog-ka-hor. Hubintu waxay kanaal kasta si gooni ah u soo sheegtaa waxayna isugu darsaa hoosta xadka isku-xidhnaanta-xasil halkii ay u soo bandhigi lahayd inay yihiin tijaabooyin xaqiijin oo si buuxda madax-bannaan.`,szat_label:`TIJAABADA U QAYBINTA AAGA KALA-SOOCIDA (SZAT)`,szat_body:`SZAT waxa loo naqshadeeyay kanaal falanqeyn oo labaad: halkii la weydiin lahaa "khariidaddani guud ahaan ma aad bay u daran tahay?" waxay weydiisaa "doorashooyinka khadadka gaarka ah ma yihiin kuwo xisbi-dhexdhexaad ah?" Waxay u shaqeysaa iyada oo gooni u soocaysa kaliya Aagagga Codbixinta halka khariidadda inta yar ay ka duwan tahay tan inta badan — dib-u-sawirka la murmay — oo tijaabinaysa in doorashooyinkaas gaarka ah, marka la isugu daro, ay waxtarka codka jiho hal xisbi ah ugu wareejiyaan. Maxaa yeelay waxay isbarbar dhigtaa kaliya barbaraha kala-tagga, waxay si toos ah u xakameysaa wax kasta oo labada khariidadood wadaagaan: isla juquraafiga, bartilmaameedyada dadnimada, iyo shuruucda sharciga. Hoosta tijaabo permutation caadi ah SZAT waxay soo celisay p=0.0024; hoosta eber block-permutation oo sax ka qabta autocorrelation aagga ee Aagagga Codbixinta isku xiga, waxay soo celisay p≈0.19 — ma muhiim aha. SZAT waxa loo hayaa macno sahmin ah laakiin kuma badbaado kanaal xaqiijin ah. Cinwaanku wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay soo-jeedinta kaliya. <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/szat_summary.json" rel="noopener">Faahfaahin farsamo →</a>`,two_q:`<strong>Natiijada SZAT.</strong> Jilitaanka 1,010,000-ka khariidadood wuxuu weydiiyaa: <em>khariidaddani ma aad bay u daran tahay marka loo eego khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ee lagu sawiray isla juquraafiga Alberta?</em> Imtixaan labaad — <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/szat_summary.json" rel="noopener">Swing-Zone Allocation Test</a> — wuxuu weydiiyay su'aal kale: <em>khadadka gaarka ah ee khariidadda ma yihiin kuwo xisbi-dhexdhexaad ah?</em> Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa isagoo eegaya oo keliya Aagagga Codbixinta (Voting Areas) ee inta yar si ka duwan inta badan u sawirtay, wuxuuna weydiiyaa in doorashooyinkaas gaarka ah, marka la isku daro, ay waxtarka codka u wareejiyeen jihada hal xisbi. Isbeddel-kala-hormarin (permutation) caadi ah hoostiisa wuxuu soo celiyay p=0.0024. Null isbeddel-baloog (block-permutation) ah hoostiisa — kaas oo saxa isku-ekaanshaha meelaha Aagagga Codbixinta ee is-ag yaal — wuxuu soo celiyay p≈0.19. Natiijada isbeddel-baloogga ma gaadho muhiimad. Sidaa darteed hubintu waxay natiijada jilitaanka oo keliya u soo sheegtaa sidii cinwaanka: xad sare oo u adkaysta ku-tiirsanaanta oo ah <strong>1 ka mid ah 568,000</strong> (p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>), ma aha isku-darka Fisher ee laba kanaal oo madax-bannaan.`,super_lead:`Gole sharci-dejin oo 89 kursi ah, aqlabiyad saddex meelood laba meel ahi waxay u baahan tahay si sax ah 60 kursi. Saamiga kursiyada soo jeedinta inta yar marka codku siman yahay, 51.7% — heer ay gaadhaan 69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee dhexdhexaadka ah — wuxuu ku jiraa xaaladda uu aqlabiyadda weyn ee UCP tirakoob ahaan suurtagal ku noqonayso juquraafiga Alberta ee 2023. Laakiin jilitaanku ma qasbo shuruud kasta oo sharci ah oo guddidu ku shaqaynaysay, sidaa darteed tani waa hubin dibadeed oo xooggan, ma aha caddayn in aanay jirin khariidad Alberta oo sharciga waafaqsan oo gaadhi karta tiradan kursiyada. Caddaynta qaab-dhismeed ee Act I, oo aan gabi ahaanba ku tiirsanayn jilitaanka, ayaa qaada miisaanka badankiisa; booska dabada ee codka simanku waa macnaha taageeraya.`,super_label:`SABABTA AQLABIYAD WEYN AY MUHIIM U TAHAY`,super_body:`Hoos nidaamka Westminster ee Kanada, Golaha Alberta ma laha heer saddex-meelood-laba ah oo furaya awoodo gaar ah: aqlabiyad xukun — xataa mid yar — waxay hadda ansixin kartaa shuruuc iyo miisaaniyado, ku dhawaaqi kartaa "xidhitaanka" (closure) si ay dooda u soo afjarto, beddeli kartaa xeerarka Golaha, oo dhigi kartaa xubinnimada guddi kasta. Waxa aqlabiyad aad u weyni beddesho waa farqi iyo waarid, ma aha liiska awoodaha. Dawlad haysata 60 ka mid ah 89 kursi waxay xaqiiqo ahaan ka dhowrsan tahay is-khilaafka gudaha — dhowr xubnood oo sagxadda ka gudba ma hanjabi karaan — waxayna la kulantaa mucaarid aad u yar oo aan awoodin inuu ku qasbo kala-qaybsanaan la duubay ama uu joogteeyo baadhitaanka guddiyada. Walaaca halkan jira waa urursanaanta kursiyada iyo yaraanta mucaaridka waxtarka leh, ma aha heer habraac oo la gudbay.`,super_close:`Qaabka isku-darka magaalada ee lagu aqoonsaday Act I — codbixiyayaasha magaalada oo loo qaybiyay degmooyinka cidhifka miyiga ee ku wareegsan — wuxuu la jaanqaadayaa natiijada 60-ka kursi, inkastoo imtixaanka tooska ah ee hubintu ku eegtay in joomatarigaas uu yahay farsamada gaarka ah uu soo noqday mid diidmo ah, waxaana loo soo sheegay sidii dhicid (Casing 9). Natiijooyinka qaab-dhismeedka iyo tirakoobku waxay isugu yimaadaan isla soo jeedinta iyo isla bulshooyinka — waxayna isku raacsan yihiin cidda ka faa'iidaysa.`,sub4_h:`Xaqiijinta tijaabada habraaca la beegsaday`,sub4_p:`Si loo hubiyo in tani aanay ahayn waxweyn ee soo-jeedinta dhexdhexaadka ah ee soo-doorbida la yaqaano ee compactness, hubintu waxay socodsiisay habraac la beegsaday oo fuulista buurta ah (<a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">Cannon iyo kuwa kale 2022 — la tixraacay oo lagu sharaxay warbixinta farsamada</a>) labada jiho: kor u qaadista kursiyada UCP iyo kor u qaadista kursiyada NDP. Isla tirada tallaabooyinka (40,000) jiho kasta, isla xaddidaadaha sharciga, isla joomatariga gobolka.`,t4_col_a:`Habraac`,t4_col_b:`Qiimaha ugu sarreeya ee la gaaray`,t4_col_c:`Waxa uu naga sheegayo`,t4_r1_a:`MCMC dhexdhexaad, kor u soo saaray`,t4_r1_b:`51.72% kursiyada UCP @ 50/50 (69 ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorshe ayaa ka sarreeya 51.69%-ka inta yar)`,t4_r1_c:`Saqafka dabiiciga ah ee sawir dhexdhexaad`,t4_r2_a:`MCMC dhexdhexaad, hoos u soo saaray`,t4_r2_b:`~39% kursiyada UCP @ 50/50`,t4_r2_c:`Sagxada dabiiciga ah ee sawir dhexdhexaad`,t4_r3_a:`Fuulida buurta la beegsaday, kor u qaadista UCP`,t4_r3_b:`<strong>52.9%</strong>`,t4_r3_c:`Waxa habraac si ula kac ah u doonayo faa'iidada UCP gaadhi karo`,t4_r4_a:`Fuulida buurta la beegsaday, kor u qaadista NDP`,t4_r4_b:`<strong>37.9%</strong>`,t4_r4_c:`Waxa habraac si ula kac ah u doonayo faa'iidada NDP gaadhi karo (ka hoos sagxadda dhexdhexaadka ah)`,sub4_close:`51.7%-ka khariidadda inta yar waxay saqafka UCP-ka la beegsaday (52.9%) uga dhowdahay median-ka khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah (44.8%). 46.1%-ka khariidadda inta badan aad bay ugu dhowdahay median-ka dhexdhexaadka ah, oo ah centile-ka 78. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 labaduba si raaxo leh ayay ugu jiraan waxa habraac dhexdhexaad ahi si joogto ah u soo saaro — saamiyo cod oo kala duwan, isla aag natiijooyin aan la yaab lahayn. Khariidadda inta badan waxay dhidibka caddaaladda xisbiyeed ku sii wadaa dhaqankii Alberta ee 2019, sida ay xajinta dawladda hoose ugu sii wadato dhaqankii 2019 (80.0%, marka loo eego 75.1% ee 2019). Laba khariidadood oo lagu sawiray isla xeerarka Alberta, ay sameeyeen isla shanta xubnood ee guddida, isla qolka: mid waxay ku dhacdaa meesha habraacyada dhexdhexaadka ahi si joogto ah u gaadhaan, tan kalena waxay ku dhacdaa meel aad si gaar ah u beegsato haddii aad rabto inaad gaadho.`,sub4_quote:`<em>Tani</em> waa qaabka natiijada, waana qaabka uu maxkamadu dhab ahaan adeegsado.`,sub5_h:`Diidmada sharaxaadaha kale`,sub5_p:`Marka la soo bandhigo qiime aan caadi ahayn oo tirakoob oo cabbirkan ah, hubin daacad ah waa inay ka takhaluso sharaxaadaha aan eedaynayn ka hor inta aanay qaababkan u xil saarin nashqad ula kac ah. Xogta qaab-dhismeed (Waddada 2) waxay si nidaamsan u burin difaaca caadiga ah:`,defense1:`<strong>Difaaca "Juquraafiga Siyaasadeed ee Dabiiciga ah":</strong> <em>("Codbixiyayaasha magaaladu si dabiici ah ayay u urursan yihiin; khariidaddu kaliya waxay tarjumeysaa juquraafiga Alberta.")</em> 1,010,000 soo-jeedin ayaa horay u tixgalin juquraafiga dabiiciga ah ee Alberta. Juquraafigu runtii wuxuu siiyaa UCP faa'iido aasaasi ah oo waxtar — laakiin labada khariidadood ee dhabta ah ee la barbardhigayo ayaa muujinaya halka faa'iidadaas si dabiici ah ugu xidhanto: khariidaddii la dejiyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 labaduba waxay ku yaalliin 78-aad centile ee cabbirka barta rogitaanka, khariidadda 2019 sarreynteedana ugu sarreysa cabbir kasta oo xisbiyeed waa 90-meeyada hoose (declination, 91-aad centile). Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay ku taal 99.99-aad centile — qiime aan caadi ahayn oo aad u sarreeya <em>xitaa marka loo eego saldhigga si dabiici ah u eexday ee Alberta</em>.`,defense2:`<strong>Difaaca "Bulshooyinka Danta Iska Leh":</strong> <em>("Qaababka cajiibka ah waxa loo sawiray si loo mideeyo bulshooyin gaar ah.")</em> Haddii aad isku dayeyso inaad bulshooyin mid keenis, waxaad raacaysaa xudduudaha dawladda hoose. Khariidadda inta badan waxay raacday xadadka magaalada ee jira 80% wakhtiga. Khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay raacday 72% wakhtiga — labadaba ku jira caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Waxa khariidadda laga yar yahay sameyso si firfircoon waa kala-qaybinta magaalada Airdrie afar qaybood oo gooni ah, iyo dejinta saddex ka mid ah go'aamadeeda xudduud sax ahaan aagagga magaalo-cidhif ee guddidu calaamadeeyey inay yihiin kuwo joomatari ahaan aan caadi ahayn — doorashooyin aan lagu sharixi karin caqliga bulshooyinka danta iska leh.`,defense3:`<strong>Difaaca "Sinaanta Dadka":</strong> <em>("Waa inay sawiraan xudduudo cajiib ah si ay u hubiyaan in degmo kasta uu leeyahay isla tirada dadka.")</em> On the commission's own population tables the minority map is <em>worse</em> at population equality: its Population Mean Absolute Deviation (MAD) was 4,707, 48% wider than the majority map's 3,180. On 2021 census numbers the two maps' mean deviations are almost the same, and the minority's median deviation is wider (3,938 against 2,827). That median spread sits at the 99th percentile of neutral maps balanced to within ±12.5%, but at the bottom of the range when neutral maps may use the statute's full ±25%.`,defense4:`<strong>Difaaca "Karti-darro ama Nasiib-xumo":</strong> <em>("Waxay keliya sawireen khariidad aan taxaddar lahayn, tirooyinkuna nasiib xumo ayay u noqdeen.")</em> In la gaadho qaab aqlabiyad weyn oo 60 kursi ah, iyadoo isla markaas Airdrie loo kala qaybinayo afar qaybood, saddex xuduudna la dhigayo isla aagagga uu guddoomiyaha guddidu laftiisu ku calaamadeeyay kuwo aan caadi ahayn, waxay u baahan tahay saxnaan. Xadka sare ee wadajirka ah ee u adkaysta ku-tiirsanaanta, ee suurtagalnimada in si shil ah loo sawiro khariidad sidan ugu daran labada kanaal ee falanqaynta marka loo eego qaybinta tixraaca dhexdhexaadka ah ee ReCom, waa qiyaastii <strong>1 ka mid ah 568,000</strong> (p&nbsp;≤&nbsp;1.76×10<sup>−6</sup>). Xadkaasi weli waa mid aad u daran — si fog uga gudba muhiimadda caadiga ah — laakiin waxa loo soo sheegayaa sidii xad, ma aha sidii hal suurtagalnimo oo sax ah.`,sub5_close:`Waxa xogtu muujineyso waa in soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay sii xumeysay labada sinaanta dadka iyo isku xidhnaanta bulshada marka loo eego waxa isla shanta la-taliye ay isku mar soo saareen hoos shuruucda sharciga oo isku mid ah. Hubintu ma go'aaminayso waxa la-taliyayaasha laga yar yahay ay ula jeedeen — joomatariga xuduudu ma muujin karo niyad — laakiin ka leexitaanka qaab-dhismeed ee guddi dhexdhexaadka ah iyo soo-saarka soo jeedinta inta badan wuu sii jiraa iyada oo aan loo eegin niyada.`,sub6_h:`Ogeysiis ku saabsan xaqiijinta is-tixraaca ah ee R`,sub6_p1:`Nooca hore ee hubintan (oo isticmaalay shaybaadhka qiyaaska ah halkii uu adeegsan lahaa kuwa rasmiga ah) ayaa is-tixraac ku sameeyay guddiga Python ReCom marka loo eego qaadaha Sequential Monte Carlo ee package-ka R <code>redist</code>. Xaqiijintu waxa ay soo saartay natiijooyin aan deggenayn: saddex socodsiin oo isla iniin ah, qaybta qorshayaasha gaadhaya qiimaha hore ee laga yar yahay (48.3% joomatariga qiyaaska) waxay ahaayeen 5.6%, kadibna 28%, kadibna 58% — guuldarro isugu yimaadka qaadaha, ma aha helitaan. Qoraalka oo dhammaystiran wuxuu ku yaal <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/redist_python_comparison.md" rel="noopener">findings/redist_python_comparison.md</a>.`,sub6_p2:`Iyada oo la isticmaalayo shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, <code>seats@50/50</code> ee khariidadda laga yar yahay wuxuu kor u kacayaa 51.7% — qiime ay in ka yar 100 qorshe oo ka mid ah 1,010,000 qorsho oo dhexdhexaad ah gaaraan. Su'aasha xaqiijinta is-tixraaca ee R waxay noqotaa mid aan macno lahayn: eber qorshe oo ka soo qaadaha midkood ayaa gaadha qiimaha canonical-ka ah cabbirrada muunadka oo la mid ah.`,sub6_asymm:`<strong>Sinaan la'aanta agagaarka 50/50 ayaa ka muhiimsan rogga laftiisa.</strong> Sahanka saxda ah ee qalooca kursi-codka heerka 0.01 dhibic-boqolkiiba wuxuu helay in khariidadda laga yar yahay ay UCP ku haysato kor ama heerka aqlabiyadda sharci dejinta ee 45 kursi ilaa qaybtaarka codka gobol ee UCP ee qiyaastii <strong>49.7%</strong>. Tani teknik ahaan waa rog cod-kursi — UCP wuxuu samaynayaa dawladda khariidadda laga yar yahay isaga oo lumiyo codka caadiga ah 0.3 dhibic-boqolkiiba — laakiin 0.3 dhibic waxay si fiican ugu jiraan caadiga buuq-ka raadinta caadiga ah, sidaa darteed keligeed tani ma aha natiijo aad u xun. Waxa <em>aad u</em> qarsoodi ah waa farqiga: khariidadda <strong>inta badan</strong>, UCP wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu <em>guulaysto</em> codka caadiga ah qiyaastii 4 dhibic-boqolkiiba si uu u gaadho isla heerka 45-kursi ah. Labada khariidadoodba waxay wajahaan isla juquraafiga Alberta iyo isla shuruucda sharciga; farqiga u dhexeeya — 0.3pp iyo +4pp — waa farqi qaab-dhismeed, ma aha buuq.`,sub6_close:`Tani waa natiijada eexsanaan qaab-dhismeed ee hubintu ku qabto kalsooni. Waa joomatari kaliya; kuma xidhna natiijo doorasho; ma dhaqaaqo marka raadinta dhaqaaqaan.`,sub6_caveat:`<strong>Ogeysiis hubintu si dhab ah ula qaadayso.</strong> Codbixiyayaal dhab ah ma aha 50/50 isku mid ah. Codbixiyayaashu waxay garaaci karaan eexsanaanta qaab-dhismeed ee khariidad kasta haddii ay ku raagaan firgashada — codbixiyayaal aad uga xumaaday ama dareemay waxay rogi doonaan natiijada iyada oo aan loo eegin sida xudduudaha loo sawiray. Tijaabada 50/50 waxay gooni u sooctaa <em>tabarucida khariidadda ee natiijada</em>, ma aha natiijada laftigeeda. Waxa ay muujinayso waa waxa khariidaddu sameyso markii codbixiyayaashu aanay u go'aaminin.`,sub7_h:`Gunaanadka`,sub7_p1:`Natiijada udub-dhexaadka ah ee hubintu waa joomatari. <strong>Waddada 2 — kaadhka buundooyinka aan caadiga ahayn ee qaab-dhismeedku — waa aasaaska; Waddada 1 waa caddayn in joomatarigu shaqo xisbiyeed sameynayo.</strong>`,sub7_p2:`Sawirka hoosee wuxuu dhigayaa labada waddo sawir keliya. Toosanaha jiifa waa Waddada 1 (farqiga waxtarka caddaaladda xisbiyeed, oo midig u dheer macnaheedu yahay UCP loo doorbidaayo); toosanaha taagan waa Waddada 2 (tirada imtixaanada caddaaladda qaab-dhismeed ee soo jeedinta ay ku dhacdo, shanta laga bilaabo, oo sare u dheer macnaheedu yahay mashaakil qaab-dhismeed oo badan).`,stakes_fig_alt:`Shaxda dhibcaha kala firdhisan oo farqiga waxtarka ku leh dhidibka jiifa, tirada imtixaannada qaab-dhismeedka ee lagu dhacayna dhidibka taagan. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 iyo khariidadda inta badan ee 2026 waxay ku urursan yihiin geeska hoose-bidix ee ammaanka ah. Khariidadda inta yar ee 2026 waxay ka muuqataa gobolka qiimaha ka baxsan ee sare-midig. Khariidadda 2019 waxa lagu calaamadeeyay 0 ka mid ah 4 la sameeyay: imtixaanka aagga Calgary marna laguma samayn.`,stakes_fig_caption:`Labada hab ee lagu cabbiray labada soo jeedin ee guddida, oo hal meel lagu wada sawiray. Bidix ilaa midig: inta soo jeedintu u muuqato mid u janjeedha tirada caddaaladda xisbiyeed — inta ay midig u sii dheeraato, ayay UCP u sii doorbidaysaa. Hoose ilaa sare: shanta imtixaan ee caddaaladda qaab-dhismeedka intee ayay soo jeedintu ku dhacdaa — inta ay sare u sii kacdo, ayay u sii xumaanaysaa. Khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019 waxay ku jirtaa geeska ammaanka ah: hoos labadaba (kuma dhacdo midna afarta imtixaan ee lagu sameeyay; imtixaanka aagga Calgary marna laguma samayn). Soo jeedinta inta badan ee 2026 waxay ku taagan tahay eber dhibaato qaab-dhismeed iyo u janjeedh xisbiyeed oo ku dhow eber (+0.1%). Soo jeedinta inta yar ee 2026 waa mid qaab-dhismeed ahaan ka baxsan imtixaan kasta oo labada khariidadood kala sooca (4 ka mid ah 5; tan shanaad, xajinta, waa dhexdhexaad labadaba); farqigeeda waxtarka (+4.0%) wuxuu ku jiraa waxyar ka hooseeya xariiqda xadka Alberta.`,stakes_table_intro:`Isla natiijooyinka qaab soo koobid oo cad, oo la bilaabay natiijada qaab-dhismeed maxaa yeelay caddaynta is-tixraaca ah ayaa ugu adag taageerto:`,t5_col_b:`Qaab-dhismeed — Act I (joomatari keliya, codad ma jiraan; "Waddada 2" ee warbixinta cilmiyeed)`,t5_col_c:`Tirooyin — Act II (ku xidhan codadka; "Waddada 1")`,t5_r1_a:`<strong>Inta badan 2026</strong>`,t5_r1_b:`nadiif — ma gudbiso xad <em>kasta</em> qaab-dhismeed`,t5_r1_c:`gudaha xadka caadiga ah cabbir kasta (saamiga kursiyada marka codku siman yahay 46.1%, centile-ka 78; farqiga waxtarka +0.1%)`,t5_r2_a:`<strong>Inta yar 2026</strong>`,t5_r2_b:`<strong>waxay ka gudbaysaa 4 ka mid ah 5 xadadka qaab-dhismeed</strong> kala sooc weyn (xajinta dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadood ku jira caadiga Kanada)`,t5_r2_c:`dabada aadka u fog saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda — saamiga kursiyada marka codku siman yahay 51.7% (69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha); laba cabbir oo kale waxay dhaafeen centile-ka 98.8 iyo 99.9; farqiga waxtarka +4.0% (<em>u dhow laakiin ka hooseeya</em> xariiqda hore loo dejiyay — mid aan gaadhin oo la soo sheegay); suurtagalnimada isku-darka ah ee sawir dhexdhexaad ah qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000`,details2_summary:`Sababta Waddada 2 ay xambaaraysay dacwadda — faahfaahin farsamo`,details2_p:`Hubintu waxay hore u diiwaangelisay shan imtixaan oo qaab-dhismeedka aan caadiga ahayn Abriil 24, 2026, ka hor inta aan la isu keenin natiijooyinka kama dambaysta ah ee jilitaanka. Xajintu waa dhexdhexaad labada khariidadoodba; afarta hadhay, inta yar mid kastaa way dhaaftaa, inta badanna midna ma dhaafto. Cabbirradaasi waa joomatari — qalab muunad-qaadasho tirakoob ma jiro, xog cod ma jirto. <strong>Tani waa natiijada udub-dhexaadka ah.</strong> Jilitaanku wuu xoojiyaa: inta yar waxay ku jirtaa dabada aadka u fog saddex ka mid ah afarta cabbir ee caddaaladda, tan afraad (farqiga waxtarka) waxyar ka hooseysa xariiqda hore loo dejiyay oo ah centile-ka 94.5, suurtagalnimada isku-darka ahna waa qiyaastii 1 ka mid ah 568,000 sawir dhexdhexaad ah hoostiisa — saqafka si ula kac ah taxaddarka u leh ee lagu sharxay Casing 8. Laba qoraal oo daacadnimo ayaa ku jira casing-yada: qaababka xuduudaha la calaamadeeyay laftoodu <em>ma aha</em> farsamada tooska ah ee isbeddelka kursiyada — sheegashadaasi way ku dhacday imtixaankeedii, dhicistaasina waa la soo sheegay (Casing 9; qoraalka dhammaystiran wuxuu ku yaal <a href='https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/redist_python_comparison.md' rel='noopener'>findings/redist_python_comparison.md</a>) — Swing-Zone Allocation Test-na kama badbaadin null-keedii la saxay, waana baadhitaan bilow ah oo keliya (Casing 10). Qaybta qaab-dhismeedka ayaa qaada kiiska; tirooyinku way xoojiyaan iyagoon qaadin.`},impact:{heading:`5: Saamaynta Matalaadda`,lanes_label:`WADDADA 1 IYO WADDADA 2`,lanes_body:`<strong>Waddada 1 (tirooyinka)</strong> waxay adeegsataa natiijooyinka doorashada si ay u tijaabiso in khariidaddu codadka si caddaalad ah ugu beddesho kursiyo: waxay eegtaa sida khariidaddu u shaqayso marka codadku si kala duwan u qaybsamaan. <strong>Waddada 2 (qaab-dhismeedka)</strong> waxay eegtaa khadadka la sawiray oo keliya — kala-qaybinta magaalooyinka, faafinta dadka, qaababka xudduudaha — mana adeegsato xog doorasho gabi ahaanba. Waddo kastaa waa madax-bannaan: khariidad waxay ku dhici kartaa mid, waxayna ku gudbi kartaa tan kale. Soo jeedinta inta yar labadaba way ku dhacdaa. Tan inta badan labadaba way ku gudubtaa.`,intro:`Waddada 1 waxay ku xidhan tahay natiijooyinka doorashada ee aad khariidadaha ku qiimeyso. Waddada 2 kuma xidhna. Caddaynteeda qaab-dhismeed waxay ku jirtaa khariidadaha laftooda: khadadka la sawiray, magaalooyinka la kala qaybiyay, iyo meelaha ay xudduuduhu raacaan, ama aanay raacin, khadad maamul oo u jira sababo kale. Imtixaannadan, labada khariidadood isuma dhowa.`,fig_alt:`Shax tiirar ah oo is barbar dhigaysa afar imtixaan oo caddaaladda qaab-dhismeedka ah oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay, iyo guddi dhibcaha soo koobidda ah. Tiirarka khariidadda inta badan waxay joogaan eber ama si fiican gudaha xadadka ammaanka ah. Shanta guddi saddex ka mid ah waxay leeyihiin xariiq dhicid oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay (go'go'an, casaan): cidhiidhiga woqooyi-bari/bartamaha Calgary, xudduudaha guddoomiyuhu calaamadeeyay ee hubintu xaqiijisay (saddex ka mid ah afartiisa), iyo kaadhka soo koobidda. Saddexdaas, tiirka inta yar wuxuu dhaafaa xariiqda, tiirka inta badanna wuu ku dhex jiraa. Guddiyada faafinta dadka iyo Airdrie ma laha xariiq dhicid; faafinta dadku waxay muujinaysaa inta badan oo 3,180 qof u jirta cabbirka degmada ee ku habboon, inta yarna 4,707 qof. Imtixaanka shanaad ee hore loo diiwaangeliyay, xajinta dawladda hoose, wuxuu ahaa dhexdhexaad labada khariidadoodba — labaduba waxay ku jireen caadiga Kanada ee 70–85% — sidaa darteed lama sawirin; guddiga soo koobiddu wuxuu inta yar siiyaa 4 ka mid ah 5, iyadoo xajinta loo tiriyay dhexdhexaad.`,fig_caption:`Afarta imtixaan ee caddaaladda qaab-dhismeedka ee hore loo diiwaangeliyay, oo is barbar yaal, iyo guddi dhibcaha soo koobidda ah. Tiirarka buluug-cagaarka ah waa khariidadda inta badan; tiirarka guduud-buluugga ah waa khariidadda inta yar. Xariiq go'go'an ayaa ka muuqata meesha imtixaan uu leeyahay xad dhicid oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay: cidhiidhiga woqooyi-bari/bartamaha Calgary, xudduudaha guddoomiyuhu calaamadeeyay ee hubintu xaqiijisay (saddex ka mid ah afartiisa), iyo kaadhka soo koobidda. Tiirka inta yar wuxuu dhaafaa xariiq kasta oo dhicid ah oo la muujiyay. Tiirka inta badan marna ma dhaafo. Guddiyada faafinta dadka iyo Airdrie ma laha xariiq dhicid — faafinta dadku waxay muujinaysaa inta badan oo 3,180 qof u jirta cabbirka degmada ee ku habboon, inta yarna 4,707 qof. Imtixaanka shanaad ee hore loo diiwaangeliyay, xajinta dawladda hoose, wuxuu ahaa dhexdhexaad labada khariidadoodba — labaduba waxay ku jireen caadiga Kanada ee 70–85% — sidaa darteed halkan lagama sawirin; guddiga soo koobiddu wuxuu inta yar siiyaa 4 ka mid ah 5, iyadoo xajinta loo tiriyay dhexdhexaad.`,table_intro:`Isla shanta imtixaan oo shax ah, xadka imtixaan kastaa wuxuu dhinac yaal natiijadiisa. Safka ugu hooseeya waa <em>soo koobidda</em> hubinta: imtixaannada shanta ah intee ayay khariidad kastaa ku dhacdaa.`,table_col_test:`Imtixaan`,table_col_majority:`Khariidadda inta badan`,table_col_minority:`Khariidadda inta yar`,table_col_direction:`Jiho / Ka faa'iidayste`,table_r1_a:`Xuduudku wuxuu raacaa khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira (caadiga Kanada 70–85%)`,table_r1_b:`80% — gudaha caadi`,table_r1_c:`72% — gudaha caadi`,table_r1_d:`M/J — labada ku jira caadiga Kanada`,table_r2_a:`Faafinta dadka (sii dhow ayay sii fiicantahay)`,table_r2_b:`3,180`,table_r2_c:`4,707 — 48% ka ballaadhan`,table_r2_d:`Qaab-dhismeed (Wuxuu yareeyaa sinaanta codka)`,table_r3_a:`Dheeraadka dadka woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary ee ka sarreeya celceliska`,table_r3_b:`2.8%`,table_r3_c:`11.5%`,table_r3_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu urursaa codadka NDP magaalada)`,table_r4_a:`Xudduudaha uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida`,table_r4_b:`0`,table_r4_c:`4 (3 ay hubintu xaqiijisay)`,table_r4_d:`M/J`,table_r5_a:`Kala-qaybinta Airdrie (xaddidaada ugu yar: 2)`,table_r5_b:`2 qaybood`,table_r5_c:`4 dhul ahaan; 3 dad ahaan (≥2%)`,table_r5_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu jeexaa awooda magaalada/xaafadaha)`,table_r6_a:`<strong>Soo koobid horay loo diiwaan-geliyay</strong> (&ge; 4 ka mid ah 5 = qiime aan caadi ahayn)`,table_r6_b:`<strong>0 ka mid ah 5 oo dhacay</strong>`,table_r6_c:`<strong>4 ka mid ah 5 oo dhacay</strong> (imtixaanka xajintu dhexdhexaad — labada khariidadood ku jira caadiga Kanada; 4-ta imtixaan ee hadhay way wada dhaceen)`,table_r6_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,rationales_p:`Natiijo gaar ah, oo inta yar keliya ku saabsan: <strong>lixda sababood ee ay xubnaha inta yar ee guddidu daabaceen, shan ka mid ah way ku dhacaan hubin madax-bannaan</strong>. Imtixaanku wuxuu ku socdaa inta yar oo keliya, sababtoo ah inta badan ma daabicin liis sababo ah oo ku saabsan dib-u-sawiridda lagu murmay. Hubintu si siman uguma dabaqi karto labada khariidadood, sidaa darteed halkan waxa lagu soo sheegay sidii hal calaamad, ma aha safaf dheeraad ah oo lagu daro tirinta waxyaabaha qaab-dhismeedka ee aan caadiga ahayn. (Hubintu mar waxay taxday dib-u-sawirid toddobaad. Waxa soo baxday inay ku dhisan tahay sheegasho ku saabsan xudduud federaal oo aan laga raadin karin warbixinta inta yar, sidaa darteed waa laga saaray, halkii loo dhaafi lahaa sidii sheegasho daciif ah.)`,chair_appendix_p:`Hubintu waxay sidoo kale tijaabisay sheegasho guud oo gaar ah oo ku jirta warbixinta inta badan, oo guddoomiyuhu saxeexay: in isbeddellada inta yar ee shan meelood (Airdrie, Cochrane, Chestermere, Red Deer iyo St. Albert) aanay helin <strong>taageero dadweyne</strong> 1,345-ka soo gudbin dadweyne (warbixinta kama dambaysta ah, bogagga 59 iyo 62). Raadin erey-fure ah oo lagu sameeyay kaydka soo gudbinnada oo dhan (93.4% mashiin ayaa akhriyay, 6.6% sawir keliya ah oo laga reebay; habka iyo caddaynta qaab kasta waxay ku jiraan <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/findings/submission_search_findings.md" rel="noopener">findings/submission_search_findings.md</a>) waxay soo saartay sawir ka faahfaahsan sheegashada guud ee inta badan iyo diidmo guud oo lagu sameeyo labadaba. Inta badan way saxnayd saddex ka mid ah shanta: kala-qaybinta 4-geesoodka ah ee Airdrie, isku-darka Calgary–Nolan-Hill–Cochrane iyo beddelka inta yar ee St. Albert midkoodna ma laha taageero la diiwaangeliyay. Way khaldanayd Chestermere, oo heshay soo gudbinno badan oo diidan in lagu daro Calgary, kuwaas oo si la taaban karo ula jaanqaadaya ujeeddada inta yar. Qayb ahaanna way khaldanayd Red Deer: isku-darrada Red Deer waxay heleen soo jeedin isku-dar ah oo ku saabsan agagaarka Red Deer, oo ka timid xildhibaan golaha magaalada Red Deer hadda ka fadhiya, oo jihada la jaanqaadaya laakiin aan qaabka saxda ah la mid ahayn. Laba qaab oo inta badan ay sababo kale ku weerartay ayaa sidoo kale helay taageero: Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park waxay heshay soo jeedin cad oo faahfaahsan oo ka timid ugu yaraan hal soo gudbin oo aagga Clearwater ah, iyo dhowr kale oo la jaanqaadaya, dadka Beiseker-na qoraal ayay ku taageereen Olds–Three-Hills–Didsbury. Sidaa darteed sheegashada guud ee inta badan ee ah "taageero dadweyne ma jirto" si cad ayay u ballaadhan tahay, laakiin meel bannaan lagama soo saarin, maadaama saddex ka mid ah shanta ay run yihiin. <strong>Natiijadani waxay ka hor imanaysaa inta badan, ma aha inta yar.</strong>`,summary_p:`<strong>Waddada 2, khariidadda inta badan waxay dhaaftaa eber xad qaab-dhismeed. Inta yar waxay dhaaftaa afar ka mid ah shanta, farqi weyn.</strong> Tiradu waa tirin cayriin ah. Ma aha suurtagalnimo qoys-dhan ah oo la habeeyay. Miisaankeedu wuxuu ka yimaadaa isku-raacnaanta jihada — imtixaan kasta oo dhaca wuxuu u jeedaa isla jihada — ma aha xisaab qaybin-null wadajir ah. Waddada tirakoobka (§3) ayaa bixisa suurtagalnimada wadajirka ah, iyadoo adeegsanaysa qalab kale.`},cpd:{heading:`4: Jeexitaan, Urursi, iyo Miirid`,vocab_label:`Saddex dhaqdhaqaaq, hal qorshe`,vocab_packing:`<strong>Urursi</strong> waxa loola jeedaa in codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi lagu cidhiidhiyo degmooyin uu xisbigu ku guuleysto farqi aad u weyn. Cod kasta oo la urursaday weli waa la tiriyaa, laakiin marka kursiga la helo waxba kuma darsado. Guulo waaweyn oo hal dhinac u janjeedha. Codad khasaaray.`,vocab_cracking:`<strong>Jeexitaan</strong> waxa loola jeedaa in bulsho loo kala qaybiyo degmooyin dhowr ah si aanay si toos ah ugu guuleysan midna. Magaalo awood u leh inay qaado laba kursi ayaa loo jeexaa afar, saddex ka mid ahna dadkeeda waa laga badan yahay. Codad la khafiifiyay. Hal kursi halkii laba ka heli lahaa.`,vocab_draining:`<strong>Miirid</strong> waa tallaabada la socota, oo khariidadda ka dhacda: degmooyinka la urursay iyo kuwa la jeexay waa is dhinac yaallaan, sidaa darteed taageerayaasha hal dhinac xad-dhaaf ugu urursan waxay awoodda codka ka "miiraan" degmooyinka la isku haysto ee ag yaal. Isku-dhowaanshahaas, sida degmooyinku isu taabanayaan, ayaa labada saamayn kordhiya. Urursiga iyo jeexitaanku way isku xoojiyaan iyagoo ka gudbaya khadadka degmooyinka.`,vocab_disclaimer:`Saddexdaba waxay dhici karaan iyadoo aan jirin ujeeddo xisbiyeed oo cad. Waxa hubintu cabbirto waa in qaabka, iyo cabbirkiisa tirakoob, uu la jaanqaadayo waxa habraac dhexdhexaad ah oo khariidad sawira uu soo saaro. <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md#5-results" rel="noopener">Habka oo dhammaystiran wuxuu ku jiraa §5 ee warbixinta farsamada.</a>`,fig_alt:`Laba tiir oo muujinaya sida khariidad kastaa u qaybiso dadka Airdrie, oo cabbir sax ah lagu sawiray. Inta badan: Airdrie-West waxay haysaa 50.6% magaalada, Airdrie-East-na 49.4%, labada qaybboodna inta badan waa Airdrie. Inta yar: Airdrie East waxay haysaa 54.7% magaalada, 89.6%-keedana waa Airdrie; Calgary-Airdrie waxay haysaa 24.0%, Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West-na 20.9%, labaduba inta badan waa Calgary; Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury waxay qaadataa qiyaastii 350 qof.`,fig_caption:`Sida khariidad kastaa u qaybiso dadka Airdrie. Inta badan waxay magaalada siisaa laba qaybood, labaduba inta badan waa Airdrie. Inta yar waxay siisaa hal, Airdrie East, oo haysa 54.7% magaalada, inta kale badideedana waxay gelisaa laba qaybood oo Calgary ay ku badan tahay.`,intro:`Shanta xubnood ee guddidu waxay ka shaqeeyeen isla xeerarka sharciga, isla juquraafiga gobolka, isla kaydka 1,345 soo gudbin dadweyne, iyo isla xogta tirakoobka dadka. Labadooda qabyo-qoraal ee isku tartamaya waxay isku raacsan yihiin inta badan Alberta. Halka qabyo-qoraalladu ku kala tagaan, waxay ku kala tagaan doorashooyin uu qof qolka ku jiray ahaa inuu sameeyo. Saddex ka mid ah doorashooyinkaas waxay mudan yihiin in loo arko doorashooyin. Ma aha tirooyin.`,airdrie_p:`<strong>Waxay Magaalada Airdrie u kala qaybisaa afar qaybood.</strong> Sharcigu wuxuu qayb doorasho kasta u xaddidaa hal-iyo-rubuc jeer celceliska gobolka, sidaa darteed Airdrie waxay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan laba qaybood. Khariidadda inta badan waxay siisaa laba. Inta yar waxay siisaa afar: woqooyi ilaa Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury, bari ilaa Airdrie East, galbeed ilaa Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West, bartamaha-koonfur ilaa Calgary-Airdrie. Qaybta woqooyi waxay haysaa qiyaastii 350 qof, sidaa darteed afarta saddex ka mid ah waxay haystaan ugu yaraan 2% magaalada. Airdrie East keligeed ayaa inta badan Airdrie ah; qayb kasta oo kale waxa lagu tolay degmo cidhifka Calgary ah ama miyi ah. Deggane Airdrie ah oo su'aal u haysa MLA-deeda waa inay ogaato qaybta magaalada ay ku nooshahay ka hor inta aanay wicin xafiiska saxda ah. Deriskeeda laba bloog u jira waxay siin doonaan saddex jawaabood oo kala duwan. Ururka waalidiinta iyo macallimiinta (PTA) ee dugsiga ilmaheeda ma diri karo hal wafdi oo hal MLA u taga su'aal ku saabsan maalgelinta dugsiyada. Waa inuu isku duwaa afar wafdi oo afar xafiis u taga, MLA-yadaas saddex ka mid ahna marka hore waxay u jawaabaan codbixiyayaal ka baxsan Airdrie. Ururka hockey-ga carruurta, bangiga cuntada, Rugta Ganacsiga: urur kasta oo magaalada oo dhan ka shaqeeya hadda wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa afar riding oo gobol.`,airdrie_callout_label:`SABABTA AIRDRIE AY MUHIIM U TAHAY`,airdrie_callout_p1:`Airdrie waxay leedahay 85,805 qof (tirakoobka dawladda hoose ee 2024). Hal gole, hal biil canshuur, hal qayb dugsiyeed: nidaam kasta oo madani ah wuxuu u arkaa hal unug.`,airdrie_callout_p2:`U kala qaybi afar qaybood oo gobol — Calgary-Airdrie, Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West, Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury iyo Airdrie East — saddex ka mid ahna waxa inta badan lagu aqoonsadaa maamul deris ah. Magaaladu waxay leedahay 85,805 deggane, iyo hal kursi oo golaha sharci-dejinta ah oo ay codbixiyayaasha intooda badani meesha ugu yeedhaan gurigooda. Khariidadda inta badan waxay siisaa laba.`,airdrie_callout_p3:`Kala-qaybin afar-jiho ah waxay aan u muuqato tijaabo kasta oo caddaaladda xisbiyeed marka laga reebo tan weydiineysa: codbixiye ma heli karaa MLA-gooda?`,airdrie_callout_summary:`Labada khariidadoodba waa sharci. Kala-qaybinta afar-jiho ah waa doorasho.`,airdrie_btn:`Tus degmooyinka la calaamadeeyay khariidadda`,anchoring_p:`<strong>Meesha ay ka leexato khadadka dawladda hoose, waxay ka leexataa meelo istiraatiiji ahaan muhiim ah.</strong> Marka khariidad doorasho ay raacdo cidhifka magaalo weyn ama magaalo yar, codbixiyayaashu way garan karaan halka qaybtoodu ka bilaabato iyo halka ay ku dhammaato: khadka canshuurta hantida, khadka qaybta dugsiyada, khadka waaxda doorashada hoose iyo khadka doorashada gobolka dhammaantood isku meel ayay ku dhacaan. Statistics Canada xudduudahan bilaash ayay u daabacdaa. Faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, labada khariidadood waxay khadadka dawladda hoose u raacaan heerar guud oo isu dhow — inta badan 80%, inta yar 72% — labaduba waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada ee 70–85% (Quebec: 78%, Ontario: 82%, BC: 71%; guddiyada la isbarbar dhigay waxa lagu diiwaangeliyay buugga cilmiga). (Falanqayntii ugu horreysay ee ku-meel-gaadhka ahayd ee hubinta waxay muujisay in inta yar ay xajinayso 15% keliya; tiradaasi kama badbaadin dib-u-xisaabinta lagu sameeyay faylasha rasmiga ah — eeg qoraalka sixidda ee hoose.) Waxa soo jeeda ma aha heerka guud. Waa halka ay leexashooyinka inta yar isku urursadaan. Saddexda xuduud ee uu guddoomiyaha guddidu laftiisu ku calaamadeeyay kuwo aan caadi ahayn — fidinta Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Rocky Mountain House-Banff Park">tus ↗</button> ee dhulka beerta qaranka ee aan la degin, marinka lasso-ga u eg ee Nolan Hill–Cochrane <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-Nolan Hill-Cochrane">tus ↗</button>, iyo gaadhitaanka Olds–North Airdrie <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Olds-Three Hills-Didsbury">tus ↗</button> — mid kastaa wuxuu ka go'aa juquraafiga madani ee hore u jiray, isla aagagga cidhifka magaalada halkaas oo isku-lammaynta codbixiyayaasha magaalada iyo miyiga ay sida ugu tooska ah u saamayso xisbiga ku guuleysta kursiga.`,anchoring_followup:`Xubnaha inta yar sabab ayay u sheegeen mid kasta oo ka mid ah saddexda xuduud ee la calaamadeeyay. Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park, waxay soo qaateen baaxadda juquraafi, marinka Highway 22, iyo sida ay dhulalka kaydka ah ee First Nations ugu dhow yihiin Rocky Mountain House. Guddoomiyaha guddidu wuxuu fidinta dhulka beerta qaranka ee aan la degin ku tilmaamay "isku day niyad xun" oo loogu talagalay buuxinta shuruudda baaxadda, odhaahdaasina waxay ku jirtaa warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee rasmiga ah ee guddida. Nolan Hill–Cochrane, waxay soo qaateen xidhiidhada gaadiidka iyo shaqada ee ay wadaagaan waqooyi-galbeed Calgary iyo Cochrane. Xogta safarka-shaqada ee Statistics Canada waxay muujinaysaa in 35.8% keliya oo shaqaalaha Cochrane ay gabi ahaanba u safraan Calgary; intooda badani waxay ka shaqeeyaan Cochrane gudaheeda. Gaadhitaanka Olds–North Airdrie, waxay soo qaateen sii-socodka marinka Highway 2. Hubintu waxay ogaatay in fidinta gaarka ah ee Airdrie ay ku dhacdo xagga tirada dadka. Marka si madax-bannaan loogu hubiyo xogta asalka ah, lixda sababood-hoosaad ee inta yar daabacday shan ka mid ah way dhacaan ama qayb ahaan uun bay run yihiin.`,packing_p:`<strong>Hal aag oo Calgary ah ayaa loo jeexjeexay si codbixiyayaasha NDP loogu urursado qaybo ka weyn celceliska.</strong> Degmooyinka woqooyi, bari iyo bartamaha Calgary <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-North West-Bearspaw">tus ↗</button>, qaybaha khariidadda inta yar waxay celcelis ahaan celceliska gobolka ka badan yihiin 11.5%. Khariidadda inta badan, 2.8%. Isla aagga juquraafi, oo ay sawirtay isla guddida iyadoo isla xaddidaadyada ku jirta, wuxuu soo saaraa degmooyin qiyaastii 8.5% ka weyn hal khariidad marka loo eego tan kale. Taasi waxay ku habboon tahay calaamadda qaab-dhismeed ee <em>urursiga</em>: in codbixiyayaasha hal xisbi lagu cidhiidhiyo degmooyin ka tiro yar oo ka weyn, si cod kasta oo ay dhiibtaan uu miisaan yar u yeesho. Urursiga iyo <em>jeexitaanka</em> (codbixiyayaasha xisbi oo si khafiif ah loogu kala firdhiyo degmooyin uu farqi yar ku waayo) waa labada tallaabo ee caadiga ah ee qaybsiga siyaasadeed. Labaduba waxay tirada kursiyada xisbi ka dhigaan wax ka yar saamigiisa codka.`,chair_p:`Guddoomiyaha guddida — oo lagu magacaabay isla Sharciga, kana shaqeynayay isla soo gudbinnada — wuxuu khariidadda inta yar ku calaamadeeyay afar xuduud oo juquraafi ahaan aan caadi ahayn, waxaana ka mid ah saddexdan: fidinta Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park ee dhulka beerta qaranka ee aan la degin; marinka Calgary-Nolan Hill–Cochrane ee u qaabaysan lasso; iyo gaadhitaanka Olds–Three Hills–Didsbury ee woqooyiga Airdrie. Isla guddoomiyahaas wuxuu khariidadda inta badan siiyay eber calaamadood oo noocaas ah. (Guud ahaan, dhaleeceynta guddoomiyuhu daabacay waxay daboolaysaa toddoba qaab xuduudeed: afarta calaamadood ee joomatari, iyo saddex meelood oo lagu magacaabay oo keliya sheegashada warbixinta inta badan ee ah in isbeddellada inta yar aanay helin taageero dadweyne. Hubintani si madax-bannaan ayay u xaqiijisay joomatari aan caadi ahayn saddex ka mid ah afarta calaamadood ee joomatari. Tan afraad, Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Calgary-Foothills-Airdrie West">tus ↗</button>, ma gaadhin xadka xaqiijinta ee hubinta.) Calaamadaha joomatari ee guddoomiyaha wixii ka baxsan, imtixaanka calaamadda jeexitaanka ee hubinta laftigeeda (cilmiyeed §5.3.2) ma calaamadeeyo kala-qaybinta afarta-geesoodka ah ee Airdrie. Waa kala-qaybin bulsho oo dadka Airdrie ka dhigaysa kuwa laga badan yahay afarta riding saddex ka mid ah, kuwaas oo wadajir u haysta ku dhowaad kala badh magaalada, laakiin imtixaanku wuxuu u baahan yahay in laga badnaado afartaba, Airdrie East-na inta badan waa Airdrie. Chestermere waxay u soo baxdaa mid u dhow jeexitaan; Cochrane, oo la ilaaliyay iyadoo dhan oo ah qiyaastii saddex meelood laba meel riding-keeda, ma aha. Qaar ka mid ah waxa xisaabta hubintu calaamadeyso, guddoomiyuhu ma calaamadeyn. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa saamaynta qaab-dhismeed. Ma aha ujeeddada.`},litmus:{heading:`3: Imtixaanka Caddaynta ee 1,010,000-Khariidad`,fig_alt:`Histogram muujinaya qaybinta farqiyada waxtarka ee 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo Alberta. Tobankii sagaal waxay u dhexeeyaan qiyaastii −1% iyo +4%. Khariidadda inta yar ee guddida (xariiqda guduud-buluugga ah) waxay ku taal centile-ka 94.5 (+4.0%), waxyar ka hor xariiqda go'go'an ee qiimaha ka baxsan, halkaas oo dabada midig ee hadhaysan ka bilaabato. Khariidadda inta badan (xariiqda buluug-cagaarka ah) waxay ku taal +0.1%, si fiican gudaha xadka caadiga ah.`,fig_caption:`Qaybinta <button class="vocab-term" data-def="cabbir muujinaya sida aan dheelitirnayn ee codadka loogu beddelo kursiyo — qiimaha togan wuxuu doorbidaa UCP, qiimaha tabanna wuxuu doorbidaa NDP" aria-expanded="false">farqiyada waxtarka</button> ee 1,010,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah oo Alberta, oo laga sawiray isla juquraafiga. Tobankii khariidadood ee dhexdhexaad ah sagaal waxay u dhexeeyaan qiyaastii −1% iyo +4%. Dabada midig ee hadhaysan waxay calaamadeysaa 5%-ka ugu sarreeya. +4.0%-ka soo jeedinta inta yar wuxuu ku jiraa <button class="vocab-term" data-def="boqolleyda khariidadaha helay dhibco ka hooseeya — p94 macnaheedu waa 94 ka mid ah 100 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa ka xisbinimo yaraa tan" aria-expanded="false">centile</button>-ka 94.5 — gobol ay gaadhaan wax ka yar 6 ka mid ah 100 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah. +0.1%-ka soo jeedinta inta badan lagama sooci karo waxa habraac dhexdhexaad ahi caadi ahaan soo saaro.`,table_intro:`Shaxdu waxay labada khariidadood dhigtaa is dhinac. Shanta saf ee ugu horreeya ma adeegsadaan natiijooyin doorasho; waa sifooyinka khadadka laftooda. Saddexda ugu dambeeya waxay ku xidhan yihiin sida codadka loogu qaybiyay degmo kasta.`,table_col_measured:`Waxa la cabbiray`,table_col_majority:`Khariidadda inta badan`,table_col_minority:`Khariidadda inta yar`,table_col_direction:`Jiho / Ka faa'iidayste`,table_r1_a:`Faafinta dadka degmooyinka (sii dhow sii fiican)`,table_r1_b:`3,180`,table_r1_c:`4,707 — 48% ka ballaadhan`,table_r1_d:`Qaab-dhismeed (Wuxuu yareeyaa sinaanta codka)`,table_r2_a:`Dheeraadka dadka woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary oo ka sarreeya celceliska`,table_r2_b:`2.8%`,table_r2_c:`11.5%`,table_r2_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu urursaa codadka NDP magaalada)`,table_r3_a:`Kala-qaybinta Airdrie`,table_r3_b:`2 qaybood`,table_r3_c:`4 dhul ahaan; 3 dad ahaan (≥2%)`,table_r3_d:`<strong>UCP</strong> (Wuxuu jeexaa awooda magaalada/xaafadaha)`,table_r4_a:`Xudduudaha raacaya khadadka dawladda hoose ee jira`,table_r4_b:`80% — gudaha caadi`,table_r4_c:`72% — gudaha caadi`,table_r4_d:`M/J — labada ku jira caadiga Kanada (70–85%)`,table_r5_a:`Xudduudaha uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida`,table_r5_b:`0`,table_r5_c:`3`,table_r5_d:`M/J`,table_r6_a:`Kursiyo codka 50/50 (centile soo-jeedinta 1,010,000-khariidad)`,table_r6_b:`46.1% — p78 (kala-duwanaanta caadi)`,table_r6_c:`51.7% — p99.99 (in ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 ayaa gaadha)`,table_r6_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,table_r7_a:`Farqiga Waxtarka (centile soo-jeedinta 1,010,000-khariidad)`,table_r7_b:`+0.1% — p16.5 (xadka caadiga ah)`,table_r7_c:`+4.0% — p94.5`,table_r7_d:`<strong>UCP</strong>`,table_r8_a:`Qaabka urursi-jeexitaan ee deriska`,table_r8_b:`2 calaamado silsilad isku xidhan`,table_r8_c:`1 (GUUL horay loo diiwaan-geliyay)`,table_r8_d:`Dhexdhexaad — inta yar waxay gaartaa saamayn xisbiyeed iyada oo loo marayo hybridization, ma aha miirid is-deris (§5.3.5)`,vocab_label:`EREYBIXIN`,vocab_eg:`<strong>Farqiga waxtarka.</strong> Hal tiro oo muujinaysa sida aan dheelitirnayn ee codadka xisbi loogu beddelo kursiyo. Tirooyinka togani waxay doorbidaan UCP; kuwa tabanna, NDP. Hubintu xariiqda qiimaha ka baxsan ee Alberta waxay dhigtaa ~4.1%: qiimaha ay dhaafaan 5% keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000-ka jilitaan ee dhexdhexaadka ah ee Alberta u gaarka ah. Xadkaas lagama soo amaahan suugaanta Maraykanka ama tan guud. Xad loo habeeyay maamul kale halkan wuu ku khaldanaan lahaa, sababtoo ah juquraafiga dabiiciga ah ee Alberta wuxuu soo saaraa xad dhexdhexaad oo ka duwan.`,vocab_mm:`<strong>Farqiga dhexe-dhexdhexaadka.</strong> Farqiga u dhexeeya saamiga codka degmada dhexe (median) ee xisbi iyo celceliska saamiga codka degmooyinkiisa. Marka hal xisbi ku guuleysto tartamo badan oo dhow, median-ku wuxuu ka sarreeyaa celceliska: codadkaas si waxtar leh ayaa loo kala firdhiyay. Marka xisbi ku guuleysto tartamo badan farqi weyn, celceliska ayaa ka sarreeya median-ka: codad ayaa khasaaraya. Farqi dhexe-dhexdhexaad oo weyn oo hal jiho u janjeedha wuxuu calaamadeeyaa waxtar-darro qaab-dhismeed oo ku jirta sida codadka hal dhinac loogu kala firdhiyay degmooyinka.`,vocab_percentile:`<strong>Darajada centile-ka.</strong> Hubintan, "centile" waa darajo ku dhex jirta 1,010,000-ka khariidadood ee dhexdhexaadka ah ee la jilay. "p94" macnaheedu waa 94% khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ayaa ka dhibco hooseeya: khariidadda dhabta ahi way ka daran tahay 94% sawirrada dhexdhexaadka ah. "p99.99" macnaheedu waa wax ka yar 1 ka mid ah 10,000 khariidadood oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha heerkaas.`,vocab_anchoring:`<strong>Xajin.</strong> Qaybtaarka xuduud doorasho oo ku taal khad maamul oo horey u jiray — xadkii magaalada, xuduud qaybinta iskuulka, xariiqda tirakoob ee Statistics Canada.`,closing_p1:`Safafka hoose waxay ku xidhan yihiin natiijooyinka doorashada. Imtixaanka <em>seats@50/50</em> wuxuu codbixiyayaasha ku hayaa sinnaan buuxda — UCP iyo NDP mid kastaa wuxuu helayaa si sax ah kala badh codadka gobolka oo dhan — wuxuuna weydiiyaa inta kursi ee khariidaddu siinayso UCP. Khariidadaha dhexdhexaadka ah ee Alberta waxay soo saaraan median qiyaastii 44.8% kursiyada UCP. Juquraafiga Alberta, oo codbixiyayaasha NDP ay ku urursan yihiin bartamaha magaalooyinka, codbixiyayaasha UCP-na ay ku kala firirsan yihiin riding-yada miyiga, wuxuu NDP siiyaa faa'iido waxtar oo yar marka la sinnaado. Khariidadda inta badan, oo ah 46.1%, waxay ku jirtaa centile-ka 78 ee jilitaanka 1,010,000-ka khariidadood: si fiican gudaha xadka caadiga ah. Khariidadda inta yar, oo ah 51.7%, waxay ku jirtaa centile-ka 99.99. Wax ka yar 100 ka mid ah 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah ayaa gaadha qiimahaas. <em>Farqiga waxtarka</em> wuxuu cabbiraa sida aan dheelitirnayn ee codadka xisbi kasta loogu beddelo kursiyo. Faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, farqiga waxtarka ee inta yar waa +4.0%, centile-ka 94.5: waxyar ka hooseeya xariiqda qiimaha ka baxsan ee hubinta ee centile-ka 95. Su'aalaha furitaanka ee bogga sare ayaa sharxaya cawaaqibta.`,closing_p2:`Safka ugu dambeeya dhinaca kale ayuu u jeedaa. Imtixaanka miirista-deriska, khariidadda inta yar waxay leedahay calaamado silsilad isku-xidhan oo ka yar kuwa inta badan: 1 marka loo eego 2-da inta badan (iyo 5-ta khariidadda la dhaqan-geliyay ee 2019). Hubintu imtixaankan way diiwaangelisay ka hor inta aanay cabbirin, tirada yar ee inta yarna waa GUUL dhab ah oo hore loo diiwaangeliyay. Inta yar ma muujiso qaabka caadiga ah ee isku-dhowaanshaha urursi-iyo-miirid. Waa imtixaanka keliya ee inta yar ay tiro ahaan kaga fiican tahay inta badan. §5.3.5 ee warbixinta cilmiyeed ayaa sharxaya sababta. Inta yar waxay saamaynteeda xisbiyeed ku gaadhaa isku-darid (hybridization) — kala-qaybin magaalo oo urursiga iyo jeexitaanka gudaha u gelisa qaybo doorasho oo gaar ah (ED-yada) — imtixaanka silsiladda isku-dhowaanshahana, oo cabbira oo keliya sida degmooyinka la urursay ugu urursan yihiin agagaarka kuwa la jeexay, ma arki karo.`},commission_split:{heading:`2: Sida Guddidu u Kala Qaybsantay`,intro:`Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee Alberta waxay shaqadeeda dhammaysay Maaris 23, 2026, mana heshiin karin. Saddex xubnood ayaa soo saaray hal khariidad; labada kale waxay soo saareen mid kale. Guddoomiyaha Guddida, Garsoore Dallas K. Miller, iyo laba xubnood oo mucaaradku magacaabay ayaa qoray warbixinta inta badan; laba xubnood oo dawladdu magacawday — Dr. Julian Martin iyo John D. Evans — ayaa qoray warbixinta inta yar. Kala-qaybsanaantu waxay ku saabsanayd sida loo sawiro xudduudaha bulshooyinka cidhifka magaalooyinka ee si degdeg ah u koraya. Inta badan waxay Airdrie siisay laba degmo; inta yar afar. Inta badan waxay qaybaha woqooyi/bari/bartamaha Calgary ka dhigtay kuwo u dhow celceliska gobolka; inta yar waxay ka dhigtay 11.5% ka sarreeya. Labada khariidadood waxay raacaan isla sharciga. Labaduba waa sharci sida uu dhigayo <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>. Khilaafku wuxuu ku saabsanaa qaababka juquraafi ee gaarka ah ee sida ugu fiican ugu adeegaya bulshooyinka la sawirayay. Xisbiga xukuma Alberta waa United Conservative Party (UCP); mucaaradkiisa ugu weyn waa New Democratic Party (NDP). Xisbiyo ka yar — Alberta Party, Liberal Party of Alberta, iyo kuwo kale — sidoo kale kursiyo ayay u tartamaan, laakiin saamigooda codka gobolka ee la isku daray wuxuu doorashooyinkii dhowaa ahaa mid aad u yar oo aan si la taaban karo u saamayn xisaabaha caddaaladda xisbiyeed ee hubinta, kuwaas oo ku dhisan kala-qaybsanaanta UCP–NDP ee 2023. Hubintani waxay labada khariidadood ku cabbirtay isla hababka, oo si isku mid ah loo dabaqay. Afar natiijo ayaa soo jeeda.`,finding1:`<strong>Labada khariidadood waxay ku kala duwanaadaan lix wax oo aad cabbiri karto iyada oo aanad fiirinin natiijooyin doorasho:</strong> sida dadku si siman loogu faafiyay degmooyinka, in codbixiyayaashu ay urursan yihiin, sida magaalooyinka aad loogu kala gooyay, in xudduuduhu raacaan xudduudaha magaalada, qaabka degmooyinka, iyo immisa xuduud uu Guddoomiyaha Guddida Mudane Garsoore Miller lafteedu calaamadeeyay inay yihiin kuwo aan caadi ahayn (§5.8.2 warbixinta inta badan iyo Lifaaqa C). Khariidadda inta yari way ka duwantahay inta badan mid kasta oo kaas ka mid ah.`,finding2:`<strong>Farqi kasta oo la cabbiray wuxuu u dhaqaaqaa isla jiho.</strong> Meel kasta oo labada khariidadood ay ku kala duwanaadaan — woqooyi iyo bari Calgary, Airdrie, aagagga magaalada ee leh xudduudaha cad ee magaalada — khariidadda laga yar yahay waxay sawirtaa xudduudo si khafiif ah u faafiya codadka NDP oo u oggolaada codadka UCP inay si waxtar leh u tirsanaadaan. Bulshooyinka aad ugu beddesho khariidadda laga yar yahay waa isla bulshooyinka halka NDP ay ugu xoog badan tahay. Hubintu ma go'aamin karto niyad. Waxay cabbiri kartaa saamayn.`,finding3:`<strong>Habraaca beddelay guddida wuxuu lahaa hal tusaale oo hore oo ka mid ah wareegyada dib-u-qaybinta Kanada ee hubintani dib u eegtay: kii Alberta laftigeeda, 1992.</strong> Gobollada la dib u eegay midkoodna uma dhiibo dib-u-qaybinta, iyadoo wareeggu socdo, guddi uu xisbiga xukunka hayaa maamulo. Badankoodu waxay ku waajibiyaan golaha sharci-dejinta inuu marka hore ka doodo khariidadda guddida, ama waxay khariidaddaas siiyaan saamayn toos ah haddii aanu goluhu ka adkaan. Alberta midna ma samayso. Halkan warbixinta guddidu waxba ma beddesho ilaa goluhu ansixiyo <em>Sharciga Degmooyinka Doorashada</em> oo gaar ah, sidaa darteed xisbiga xukunka haya ayaa go'aamiya in khariidad guddi ay sharci noqoto iyo in kale. Abriil 21 Goluhu awooddaas ayuu adeegsaday: Mooshinka Dawladda 37, oo lagu ansixiyay 44 ilaa 36, wuxuu dhinac iska dhigay labada khariidadood ee guddida, shaqadana wuxuu u dhiibay guddi MLA ah oo UCP aqlabiyad ku leedahay. Sababta ay dawladdu sheegtay waxay ahayd Talada 5 ee guddoomiyaha. Waxa taladaasi dhab ahaan weydiisanayso ayaa xiga.`,closing:`<strong>Habraacu waa natiijada laftiisa, oo ka gooni ah khariidadaha.</strong>`},november:{heading:`Guddiga Lunty`,context_label:`MACNAHA`,context_body:` — Qaybtan waxay sharraxaysaa habraaca beddelay guddida iyo qaab-dhismeedka sharci ee khuseeya. Kama mid aha natiijooyinka tirakoobka. Natiijooyinku waxay ku jiraan afar iyo tobanka casing ee kor ku xusan.`,intro:`Khariidadaha guddida midkoodna ma dhaqan galin. Abriil 21, 2026 Golaha Sharci-dejintu wuxuu ansixiyay Mooshinka Dawladda 37, oo labadaba dhinac iska dhigay, dib-u-qaybintana u gudbiyay Guddi Gaar ah oo Xulan oo ka kooban lix MLA — afar UCP, laba NDP — oo uu guddoomiyo Brandon Lunty (UCP, Leduc-Beaumont). Guddiga laftiisu ma sawiro khariidadda. Wuxuu kormeeraa Guddida Talo-bixinta Madax-bannaan oo gooni ah, oo lagu sameeyay isla mooshinkaas, loona xilsaaray inay soo saarto soo jeedin xudduudeed oo 91 kursi ah.`,h_anomalous:`Sababta Guddiga Uu Yahay Midkaan Caadi Ahayn`,anomalous_p1:`Dhaqanka dib-u-qaybinta Kanada, tan iyo 1960-meeyadii, wuxuu ku degay hal qaab: guddi madax-bannaan, oo laga ilaaliyay amarka dawladda, ayaa soo saara talooyinka xudduudaha; golaha sharci-dejintu waa ka doodi karaa, laakiin si fudud kama adkaan karo iyadoo aan cod sharci-dejin oo rasmi ah la qaadin. Habraaca sharciga ee Alberta ee hoos yimaada <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> wuxuu raacaa qaabkan — laakiin hal farqi qaab-dhismeed ayuu kala leeyahay maamullada qaarkood: warbixinta guddida Alberta ma laha saamayn sharci oo toos ah. Sharciga hoostiisa, Sharci Degmooyinka Doorashada oo gaar ah waa in goluhu ansixiyaa si khariidad guddi kasta ay u yeelato awood sharci. Taas macnaheedu waa in dawladda xilligaas jirtaa ay maamusho ma aha oo keliya in khariidadda guddida laga doodo, balse inay waligeed sharci noqoto iyo in kale. Maamullada kale ee Kanada waxay qaataan qaabka caadiga ah ee lidka ku ah: talooyinka guddidu way dhaqan galaan haddii aanu goluhu si cad ugu codeyn inuu ka adkaado.`,anomalous_p2:`Waxa dawladdu samaysay Abriil 2026 wuxuu tusaale hore ku lahaa Alberta laftigeeda: 1992, shaqadii guddi ku xayirmay waxa loo gudbiyay guddi MLA ah. Markan waxay u oggolaatay habraac guddi oo dhammaystiran oo la daabacay inuu dhammaado — warbixinta inta badan iyo tan inta yar labadaba waa la gudbiyay — kadibna hawsha dib-u-qaybinta waxay u gudbisay guddi lix xubnood ah oo MLA ah, oo aqlabiyaddiisa (afar ka mid ah lix) xisbiga xukunka hayaa leeyahay, iyadoo aan warbixinnada guddida midkoodna cod loo qaadin. Guddiga Lunty ma aha guddi madax-bannaan (commission). Ma laha madax-bannaani sharci oo ka xor ah amarka sharci-dejineed ee dawladda. Aqlabiyaddiisa afarta xubnood ee UCP waxay u dhigantaa maamulka dawladda ee golaha sharci-dejinta. Ma jiro gobol kale oo Kanada ah oo awoodda dib-u-qaybinta, iyadoo wareeggu socdo, u wareejiyay guddi sharci-dejineed oo dawladdu maamusho ka dib markii guddi madax-bannaan uu dhammaystay shaqadiisa.`,h_framework:`Qaab-dhismeedka Dastuuriga ah`,framework_p1:`Qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha</em> — "Muwaadin kasta oo Kanada wuxuu leeyahay xaqa u codaynta doorashada xubnaha Golaha Guud ama golaha sharci dejinta" — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay u tarjumeen ma aha oo kaliya ficilka samaynta cod balse <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em>. Xukun-hogaanka ugu muhiimsani waa <em>Tixraaca Xudduudaha Doorashada Gobolka (Saskatchewan)</em> [1991] 2 SCR 158, oo McLachlin J. (sida ay markaas ahayd) uu ugu qoray aqlabiyadda in ujeedada §3 "ma aha sinaanta awoodda codku nafteeda, balse xaqa matalaad waxtar leh." Sinnaanta dadka waa ujeedada ugu muhiimsanka ah; ka leexashada waa la oggolyahay marka uu ku salaysan yahay danta bulshada, juquraafiga, taariikhda, ama ujeedooyinka matalaadda dadka tirada yar.`,framework_p2:`Qaab-dhismeedka Saskatchewan ma mamnuucayso si buuxda tixgelidaha xisbiyeed ee dib-u-qaybinta. Waxa uu dejinayaa waa in khariidadaha xudduudaha ay, guud ahaan, bixiyaan matalaad waxtar leh codbixiyayaasha — iyo in xadgudubka nidaamsan ee awooda koox la aqoon karo inay doorato matalaad la xaddidan ay qaabka §3 ee xeerka dacwadaha beegsado. Natiijooyinka tirakoobka iyo qaab-dhismeedka hubinta — meelaynta khariidadda laga yar yahay ee 99.99-aad centile ee 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah, gudbiddeeda afar ka mid ah shanta xadadka qaab-dhismeed (shanaadka, xajinta, waa dhexdhexaad labada khariidadood), bulshooyinka la aqoonsaday ee saameysay — waa diiwaanka caddaynta ee dacwad-gudbiye §3 ah uu u baahan lahaa in uu uruuriyo. Dhinaca danta bulshada ee diiwaankaas, go'aanka Maxkamadda Federaalka ee <em>Raîche v. Canada</em> (2004 FC 679) waa xukun-hogaanka Kanada ugu muhiimsan: maxkamaddu halkaas waxay ku qasbatay Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada ee Federaalka inay dib u eegto xudduudaha oo indha-tirtay danta bulshada Acadian ee New Brunswick. Cabbirrada xajinta maamulka ee hubinta iyo natiijooyinkeeda bulsho gaarka ah — Airdrie oo loo kala qaybiyay afar degmooyin, anomalies-ka cidhif-magaaleed ee woqooyi-galbeed Calgary ee guddoomiyaha calaamadeeyay — waa isla nooca caddaynta ay Maxkamadda Federaalku ku dhaqmatay si sharci ahaan la aqoonsan karo. In diiwaankaas uu gaaro xadka dastuuriga ah waa su'aal sharci ah oo hubintani go'aaminayso ma aha; hubintu waxay sheegtaa cabbirka.`,framework_p3:`Xeeriyaynta guddiga sida habraac waa su'aal gooni ah. <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta si cad uma mamnuucayn golaha sharci dejinta inuu dhiso hay'ad dib-u-qaybinta oo parallel ah, maxaa yeelay Sharciga wuxuu taaban yahay in golaha sharci dejintu dhaqan-galineyso xudduudaha ugu dambe ee sharci caadi ah iyada oo aan loo eegin. In habraaca guddiga, haddii uu soo saaro khariidad leh muuqaalka qaab-dhismeedka iyo tirakoobka ee soo jeedinta laga yar yahay, uu baadi goob ka badbaadi karo dacwad §3 ee Axdiga waxay ku xidhantahay in matalaad waxtar leh lagu gaadhi karo hoos xudduudaha soo baxay — isla tijaabada ku daban karto khariidad guddi kasta oo soo saartay.`,h_quebec:`Isbarbardhigga Quebec`,quebec_p1:`Quebec waxay bixisaa isbarbardhigga ugu khuseeya xaalada Alberta. Commission de la représentation électorale (CRE) ee Quebec waa hay'ad xudduudo doorasho oo joogto ah oo madax-bannaan, ma aha guddi ad hoc oo la aasaasay kii dib-u-qaybinta. CRE waxay si joogto ah u shaqeysaa mana la baabbi'in karto ama la ka gudbi karo amar golaha wasiirada. Hoos <em>Loi électorale</em> ee Quebec, CRE lafteeda ayaa dejisa khariidadda doorashada ee kama-dambaysta ah: Golaha Qaran wuxuu ka dooda warbixinta guddida wuxuuna dhegeystaa ra'yi-celin, laakiin uma codeeyo inuu ansixiyo ama ka noqdo — toban maalmood gudahood ee doodaas guddidu waxay dejisaa xudduudaha, kuwaas oo lagu daabaco Gazette officielle. Saamaynta waxtar leh waa in xisbi xukunka, isaga oo awood laftiisa ku shaqaynaya, aanu bedeli karin khariidadda uu dooray meesha khariidadda guddida; xadaynta lafteeda, hay'adda madax-bannaan ayaa leh erayga ugu dambeeya.`,quebec_p2:`Qaabka Quebec wuxuu ka soo baxay qaybtaan sababo la xiriira waxa dhaca marka dib-u-qaybintu aanay ka xorriyeysan xukumaadda xisbiyeed. Isbarbardhigga habraaca hadda ee Alberta — halka guddi xukumaaddu xukunto uu beddelay shaqada guddida ka hor intaanay golaha sharci dejintu u codeyn warbixin guddiba — wuxuu iftiimiyaa farqiga qaab-dhismeed ee u dhexeeya nidaamyada dib-u-qaybinta ee u maleynaya cadaadiska xisbiyeed oo ay ka dhegaystaan, marka loo eego nidaamyada halka cadaadiskaas uu haysto jid cad oo ku wajahan natiijada.`,closing:`Hubintu waxay ku dabaqi doontaa isla tijaabaha khariidadda guddiga Lunty marka la sii daayo. Indho-indhaynta dastuuriga ah iyo isbarbardhigga kor ku xusan waa macnaha; habraacba ma is-beddelo.`},references:{heading:`Tixraacyada iyo Habka`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye tixraacyada`,intro:`Habku wuxuu ku tiirsan yahay suugaan la aqoonsan yahay oo ku saabsan cilmiga siyaasadda, tirakoobka iyo sharciga. Tixraacyada oo dhammaystiran waxay raacaan qaabka American Political Science Association (APSA); kiisaska maxkamaduhu waxay raacaan heshiiska sharciga Kanada. Liiska tixraacyada oo dhammaystiran wuxuu ku jiraa <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/blob/master/reports/academic/report_academic.md" rel="noopener">warbixinta farsamada</a>. Ilaha muhiimka ahi waa kuwan.`,h_academic:`Suugaanta akadeemiga`,h_cases:`Kiisaska maxkamadeed`,h_statutes:`Sharciyada`},resources:{heading:`Warbixinnada iyo koodhka`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye farsamo`,tag_plain:`Luuqad Fudud`,plain_label:`Warbixinta dadweynaha oo buuxda`,plain_desc:`Dhaadheer, oo leh khariidado, loogu talagalay akhristayaasha guud`,tag_summary:`Soo koobid`,summary_label:`Soo koobida natiijooyinka`,summary_desc:`Guudmar luuqad fudud ah oo fikrad kasta eber ka sharxaya`,tag_academic:`Akadeemi`,academic_label:`Warbixinta farsamada`,academic_desc:`Habab buuxa iyo tixraacyo loogu talagalay cilmibaadhayaasha`,tag_notebook:`Buug-Xisaab`,notebook_label:`Buug-xisaab is-dhexgal ah`,notebook_desc:`Shaxaha adigu ku socodsii, biraawsarkaaga dhexdiisa, adigoon waxba rakibin`,tag_code:`Kood`},about_me:{heading:`Ku saabsan aniga`,p1:`Arday baad ahay Mount Royal University. Cilmibaadhistani waxaan u sameeyay nafteeyda — lama bixin sida hawl dugsi ah oo jaamacaddu sidoo kale uma abaalmarin. Aragtideyda waa kuweygii gaarka ah oo uma matalin jaamacadda. I've worked as a contract election officer for Elections Alberta for about 27 years, election by election, administering the vote on election day. I'm not under contract now; I last worked at a recent election. I've had no other employment with Elections Alberta and have no knowledge of its work beyond those tasks. Nothing in this audit comes from that work; every input is public. This research is my own, not Elections Alberta's, and does not speak for it. I have no connection to the commission. I've voted for and donated to both conservative and progressive provincial parties in Alberta as an adult.`,p2:`Taariikhdayda siyaasadeed waxay saamayn kartaa sida aan arrintan u eego, ilaalinta ugu weyn ee taas ka dhanka ahna waa habka. Labada khariidadood si isku mid ah ayaan u tijaabiyay, imtixaannadayda ayaan si dadweyne ah u diiwaangeliyay, diiwaanno waqti lagu dhejiyay ayaan sameeyay, natiijo kasta waxaan ku calaamadeeyay mid hore loo diiwaangeliyay ama mid baadhitaan bilow ah, wax walbana internetka ayaan saaray si qof kastaa u hubin karo shaqadayda. Cilmi-baadhistan lacagteeda anigaa iska bixiyay. Haddii aad hesho wax aan ku khaldamay, waan rabaa inaan ogaado.`,p3:`Diiwaannada balanqaadka-abuurka iyo diiwaan-gelinta hore: <a href="https://osf.io/6pt83" rel="noopener">OSF:6pt83</a>, AsPredicted:#289,469, AsPredicted:#289,451 — abuurayaasha random-ka ah waxaa wakhti loogu dhejiyay beacon dadweyne ka hor inta aan la sii dayn shaybaadhada rasmiga ah; tijaabada miirida-deriska (#289,451) waxaa la diiwaan-geliyay ka hor cabbirka, kuwa kalena waxaa la xareeyay agagaarka falanqaynta sahminta ah.`,p4:`Su'aalo ama saxitaanno: `},translation_about:{heading:`Ku saabsan turjumaaddaan`,p1:`Waxaad akhrinaysaa turjumaad AI. Moodeelka Fable 5 ee Anthropic ayaa soo saaray, weli wuxuu sugayaa dib-u-eegis qof afka u leh. Nooca Ingiriisigu waa qoraalka sugan: haddii wax turjumaaddan ku jira ay mugdi yihiin ama ay u muuqdaan khalad, asalka Ingiriisiga ayaa la raacayaa.`,p2:`Tayada turjumaaddu halkan way muhiim tahay, si aanay ugu ahayn inta badan mareegaha. Hubintani waxay sheegtaa sheegashooyin tirakoob oo ku saabsan caddaaladda doorashada, tiro si khaldan loo turjumay ama jumlad digniinteeda si khaldan loo dhigay waxay u marin habaabin kartaa siyaabo uu akhristuhu ku adkaan doono inuu ogaado. Turjumaadda mashiinka ee qoraalka tirakoobka-madaniga ah runtii way adag tahay. Khaladaad way dhici karaan.`,p3:`Haddii aad tahay qof afka u leh oo aad aragto khalad — ama aad jeclaan lahayd inaad si fiican dib ugu eegto qayb — fadlan %s. Si aad u qiyaasto cabbirka: qoraalka Ingiriisiga ahi waa qiyaastii {count} eray. Waad qaadan kartaa dhammaantii, ama qayb keliya. Inta badan shaqadu waa saxidda khaladaad yaryar oo mashiinku sameeyay, ma aha turjumaad eber laga bilaabo, xitaa dib-u-eegista hal qayb ayaa caawisa.`,p3_link:`nala soo xidhiidh`},retractions:{heading:`Ka-noqoshooyinka iyo Saxitaannada`,heading_aria:`Xiriiriye ka-noqoshooyinka`,conditions_label:`SHURUUDAHA KA NOQOSHO`,conditions_intro:`Natiijo kasta waxaa horay loo go'aamiyay shuruud been-abuur ah oo gaar ah. Haddii shuruud kasta oo hoose soo baxdo, natiijada ay magacaabto waxaa si calan ah laga noqda 30 maalmood gudahoodba. Gunaanadka jiho-guud ee oo dhan — in khariidadda laga yar yahay ay ku taallo meel ka baxsan kala-duwanaanta dhexdhexaadka tijaabooyin badan oo madax-bannaan — waxaa laga noqda marka loo eego shuruudda iskudhafan ee hababka horay loo balanqaaday: ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah lixda cabbir qaab-dhismeed oo madax-bannaan oo jihadooda rogaya.`,c1_title:`Shuruudda 1 — Waxa la caddeeyaa in kala-doorashadu qasab tahay`,c1_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Natiijada qaab-dhismeedka ah ee ah in kala-qaybinta afar-jiho ah ee Airdrie iyo saddexda xuduud ee guddoomiyaha calaamadeeyay aanay ku sharxi karin sababta danta bulshada ee inta yar u sheegtay.`,c1_cond:`Shuruudda: qof ayaa muujiya in aanay jirin khariidad Alberta oo sharci ah oo buuxin karta sababaha inta yar laftigeedu sheegtay — Airdrie, Cochrane, Nolan Hill, Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park — iyadoo isla markaas ku xajinaysa khadadka dawladda hoose heerar la mid ah kuwa inta badan. Khariidad ka-hor-imaad ah oo labadaba samaysa waxay taa beddelkeeda xoojin lahayd natiijada (Wax-ka-beddelka 27). Xudduudaha rasmiga ah, shuruuddani ma khusayso: labada khariidadoodba hore ayay khadadka dawladda hoose ugu xajinayaan heer ka sarreeya xadkeeda 60% (inta yar 71.8%, inta badan 80.0%). Caqabadda furan waxay ku taal <a href="https://github.com/Ixby/alberta-electoral-boundaries-audit/issues/14" rel="noopener">Arrinta #14</a>.`,c2_title:`Shuruudda 2 — Dhaafista horay loo diiwaan-geliyay ee Neighbour-Drain waxaa lagu soo celiyay`,c2_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Qoraalka Casing 10 ee khariidadda inta yar u diiwaangeliya GUUL hore loo diiwaangeliyay oo ku saabsan imtixaanka isku-dhowaanshaha miirista-deriska.`,c2_cond:`Shuruudda: qiimaha miiridda joogtada ah ee v2 wuxuu ku dhacaa dabada sare oo xooggani (p &lt; 0.05) ee bannaanka kala-duwanaansho ee tanaasulka graph-ka joogtada ah oo go'an, taas oo macnaheedu yahay in dhaafistuhu ahayd artefact cabbiris oo habka qiimeynta v1 binary ee dab ah halkii uu ka noqon lahaa natiijo mala-awaal dhab ah oo eber ah.`,c3_title:`Shuruudda 3 — Dukumeenti guddi oo ka hor 2026 ayaa muuqday`,c3_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Istidlaalkii ah in doorashooyinka xudduudaha inta yar ay ahaayeen go'aamada sawirka halkii ay ka noqon lahaayeen jawaabaha soo gudbinnada bulshada ee la diiwaangeliyay.`,c3_cond:`Shuruudda: dukumeenti guddi oo gudaha ah oo la taariikh-xidhay ka hor doorashooyinka xudduudaha ugu dambe ee inta yar waxay muujinaysaa in doorashooyinkaas si gaar ah ugu dhacay soo gudbinnada bulshada oo hubintu aanay arkin — ma aha lixda sabab-hoosaad oo daabacay ee hubintu tijaabisay.`,c4_title:`Shuruudda 4 — Natiijada doorashada 2027 waxay liddi u tahay soo-jeedinta`,c4_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Natiijada jilitaanka — in marka codku siman yahay khariidadda inta yar ay bixiso saami kursiyo oo ay dhaafaan 69 keliya oo ka mid ah 1,010,000 sawir oo dhexdhexaad ah.`,c4_cond:`Shuruudda: haddii doorashada gobolka 2027 ku dhacdo khariidad guddida midkood oo kala-qaybinta kursiga xisbiyeed ee dhabta ah uu u liddi yahay saadaalinta jiho-ahaan ee codadka 2023, natiijooyinka centile Waddada 1 waxaa dib loogu eegaa natiijooyin dhab ah.`,c5_title:`Shuruudda 5 — Maxkamad Alberta ah ayaa kala saareysa xukunta SCC ee Quebec`,c5_what:`<em>Waxa laga noqday:</em> Doodda habraaca §7 ee ah in Mooshinka Dawladda 37 ee beddelaya guddida guddiga Lunty uu ku jiro isla fasalka dastuuriga ah ee barafaynta dib-u-qaybinta Quebec ee 2024.`,c5_cond:`Asalka: Abriil 22, 2026 — maalin kadib Mooshinka Dawladda 37 ee Alberta — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay ansixisay, 7–2 iyo madaxa baniga, xukunta Maxkamadda Dib-u-eeegista ee Quebec in barafaynta sharci dejineed ee dawladda Legault ee guddida dib-u-qaybinta ay xadgudbtay dammaanada matalaadda dimuqraadiga ee §3 ee Axdiga. Shuruudda: maxkamad dib-u-eegeysa Mooshinka Alberta waxay ka helaysaa inuu si dastuuriyad kala duwan yahay — tusaale ahaan, maxaa yeelay u-wareejinta shaqada guddi MLA ah waxay si qaab-dhismeed ah uga duwan tahay barafaynta sharci dejineed, ama maxaa yeelay falanqaynta matalaadda waxtarka ee §3 ee Alberta waxay si kala duwan u soo baxaysaa marka loo eego Quebec.`,corr_label:`SAXITAANNADA LA DIIWAANGELIYAY (dib-u-xisaabinta canonical-ka, 2026-05-11)`,corr_intro:`Natiijadii hore ee soo socota ma badbaadin dib-u-falanqaynta marka loo eego shaybaadhka rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta (la helay 2026-05-06). Waxaa halkan lagu hayaa siyaasadda horay loo go'aamiyay ee hubinta ee ah in abid la tirtirsan natiijooyin guuldareystay.`,corr_municipal:`<strong>Xajinta dawladda hoose.</strong> Falanqayntii qabyada ahayd ee hore, oo adeegsatay xudduudo khariidadeed oo ku-meel-gaadh ah, waxay muujisay in khariidadda inta yar ay khadadka dawladda hoose u raacdo 15% oo keliya — 4.9&times; ka hooseysa caadiga Kanada ee 70–85%. Tiradani waxay ahayd wax ka dhashay dib-u-dhiska xudduudaha ku-meel-gaadhka ah (xilligii DPG). Faylasha rasmiga ah ee Elections Alberta, labada khariidadood waxay ku jiraan caadiga Kanada: inta badan 80%, inta yar 72%. <em>Kala-duwanaanshaha</em> xajinta dawladda hoose ee u dhexeeya labada khariidadood ma aha calaamad ka badbaadda dib-u-xisaabinta faylasha rasmiga ah. Saddexda xuduud ee aan caadiga ahayn ee guddoomiyaha guddidu calaamadeeyay (Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park, Nolan Hill–Cochrane, Olds–North Airdrie) way sii jiraan, saxitaankanina ma saamaynayo.`},suggestions:{heading:`Talooyin`,heading_aria:`Xidhiidhka talooyinka`,intro:`Hubintani waxay la kulmay laba dhibaato xog oo aan xiriir lahayn shaqada guddida iyo wax kasta oo la xidhiidha sida nidaamka doorashada ee Alberta loo naqshaday. Labadaba waa la saxsan karaa.`,advance_p1:`<strong>Qiyaastii kala badh codadka Alberta oo dhan hadda waxay yimaadaan ka hor maalinta doorashada</strong>: codbixinta hore, goobaha codbixinta guuraaga ah, warqadaha codbixinta gaarka ah. Elections Alberta waxay natiijooyinkan u soo sheegtaa wadar ahaan qayb doorasho kasta, ma aha Aag Codbixin (Voting Area) gaar ah. Sidaa darteed qiyaastii 395,000 cod oo NDP iyo UCP ah oo la dhiibtay 2023 laguma xidhi karo xaafad khariidad ku taal. Waa la tiriyaa. Laakiin lama garan karo meeshay ka yimaadeen. Codbixiye kasta oo hore waxa lagu hubiyaa liiska codbixiyayaasha ka hor inta aan la siin warqadda codbixinta, liiskaasina wuxuu codbixiye kasta ku xidhaa Aag Codbixin gaar ah. Daabacaadda wadarta codadka hore iyadoo loo kala saaray Aag Codbixin uma baahna wax isbeddel ah oo habka codbixinta ah. Kaliya waxa Elections Alberta soo sheegto ayaa isbeddelaya.`,advance_p2:`Tani waxay saamaysaa xubnaha guddida sidoo kale, ma aha oo keliya falanqeeyayaasha dibadda. Marka guddi go'aaminayso in Airdrie la ilaaliyo iyadoo dhan ama la kala qaybiyo, in marin u dhexeeya laba bulsho uu macno samaynayo, in xuduud la soo jeediyay ay kala qaybinayso deegaan dabiici ah, waxay samaynaysaa go'aamo ku tiirsan ogaanshaha halka codbixiyayaashu ku nool yihiin. Xubnaha guddidu waxay ka shaqeeyaan isla xogta la daabacay ee qof kasta. Iyaguna waxa ka maqan kala badh calaamadda juquraafi, oo ku saabsan isla bulshooyinka ay xudduudaha u sawirayaan.`,lesser_slave_p1:`Ugu yaraan hal bulsho oo ku taal waqooyiga Alberta, farqigani waa mid dhammaystiran. Qaybta woqooyi ee qaybta doorashada Lesser Slave Lake <button class="ed-trigger" data-ed-name="Lesser Slave Lake">tus ↗</button> waxa ku yaal Aag Codbixin oo daboolaya 4,832 km&#178; — in ka badan afar meelood oo shan meel ah cabbirka Prince Edward Island — halkaas oo cod kasta oo 2023 la dhiibtay uu maray kooxda codbixinta guuraaga ah ee Elections Alberta. Doorashooyinka 844-taas deggane waxa lagu tiriyaa wadarta qaybta, laakiin laguma xidhi karo meel khariidadda ku taal. Natiijooyinka doorashada ee la daabacay, bulshadu gabi ahaanba waa qarsoon tahay.`,lesser_slave_p2:`Markii guddidu markii ugu horreysay ka fikirtay inay baabi'iso qaybta Lesser Slave Lake oo ay ku darto riding ka weyn, waxay ka shaqaynaysay iyadoo aan haysan xog cod oo juquraafi ah oo ka timid bulshooyinkaas. Ugu dambayntii way ilaalisay qaybta. Taasi waxay timid ka dib 80+ soo gudbin dadweyne, qaar badan oo ka yimid bulshooyinka Asaliga ah (Indigenous) ee qaybta woqooyi ee riding-ka, waxayna adeegsatay q. 15(2) ee <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> — qodobka u oggolaanaya ilaa afar riding oo fog, oo buuxiya ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shan shuruudood sida baaxadda, masaafada iyo jiritaanka kayd First Nations ama degsiimo M&#233;tis, inay yeeshaan dad ka yar celceliska gobolka ilaa 50%. Way gaadheen. Laakiin xogta hortooda taallay ma muujinayn cidda ku codaynaysa bulshooyinka ay go'aansanayeen inay ilaaliyaan.`,ebca_label:`QAYBTA 15(2) EBCA`,ebca_body:`Qaybta 15(2) ee <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> ee Alberta waa xukun ikhtiyaari ah oo u oggolaada guddiyada inay ilaaliyaan riding-yada yaryar — kuwa ka yar 25% hooseysa celceliska dadnimada gobolka — marka riding-ku buuxiyo ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shanta shuruudood ee gaar ah: (a) aag juquraafi oo ka badan 20,000 km², (b) masaafo ka badan 150 km Dhismaha Golaha Sharci dejinta ee wadada tooska ah ee ugu dhow, (c) manaaqiyad magaalo kasta oo ka badan 8,000 deggan, (d) joogitaanka kayd Hindiya ama dejin Métis, iyo (e) in riding-ku uu la guuriyo xuduud gobolka Alberta. Xukunku ma aha toos; guddidu waa in ay u xukumto in shuruudaha la buuxinayo. Lesser Slave Lake si madax-bannaan wuxuu buuxinayaa afarta ka mid ah shanta.`,rationale_p1:`Sababta ku-meel-gaadhka ah ee baabi'inta riding-ka waxay ahayd tirada dadka. Iyadoo leh qiyaastii 27,000 deggane, Lesser Slave Lake waxay ka hooseysaa celceliska gobolka qiyaastii 45%, una dhow sagxadda sharciga. Taasi waxay u muuqataa dabaqid toos ah oo xeerarka. Ma aha. Sharciga Alberta wuxuu guddiyada siiyaa awood cad oo ay ku ilaaliyaan riding-yada cabbirkoodu yar yahay marka ugu yaraan saddex ka mid ah shan shuruudood oo gaar ah ay khuseeyaan, Lesser Slave Lake-na waxay si madax-bannaan u buuxisaa afar ka mid ah. Baaxaddeedu waa 69,566 km² (shuruudda a, xadka 20,000 km²). Xuduudda ugu dhow waxay Golaha Sharci-dejinta uga fogtahay in ka badan 150 km waddo ahaan (shuruudda b). Magaalo riding-ka ku taal midna ma laha dad ka badan 8,000 (shuruudda c). Riding-ku wuxuu ka kooban yahay afar iyo toban kayd Indian (Indian reserves) iyo degsiimooyin M&#233;tis ah oo bulshooyinkoodu wadaagaan juquraafi woqooyi oo mid ah, ku tiirsanaan isku mid ah oo ay ku qabaan codbixinta guuraaga ah si ay gabi ahaanba u codeeyaan, iyo dan wadajir ah oo ah inay yeeshaan wakiil marka hore la xisaabtama waqooyiga Alberta (shuruudda d).`,rationale_p2:`Midaynta Mackenzie ee la soo jeediyay hoosteeda, codkaas wadajirka ah si joogto ah ayaa loogu milmi lahaa riding uu xisbiga kale ku guuleysto in ka badan laba jeer. Ma aha in bulshooyinkaasi isbeddeleen. Waa in khadadka ku wareegsan ay isbeddeleen. Afartaas shuruudood mid kastaa waa xaqiiqo sugan oo ku saabsan juquraafiga riding-ka, ma aha go'aan aragti. Wadajir ahaan waxay qeexayaan deegaan qodobka loo qoray inuu ilaaliyo: fog, ballaadhan, dad yar, oo ay ku nool yihiin bulshooyin aan danahooda matalaadeed laga akhrin karin tirooyinka dadka ee cayriinka ah. Saddex ayaa loo baahan yahay si loo qalmo. Lesser Slave Lake waxay leedahay afar. In yaraanta dadka loola dhaqmo sidii inay qasab ka dhigayso baabi'in waa akhris khaldan oo sharciga ah. Dib-u-noqoshada guddidu waxay ahayd dabaqid sax ah oo sharciga, ma aha tanaasul loo sameeyay cadaadis siyaasadeed.`,banff_p:`Waa kan dhinaca kale ee sheekada. Intii bulshooyinka Asaliga ah ee Lesser Slave Lake ay u halgamayeen in la tiriyo, xubnaha guddida ee diiday ayaa soo jeediyay in riding kale la ilaaliyo iyadoo loo fidinayo qaybta aan la degin ee Banff National Park. Guddoomiyaha guddidu laftiisu wuxuu ugu yeedhay "isku day niyad xun" oo lagu doonayo ilaalinta sharciga; odhaahdu waxay ku jirtaa warbixinta kama dambaysta ah ee rasmiga ah ee guddida. Hubinta ay hubintu samaysay ayaa wiiqaysa eedaas: qaybtu way u qalantaa q.&#x2009;15(2) xitaa iyadoo aan fidintaas lahayn. Hase yeeshee, khariidadda inta yar, ilaalin loo qoray bulshooyin fog oo dad ku nool yihiin ayaa lagu fidiyay dhul beer-qaran oo madhan. Bulshooyinkii loogu talagalay inay caawiso waxay ugu halgameen soo gudbinno dadweyne. Guddiga Lunty wuxuu wajahi doonaa isla go'aanka §&#x2009;15(2) bisha Noofembar, iyadoo aan sharci ku waajibinayn inuu qabto dhageysiyo dadweyne, oo aanay jirin dammaanad in 80-ka soo gudbin ee beddelay mawqifkii ku-meel-gaadhka ahaa ee guddida ay mar labaad yeelan doonaan isla miisaanka.`,census_p1:`<strong>Alberta waa inay sugto tirakoobka 2026 ka hor inta aanay sawirin khariidadda xigta.</strong> Kanada waxay dadkeeda tirisaa shantii sanaba mar. Tirakoobka 2026 waxa la qaaday May 2026, natiijooyinkiisa ugu horreeyana waxa la filayaa Febraayo 2027. Guddidii sawirtay khariidadaha hubintan lagu qiimeeyay waxay ku qasbanayd inay ka bilowdo tirakoobkii 2021, oo lagu cusboonaysiiyay qiyaasta gobolka ee Luulyo 2024: tirin horeba u ahayd afar sano jir markii khariidadaha la sawiray, oo laga yaabo inay noqoto afar iyo toban sano jir marka xudduudahaas la howlgab dhigo. Magaalooyinka si degdeg ah u koraya sida Airdrie iyo Chestermere waxay isbeddeli doonaan 40% ama ka badan muddadaas. Bulshooyinka miyiga ahi way yaraan doonaan. Khariidaddu waxay khaldanaan doontaa maalinta la isticmaalo. Isbeddel fudud oo lagu sameeyo <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em> wuxuu ku waajibin karaa in guddi kasta oo cusub la magacaabo oo keliya ka dib marka Statistics Canada ay soo saarto xogta aagagga faafinta (dissemination-area) ee ugu dambeysay ee tirakoobkii ka horreeyay. Natiijada: khariidado ka tarjumaya halka ay dadka Alberta dhab ahaan ku nool yihiin. Ma aha halkii ay ku noolaayeen toban sano ka hor.`,census_p2:`Guddiga Lunty wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa sharciga jira, kaas oo aan dhigin shuruud ku saabsan waqtiga tirakoobka, mana dib u dhigi karo keligiis wixii ka dambeeya waqtigiisa kama dambaysta ah ee Noofembar 2026. Taladani waxay khusaysaa wax-ka-beddel mustaqbalka lagu sameeyo <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>, ma aha habraaca hadda socda. Isku-dhacu waa dhab. Guddi lagu waajibiyay inuu khariidad keeno Noofembar wuxuu ka shaqaynayaa tirakoob markaas noqonaya shan sano jir. Magacaabidda xaddidaaddu way ka faa'iido badan tahay iska dhigidda inaanay jirin.`,closing:`Labadan midkoodna ma aha natiijo ku saabsan khariidadaha guddida hadda. Waa indha-indhayn ku saabsan nidaam ka dhigaya falanqaynta doorashada ee saxda ah mid ka adag inta loo baahan yahay, waxaana halkan loo soo bandhigay talooyin wax ku ool ah, ma aha gunaanad. Labaduba runtii waa la hagaajin karaa. Hagaajintoodu waxay guddi kasta oo mustaqbalka ah, iyo hubin kasta oo mustaqbalka ah, dhigi lahayd saldhig ka wanaagsan.`}},editorial_canada:{heading:`Macnaha: Kanada Way Kala Duwan Tahay — Iyo Isku Mid`,p1:`Kanada waxay u taagan tahay isla qoyska ah ee Mareykanka, Boqortooyada Midowday, iyo Australiya. Waxaan dooran karaa xubnaha hal-xubin ah oo ka timid degmooyin juquraafi ah hoos nidaamka kooxda ugu horreysa. Waxaan dib-u-sawinaa khadadka si joogto ah — federaalka kadib tirakoob kasta oo toban-sano ah, gobolyadana jadwalyo ku wareegsan. Waxaan ka dhaxalnay mishiinka aasaasiga ah ee isla xididdada Westminster. Halkan ma jiraan yaabab.`,p2:`Waxa Kanada ka gooniya waa tijaabada ay khadadku ka gudbi karaan.`,p3:`Sharciga dastuuriga ah ee Mareykanku, xeerka xidhan waa <em>qof mid, cod mid</em> — degmooyinku waa in ay leeyihiin dadnimo si saxna ugu siman sida macquulka ah, ka leexashada waaweyn oo xaddaadeysa xaddaad adag. Sharciga dastuuriga ah ee Kanada, xeerka xidhan waa mid ka duwan. Qaybta 3 ee <em>Axdiga Xuquuqaha iyo Xorriyadaha Kanada</em> waxay dammaanad qaaddaa muwaadin kasta xaqa codaynta. <em>Tixraaca Xudduudaha Doorashada Gobolka (Sask.)</em> — Tixraacii Saskatchewan 1991-kii, kiiskii hogaanka — Maxkamadda Sare ee Kanada waxay u tarjumeen xaqa sida xaq u helitaan <em>matalaad waxtar leh</em>, ma aha xaq u helitaan sinaanta tirakoobka ee dadnimada degmooyinka.`,p4:`Farqigaas wuxuu muhiim yahay. Matalaadda waxtarku waxay u oggolaataa dadnimada degmooyinka inay kala duwanaadaan, mararka qaarkoodna si weyn, marka ay jiraan sababood: juquraafi miyiga ah oo bal ah oo MLA kaligiis aanuu si macquul ah ugu adeegi karin heerka celceliska dadnimada, bulshooyinka danta iska leh ee la joojin lahaa, matalaadda dadka tirada yar ee sinaanta tirakoobka ay la tiriweysaa. Tixraacii Saskatchewan wuxuu ka dhigay sidaas ikhtiyaarka dastuuriga. Kala-duwanaanshaha dadnimada 25% ee EBCA — xeerka ilaaliya kursiyada miyiga ee Alberta — si toos ah ayuu uga soo baxay.`,p5:`Caqabadu waxay jirtaa in ikhtiyaarku labada dhinac ka gooyo. Haddii guddi si sax ah ka leexan karo sinaanta dadnimada sababood saxsan, sidoo kale wuxuu ka leexan karaa sinaanta dadnimada sababood khaldan. Sharciga Kanada ma lahan dabaqada tirakoobka ee Mareykanku ku fiirsado. Waxay leedahay tijaabada matalaadda waxtarka, oo ay kaga xukumaan garsoorayaasha, kadib xaqiiqda, dacwadaha. Inta badan maxkuumadaha waxay ka difaacan yihiin sababaha khaldan iyadoo leh ilaalinta qaab-dhismeed: heer federaal, guddiyada dib-u-qaybintu waxaa ka xorriyay xeerka, xudduudahooduna waxay dhaqan-galaan iyada oo loo marayo amar matalaad (representation order), iyada oo aan jirin cod baarlamaaneed oo lagu ansixiyo. Quebec ayaa ugu fog tagta — guddigeeda joogtada ah ee madax-bannaan ayaa lafteeda dejiya khariidadda kama-dambaysta ah, iyada oo aan jirin cod Golaha Qaran oo lagu ansixiyo ama lagaga noqdo. Xitaa British Columbia, oo Golaheeda Sharci dejintu uu u codeeyo ansixinta soo jeedinnada guddida oo uu sharci ku dejiyo, waxay u aragtaa ansixinta shaqada guddida madax-bannaan inay tahay caadada halkii ay ka beddeli lahayd khariidad u gaar ah.`,p6:`Alberta waa ka-goosatada. Hoos <em>Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada</em>, warbixinta guddida waa talo kaliya — golaha sharci dejintu waa in uu u codinayaa si uu u ansixiyo. Ansixintu si caadi ahaan waxay noqotaa kaliya hababka. Wareegga 2026, guddidu waxay u kala qaybsantay 3–2 waxayna soo saartay laba soo jeedin oo tartanaysa; golaha sharci dejintu waxay abuurtay guddi MLA ah oo gooni ah, oo uu guddoominayo MLA UCP ah, si ay u doorato u dhexeeya. Wax ka mid ah sharciga dastuuriga Kanada ma uu baahan guddi inuu jiro. Wax ma ka baahan doorashadeeda inay raacdo habraaca guddida. Kani waa farqiga qaab-dhismeed ee hubintani baadhineyso.`,p7:`Sidaa darteed marka garsoorayaasha Kanada ay yiraahdaan "gerrymander" ma aha eraybixintooda sharciga, ma dhehayaan fikradda aasaasiga ah ee halkan ma dabaqan. Waxay dhehayaan tijaabadu way kala duwan tahay — matalaad waxtar leh, ma aha sinaanta tirakoobka. In soo jeedinta laga yar yahay ay buuxiso tijaabadaas waa saxda ah su'aasha hubintani ku cabbiray juquraafiga, iyo saxda ah su'aasha oo keliya garsoore si gunaanad ah uga jawaabi karo. Macnaha <em>Tixraacii Saskatchewan</em> oo dhammaystiran, isbarbardhigga gobolada kale, su'aasha xaqa wax dacwin kara, iyo jidadka isbeddel ee la heli karo waxaa lagu xusay <a href="#references">qaybta tixraacyada hoose</a>.`},chrome:{back_to_top:`Ku noqo sare`,license_title:`Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0`,license_alt:`CC BY-NC-SA 4.0`,license_aria:`Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0`,back_to_stakes:`↑ Ku noqo Khataraha`,lightbox:{fig_aria:`Sawirka weynaaday oo la balaariyay`,fig_close_aria:`Xidh sawirka weynaaday (Esc)`,map_aria:`Daawade kharito-soo-dhoweyste`,map_close_aria:`Xidh daawadaha khariidadda`,close_title:`Xidh (Esc)`},participation:{heading:`Naga caawi in aan horumarinno MapExplorer`,body:`Inta aad baadhineyso, waxaan raadineynaa khariidadaha iyo degmooyinka aad booqato oo si joogto ah u dirno xogta saldhiggeenna cilmibaadha. Wadaagida muuqaal sidoo kale waxay keydinaysaa halka aad ku dhammaatay. Ujeedada: fahmida waxa waxtar u yahay oo aaladda ka wanaajinta.`,no_collect:`Marna ma ururino magacaaga, cinwaanka IP-gaaga, ama goobta saxda ah. Wax kasta waxaa lagu magacawalay browser-kaaga ka hor inta aanay tegi. Ma ku garan karno adiga xogta xitaa haddii la amro.`,dnt:`Browser-kaagu wuxuu hayaa Do Not Track la-aasaasayey. Maya waa horay loogu doortay adiga magacaaga. Weli waxaad dooran kartaa Haa.`,no_thanks:`Maya, mahadsanid`,yes_help:`Haa, waan caawin doonaa`,privacy_policy:`Siyaasadda garaadnimada`},share:{button:`Wadaag`,button_title:`Wadaag ama soo geli dejinta khariidadda`,dialog_aria:`Wadaag dejinta khariidadda`,close_aria:`Xidh baraha wadaagga`,share_label:`Wadaag dejintan`,share_hint:`Koodhkaan ku qor browser kasta oo socodsiinaya hubinta si aad u geliso dejintan. Koodhku marna laguma dhejin URL.`,load_label:`Geli dejin`,load_btn:`Geli`,load_placeholder:`alpine-eagle-banff`,copy:`Nuqul`,copied:`La nuqlay!`,copy_failed:`Guuldarro`,unrecognised:`Koodh aan la garanayn — hubso higaanka.`},map:{minority:`Inta yar`,majority:`Inta badan`,current:`Hadda`,wasted:`La khasaariyay`,wasted_title:`Tabarucida farqiga waxtarka ee degmo kasta`,partisan:`Xisbiyeed`,partisan_title:`Midab kasta oo degmo ah sida natiijada xisbiyeed (UCP buluug / NDP oranje)`,borders:`Xudduudaha`,flagged:`La calaamadeeyay`,flagged_title:`Dhammaan 7 dejimada ee uu calaamadeeyay guddoomiyaha guddida Garsoore Miller — si toos ah ugu wareegta khariidadda laga yar yahay`,help_aria:`Caawimada khariidadda`,help_title:`Sida loo isticmaalo khariidadda`,pin_aria:`Xidh Khariidadda`,pin_title:`Xidh Khariidadda — ka hortag auto-pan marka la gujin degmada`,search_aria:`Hel degmo doorasho`,search_placeholder:`Raadi degmo…`,zoom_aria:`Zooming khariidadda`,clear_aria:`Nadiifi xulashada degmada`,clear_title:`Nadiifi xulashada`,va_hint:`Guji gudaha degmadaan si aad u aragto natiijooyinka xarunta codbixinta`,va_close_aria:`Xidh faahfaahinta xarunta codbixinta`,va_close_title:`Xidh`,object_title:`Khariidadda degmada doorashada Alberta — qalabka ugu sarreeya`,ea_credit:`Xogta khariidadda:`,cc_title:`Waxa qoraalka ah: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0`,cc_alt:`Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0`,votes_suffix:`codo`,total_votes_suffix:`wadarta codadka`,pop_prefix:`Dad.`,voting_areas_suffix:`aagagga codbixinta`,other_maps:`Khariidadaha kale`,unique_boundary:`Xuduud u gaar ah khariidaddaan`,in_person_votes:`codad shakhsi ahaan (baaqida Vote Anywhere kama jiraan)`,load_error_generic:`Ma soo geli karin khariidadda xudduudaha. Isku day in aad dib u soo rareyso bogga.`,load_error_map:`Ma soo geli karin khariidadda {key} — hubso xiriirkaaga.`,context_minority:`Soo jeedinta laga yar yahay 2026 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,context_majority:`Soo jeedinta inta badan 2026 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,context_2019:`Xudduudaha la dhaqan-geliyay 2019 · natiijooyinka doorashada 2023`,tag_min:`Yar`,tag_maj:`Badan`,tag_2019:`2019`,dev_notice:`Map Explorer wuxuu ku jiraa horumarinno tooska ah oo joogta ah oo mararka qaarkood jabi kara. Haddii wax khaldan muuqato, dhawr maalmood ka dib soo noqo — dhibaatooyinku sida caadiga ah waxay xalloobi doonaan. Soo jeedinnadu waa la soo dhawaynayaa: %s.`,dev_notice_email_label:`ii soo emayl`,dev_notice_dismiss:`Iska dhaaf ogeysiiska horumarinta`,skel_1:`Soo gelin Map Explorer…`,skel_2:`sawirida Alberta…`,skel_3:`xisaabaynta tirooyinka…`,skel_4:`tirinaynta codad kasta…`,skel_5:`sawirida xudduudaha…`,skel_6:`ku dhow dhammaadka…`},map_intro:{heading:`Sida loo isticmaalo khariidadda`,click_district:`Guji degmo kasta`,click_district_desc:`arag natiijooyinka doorashada 2023 oo uga bood`,click_within:`Guji gudaha degmada la doortay`,click_within_desc:`arag natiijooyinka xarunta codbixinta ee gaar ah (midab = kala-qaybinta codka)`,dblclick:`Laba jeer guji degmo`,dblclick_desc:`zoom si aad shaashadda u buuxiso; laba jeer guji meel banaan si aad dib u xoogtid`,layers_primary:`Inta yar / Inta badan / Hadda`,layers_primary_desc:`bedel khariidadda xudduudaha firfircoon`,layers_data:`Xisbiyeed / La khasaariyay / Xudduudaha`,layers_data_desc:`bedel lakabada xogta`,search:`Raadi degmo`,search_desc:`u bood magac; furaha fallaadha waxay saarayaan, + / − zoom`,escape:`Bax`,escape_desc:`xidh daawadahaan`,s4_tip:`§4, guji <em>Muuji degmooyinka la calaamadeeyay khariidadda</em> si aad u iftiimiso kala-qaybinta Airdrie iyo aagga woqooyi-bari/dhexe Calgary.`,got_it:`Si fiican ayaan u fahmay`},footer:{title:`Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta — May 2026`,copyright:`© Will Conner 2026 —`,text_label:`Qoraal:`,code_label:`Kood:`,translation_label:`Turjumaadaha:`,translation_credit:`Anthropic Fable 5 (AI) — sugeysa dib-u-eegis qof af-hoosiis ah`,data_credit:`Xogta khariidadda: waddooyinka labaad ee laga keenay National Road Network, © Statistics Canada (Open Government Licence – Canada); waddooyinka kale & biyaha © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); xudduudaha & natiijooyinka © Elections Alberta.`}},explorer:{controls:{panel_title:`Xakamayaha khariidadda`,close_aria:`Xidh khariidadda`,map_version_hdr:`Nooca khariidadda`,map_version_hint:`· guji si aad u beddesho`,map_toggle_title:`Beddel khariidaddan dami/shidid`,map_minority:`Inta yar`,map_majority:`Inta badan`,map_2019:`Rasmi`,map_minority_short:`Yar`,map_majority_short:`Badan`,map_2019_short:`Rasmi`,search_placeholder:`Raadi degmo…`,search_aria:`Raadi degmooyinka`,search_clear_aria:`Nadiifi raadinta`,search_in:`gudaha {ed}`,zoom_aria:`Zooming`,res_prefix:`1 pixel ≈`,zoom_official:`(Rasmi)`,zoom_computed:`(La xisaabiyay)`,overlays_hdr:`Dul-saarrada Danta Bulshada`,layer_highways:`Waddooyinka waaweyn`,layer_water:`Webiyada & harooyinka`,layer_annotations:`EBC '26 Annotations`,mobile_map_version_aria:`Nooca khariidadda`,mobile_search_aria:`Raadi degmooyinka`,mobile_layers_aria:`Lakabyada khariidadda`,mobile_info_aria:`Ku saabsan khadadka xudduudaha`,mobile_share_aria:`La wadaag aragtidan`,mobile_close_aria:`Xidh khariidadda`,lang_aria:`Beddel luuqadda`,lang_hdr:`Luuqad`,lines_note_title:`Akhrinta khadadka`,lines_note_lead:`Qaab kasta oo cajiib ah ama khad kala-qaybin ah waa`,lines_note_emphasis:`doorasho ula kac ah oo guddi samaysay`,lines_note_tail:`— ma aha khalad xog. Khadadku waxay raacaan cidhifyada aagagga codbixinta; halka laba khariidadood isku raacaan waxay ku saaran yihiin isla khadka, halka ay kala tagaanna soo jeedimuhu dhab ahaan way kala duwan yihiin.`},share:{button:`La wadaag aragtidan`,heading:`La wadaag aragtidan`,copy:`Koobi link-ga`,copied:`La koobiyay`,help:`Link-gani wuxuu qabsadaa khariidaddaada hadda, dul-saarrada, iyo aragtida.`,open_heading:`Fur link la wadaagay`,open_placeholder:`Ku dhaji link la wadaagay…`,open_btn:`Fur`,err_empty:`Ku dhaji link la wadaagay`,err_invalid:`Ma aha link la wadaagay oo sax ah`},tip:{total_votes:`wadarta codadka`,inperson_votes:`codad qof-ahaaneed`,ed_total:`Wadarta degmada: {n} codad`,ed_total_eday:`Wadarta degmada: {n} (maalinta doorashada)`,poll:`Goob #{id} · codad qof-ahaaneed`,ucp_pct:`UCP {u}%`,ndp_pct:`NDP {n}%`,unassigned:`(aan loo qoondayn)`,where_in:`gudaha {community}`,where_near:`agagaarka {community}`,note_sparse:`Aag dad yar ku nool — codad yar oo halkan laga dhiibtay awgood, midabku wuxuu u dhowaadaa saldhigga dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,note_no_votes:`Cod lama diiwaan-gelin halkan, sidaa darteed aaggani wuxuu muujiyaa midabka dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,no_one_title:`Halkan qofna kuma codeeyo`,no_one_body:`Qaybin codbixin ma daboosho meeshan — qofna lama diiwaan-gelin inuu halkan ku nool yahay ama ku codeeyo, sidaa darteed waxay sii ahaanaysaa midabka dhexdhexaadka ah ee khariidadda.`,flag_link:`Guji si aad u soo dhoweyso`},miller:{title:`Talada 5(d): kursiga miyiga ee dib loo soo celinayo`,body:`Garsoore Dallas Miller, guddoomiyaha guddida, wuxuu qoray in haddii Golaha Sharci-dejintu aanu aqbalin luminta laba riding oo miyi ah, ay tahay inuu 89 kursi ka dhigo 91 oo uu dib u soo celiyo. Tani waa meesha keliya ee uu u magacaabay kursi dib loo soo celiyay: riding inta badan ka kooban Clearwater County iyo galbeedka Mountain View County, oo leh xaaladda q. 15(2) (xeerka u oggolaanaya riding ballaadhan oo fog inuu yeesho dad aad uga yar celceliska). Wuxuu codsaday in laga fiirsado, ma aha in la waajibiyo. Muuqaalku waa qiyaas: Clearwater County iyo qaybta Mountain View County ee ku jirtay riding-ka Rimbey-Rocky Mountain House-Sundre ee 2019. Wuxuu gebi ahaanba ku yaal woqooyiga Airdrie, mana qaato dhul ka mid ah riding ay ilaaliyaan shuruudaha (a) ama (b). Meel uma magacaabin kursiga labaad.`},flags:{"banff-town":{title:`Banff — magaalada laga gooyay beeyada`,body:`Banff waxay ku taal beey qaran federaal ah, sida jasiirad magaalo yar. Inta yar waxay magaalada la kooxeysaa Canmore — magaalada xigta ee Bow Valley — ee "Canmore-Kananaskis," waxayna ka tagaa beeyada aan la deganayn sida riding-ka qaada magaca Banff. Xuduudku wuxuu duubaa magaalada maxaa yeelay waa meesha kaliya ee dad ku nool yihiin mayl badan. Waxay u eg tahay khalad, laakiin waxay raacdaa juquraafi dhab ah.`},"banff-park":{title:`Waqooyiga Banff — "Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park"`,body:`"Rocky Mountain House–Banff Park" waa mid ka mid ah riding-yada la soo jeediyay ee inta yar, oo inta badan ka kooban beey qaran oo aan la deganayn; magaalada Banff waxay ku taal riding deris ah oo koonfur ah. Inta yar waxay ku dabaqday xukunka dadnimo-yar ee Sharciga Guddida Xudduudaha Doorashada riding-kan — doorasho uu guddoomiyaha guddidu kaga hadlay warbixinta kama-dambaysta ah.`},"airdrie-split":{title:`Airdrie — afar jeexan`,body:`Koritaanka Airdrie iyo safarkeeda shaqo ee Calgary (qiyaastii 76% dadka u safra meel ka baxsan) waxay xajin kari lahaayeen hal kursi oo cusub oo aagga Airdrie ah — nooca xogtu taageerto. Inta yar taa beddelkeeda waxay magaalada u kala qaybisaa afar riding; xisaabta dadku uma baahna, soo gudbin midna ma soo jeedin. Imtixaanka calaamadda jeexitaanka ee hubinta, kala-qaybintan afarta-geesoodka ahi ma gaadho calaamad rasmi ah: meelaha ka baxsan Airdrie East, oo haysa in ka badan kala badh magaalada, dadka Airdrie waxay noqdaan kuwo laga badan yahay, laakiin imtixaanku wuxuu u baahan yahay in laga badnaado qayb kasta. Tani waa kala-qaybin bulsho, oo aan u muuqan imtixaannada caddaaladda xisbiyeed; hubintu waxay cabbirtaa saamaynta qaab-dhismeed, ma aha ujeeddada. (Cilmiyeed §5.3.2.)`},"nolan-hill-cochrane":{title:`Calgary-Nolan Hill–Cochrane`,body:`Safarka shaqo ee Cochrane ee Calgary wuxuu caddayn kari lahaa in lagu lammeeyo magaalada — laakiin xogta safarka-shaqada ee 2021 waxay socodkaas ku faafisaa magaalada oo dhan (qiyaastii saddex meelood meel shaqaalaha; kala badh waxay ka shaqeeyaan Cochrane gudaheeda) mana tilmaanto Nolan Hill. Marinka cidhiidhiga ah ee inta yar ee waaxda Nolan Hill — qaabka guddoomiyuhu ugu yeedhay lasso — wuu ka fog yahay xogta, soo gudbin midna ma soo jeedin. Imtixaanka jeexitaanka ee hubintu ma calaamadeeyo: Cochrane way dhan tahay oo waxay ka dhigan tahay qiyaastii saddex meelood laba meel riding-ka, qiyaastii 34,000-na aad bay ugu yar tahay kursi u gaar ah. (Cilmiyeed §5.3.2.)`},"olds-airdrie-reach":{title:`Olds–Three Hills–Didsbury — gaadhitaanka Airdrie`,body:`Riding miyi ah oo isku haya magaalooyinka Highway 2 — Olds, Didsbury, Three Hills — si fiican ayaa loo taageeray; dadka aagga Beiseker qoraal ayay ku taageereen. Wuxuu ku ekaan kari lahaa bulshooyinkaas. Nooca inta yar taa beddelkeeda wuxuu u fidaa koonfur ilaa cidhifka woqooyi ee Airdrie, fidin aanay xisaabta dadku u baahnayn. Gaadhitaanku waa qayb ka mid ah sida kala-qaybinta afarta-geesoodka ah ee Airdrie u shaqayso — xarig khafiif ah oo magaalada ka mid ah, qiyaastii 350 qof, oo lagu milmiyay kursi miyi ah oo ka weyn — taas oo hubintu u akhrido qayb ka mid ah qaabka jeexitaanka. (Cilmiyeed §5.3.2.)`},chestermere:{title:`Chestermere — u kala qaybsan laba riding`,body:`Safarka shaqo ee badan ee Chestermere ee Calgary (86% dadka u safra meel ka baxsan) wuxuu taageeri kari lahaa in la ilaaliyo iyadoo dhan oo u dhow magaalada — taas oo dadkii diiday ku-biiritaanka Calgary ay sidoo kale rabeen. Inta yar taa beddelkeeda waxay qayb koonfureed u jeexdaa degmo Calgary gaar ah oo aanay la wadaagin dugsiyo ama gaadiid dadweyne, qaybtaasina waxay ku dhacdaa imtixaanka tirada dadka. Hubintu waxay daadashada degmo Calgary u tirisaa kala-qaybin dano-bulsho oo khafiifisa codka Chestermere; kuma qiimeyn imtixaanka jeexitaanka. (Cilmiyeed §5.8.4; imtixaannada caddaynta, Imtixaanka 5.)`},"red-deer":{title:`Red Deer — riding-yada hybrid-ka ah`,body:`Xidhiidhka gobolka ee Red Deer ee Blackfalds, Sylvan Lake, Lacombe iyo Innisfail wuxuu kooxeyn karayey magaalooyinkaas wadajir — xubin golaha magaalada iyo deganeyaal ayaa soo jeediyay hybrid la mid ah. Nooca inta yar wuxuu taas beddelkeeda qaybo magaalada lafteeda ku laabaa riding-yo magaalo-yar ay hoggaaminayaan, oo nuugaya codka Red Deer magaaleed; sababtiisa "iskuulada la wadaago" sidoo kale ma taagna (qaybinta iskuul oo kala duwan). Laabista magaalo riding-yo magaalo-yar ay hoggaaminayaan waa qaabka hubintu u tilmaanto hybridization — oo la jaan-qaadaya jeexitaan, oo gaadha saamaynta xisbiyeed gudaha riding-yada hybrid-ka ah halkii ay ka dhex gaadhi lahayd. (Acadeemig §5.3.5.)`},"st-albert":{title:`St. Albert — qaabab iska tartamaya`,body:`Nooca khariidad kasta ee St. Albert wuxuu ku saleysnaan karaa aasaas macquul ah. Hubintu si fudud waxay heshay soo gudbin aan taageereyn beddelka gaarka ah ee inta yar — maadaama muwaadiniinta naadiroobto ay magacaabaan xudduudaha saxda ah ee guddida, waxay caddaynta halkan u akhrida mid khafiif ah, oo aan si cad u taageereyn ama ka soo horjeeneyn.`},"calgary-zone-a-packing":{title:`Waqooyi & bari Calgary — calaamad urursi`,body:`Guddoomiyaha guddidu midkan ma uusan calaamadayn — xisaabta hubinta lafteeda ayaa sameysa. Waqooyi iyo bari Calgary (hubinta "Zone A," waqooyi iyo bari Webiga Bow), degmooyinka khariidadda inta yar waxay ka weyn yihiin celceliska gobolka qiyaastii 11.5%, marka loo eego 2.8% khariidadda inta badan. Urursi macnaheedu waa ku urursida codbixiyayaasha hal dhinac degmooyin yar oo ka weyn, sidaa darteed kaadi kastoodu wax yar bay miisaamaan; Zone A waa NDP-tartan, 13 ka mid ah 17 degmo waxaa ku guulaystay NDP 2023. Hubintu waxay cabbirtaa saamaynta qaab-dhismeed, ma aha niyada. (Acadeemig §5.3.1.)`}},text:{page_title:`Nooca qoraal ah — khariidadda Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta`,intro:`Tani waa nooca qoraal ah ee khariidadda firfircoon ee hubinta. Waxay sidaa isla macluumaadka khariidadda muuqaalka ah, oo loo qoray si loogu akhriyo qalab akhris-shaashad. Waxay ku bilaabataa xudduudaha hubintu calaamadaysay, ka dibna waxay liis-gareynaysaa degmo kasta iyo midkee khariidadood oo saddexda ah ay ku jirto.`,link_map:`Fur khariidadda firfircoon`,link_report:`Akhri warbixinta oo dhan`,link_to_text:`Fur nooca qoraal ee la heli karo ee khariidaddan`,toc_heading:`Boggan`,toc_summary:`Soo-koobid gaaban`,toc_flagged:`Xudduudaha la calaamadeeyay`,toc_directory:`Tusaha degmooyinka`,summary_heading:`Soo-koobid gaaban`,summary_p1:`Hubintu waxay is barbar dhigtaa saddex khariidadood oo ah degmooyinka doorashada Alberta: soo jeedinta inta-yar ee guddida, soo jeedinta inta-badan, iyo khariidadda la dejiyay ee 2019 oo maanta shaqaynaysa.`,summary_p2:`Tijaabooyinka qaab-dhismeedka ee hubintu hore u diiwaan-gelisay, oo isticmaala juquraafi keliya, khariidadda inta-badan midna kama gudbiso shantii xad, khariidadda inta-yarna afar shan ka mid ah ayey ka gudubtaa. Natiijooyinka tirakoobka ee kala-duwan, oo midkasta khariidadood ku barbar dhiga koox weyn oo khariidado dhexdhexaad ah oo kombuyuutar ku sawiray, waa kuwo bilow ah oo sugaya dib-u-eegis madax-bannaan oo khabiir ah.`,summary_p3:`Qaybaha hoose waxay sharxayaan sagaal xudduud oo gaar ah oo hubintu calaamadaysay, ka dibna waxay liis-gareynayaan degmo kasta. Boggani wuxuu qeexayaa booska tirakoobka iyo qaab-dhismeedka keliya. Gabagabo sharci ah kama gaadho khariidad kasta.`,flagged_heading:`Xudduudaha la calaamadeeyay`,flagged_lead:`Hubintu waxay calaamadaysay sagaal xudduud. Qaar way u muuqdaan kuwo cajiib ah laakiin si daacad ah ayey u raacaan juquraafi dhab ah; qaar kalena waxay la mid yihiin qaab urursi ama jeexitaan oo ku jira cabbiraadaha hubinta lafteeda. Mid kasta hoose ayaa lagu sharxay, oo leh tixraac qayb oo loo gudbiyo warbixinta acadeemiga ah meesha ay khusayso.`,directory_heading:`Tusaha degmooyinka`,directory_lead:`Shaxdani waxay liis-gareynaysaa magac kasta oo degmo oo ka soo muuqda mid kasta oo saddexda khariidadood ah, oo ku kala horreeya alifbeeto. Magac kasta waxay muujinaysaa in magacaasi qayb ka yahay soo jeedinta inta-yar, soo jeedinta inta-badan, iyo khariidadda la dejiyay ee 2019. Magacyada degmooyinku way ku kala duwan yihiin khariidadaha, sidaa darteed saf qaar waxay ka soo muuqdaan hal ama laba oo kaliya. Shaxdu waxay haysataa magacyada iyo xubinnimada khariidadda keliya — wadarta codadka, tirooyinka dadnimada, iyo natiijooyinka tijaabada, fiiri warbixinta oo dhan.`,directory_totals_note:`Tiro kasta waa wadarta codadka qof-ahaaneed (maalinta doorashada) ee degmadu ku lahayd khariidaddaas — isugeynta goobaheeda codbixinta. Codadka hore iyo kuwa gaarka ah looma qoondeeyo aag codbixin kasta, sidaa darteed halkan kuma jiraan; natiijooyinka oo dhammeystiran eeg warbixinta. Jeexitaan (—) wuxuu ka dhigan yahay in magaca degmadu uusan ka soo muuqan khariidaddaas.`,col_district:`Degmo`,col_minority:`Soo jeedinta inta-yar`,col_majority:`Soo jeedinta inta-badan`,col_2019:`Khariidadda rasmiga ah`,present_yes:`Haa`,present_no:`Maya`,methodology_note:`Boggani waa u dhigma khariidadda firfircoon oo go’an oo qoraal-kaliya ah. Waxaa laga dhisay isla xogta degmooyinka iyo isla calaamadaynta xudduudaha. Natiijooyinka tirakoobka (ensemble-dhexdhexaad) ee halkan lagu tixraacay waa kuwo bilow ah oo sugaya dib-u-eegis madax-bannaan oo khabiir ah.`,skip_to_main:`U bood nuxurka ugu weyn`,back_to_map:`Ku noqo khariidadda firfircoon`}},feedback:{nav_link:`Dir jawaab-celin`,page_title:`Dir jawaab-celin`,meta_description:`La wadaag sax, su’aal, ama soo jeedin ku saabsan Hubinta Xudduudaha Doorashada Alberta.`,heading:`Dir jawaab-celin`,intro:`Ma aragtay khalad, su’aal ma qabtaa, ama ma rabtaa inaad soo jeediso hagaajin? Tani waxay si toos ah u gaadhaysaa qoraaga. Magaca iyo iimaylka waa ikhtiyaari — kaliya ka tag iimayl haddii aad jeclaan lahayd jawaab.`,name_label:`Magaca`,name_optional:`ikhtiyaari`,name_placeholder:`Magacaaga`,email_label:`Iimayl`,email_optional:`ikhtiyaari`,email_placeholder:`you@example.com`,email_hint:`Kaliya waxaa loo isticmaalaa in laguugu jawaabo. Marna lama wadaago, marnana lagama daro liis kasta.`,message_label:`Fariin`,message_required:`loo baahan yahay`,message_placeholder:`Maxaad noo sheegi lahayd?`,submit:`Dir jawaab-celin`,submitting:`Waa la dirayaa…`,success_title:`Mahadsanid`,success_body:`Jawaab-celintaada waa la helay. Haddii aad ka tagtay cinwaan iimayl ah oo fariintaaduna u baahan tahay jawaab, waad maqli doontaa.`,send_another:`Mid kale dir`,error_empty:`Fadlan geli fariin ka hor inta aanad dirin.`,error_rate:`Waxaad dhawaan dirtay fariimo dhowr ah. Fadlan isku day mar kale wax yar ka dib.`,error_generic:`Wax baa qaldamay markii la dirayay jawaab-celintaada. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqad gudaheed.`,privacy_note:`Fariintaada si ammaan ah ayaa loogu kaydiyaa Canada waxaana loo isticmaalaa kaliya in lagu hagaajiyo hubintan. Eeg {privacy} faahfaahin.`,privacy_link_text:`siyaasadda asturnaanta`,back_to_report:`Ku noqo warbixinta`,back_to_map:`Ku noqo baadhaha khariidadda`}};export{e as default};